('36b694de-a9d8-52a0-9536-6e54bf21b2cc', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '17af84a9-1edb-5e93-b6a7-4761f015a5e1', 'a27e82c9-4c42-5166-9805-5970eaa50421', 'responsibility', '/rɪˌspɒnsəˈbɪləti/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Nhiệm vụ hoặc bổn phận mà một người phải chịu.', 'something that it is your job or duty to deal with.', 'Each department head shares the responsibility of maintaining accurate financial records.', 'Mỗi trưởng bộ phận chia sẻ trách nhiệm duy trì hồ sơ tài chính chính xác.', '{\"en\": \"Managing the budget for the marketing campaign is the main responsibility of the director.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý ngân sách cho chiến dịch tiếp thị là trách nhiệm chính của giám đốc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-ljspeech-0cbd2645.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-cori-0cbd2645.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/responsibility-b1f74d53.webp', '[\"duty\", \"obligation\", \"liability\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"nhận trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"primary responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"duty\", \"note_vi\": \"duty là nghĩa vụ bắt buộc, responsibility rộng hơn, bao gồm cả sự tự chủ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"responsible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-cori-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru0-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru5-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru6-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru10-0cbd2645.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru9-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru3-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru7-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru8-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-aru2-0cbd2645.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-ljspeech-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt408-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt138-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt624-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt396-0cbd2645.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt498-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt132-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt288-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt42-0cbd2645.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/responsibility-lt90-0cbd2645.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc phổ biến: have a responsibility to do something hoặc for something.', 'hr', 1, 2),
('e4a688e6-a80f-52fe-a694-96699bbd4220', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '17af84a9-1edb-5e93-b6a7-4761f015a5e1', 'a27e82c9-4c42-5166-9805-5970eaa50421', 'compare', '/kəmˈpeə(r)/', 'A2', 'verb', 'So sánh, đối chiếu.', 'to examine two or more things to see how they are similar or different.', 'It\'s interesting to compare the different cultures of these two countries.', 'Thật thú vị khi so sánh các nền văn hóa khác nhau của hai quốc gia này.', '{\"en\": \"You should compare prices from different suppliers before placing a bulk order.\", \"vi\": \"Bạn nên so sánh giá từ các nhà cung cấp khác nhau trước khi đặt hàng số lượng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-ljspeech-b64ca250.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-cori-b64ca250.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compare-b58923e3.webp', '[\"contrast\", \"match\", \"correlate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"compare A with B\", \"meaning\": \"so sánh A với B\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compare A to B\", \"meaning\": \"ví A như B\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compete\", \"note_vi\": \"cạnh tranh, thi đua với ai đó\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"comparison\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comparable\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"comparative\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-cori-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru0-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru5-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru6-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru10-b64ca250.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru9-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru3-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compare-aru7-b64ca250.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/co