('54420e05-128a-599c-958d-a204bf360e8c', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'database', 'UK: /ˈdeɪ.tə.beɪs/ | US: /ˈdeɪ.t̬ə.beɪs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'cơ sở dữ liệu', 'A structured set of computerized information that can be easily accessed, managed, and updated.', 'The customer database stores important information.', 'Cơ sở dữ liệu khách hàng lưu trữ thông tin quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"Employees can access the company database to retrieve client record history.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên có thể truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu của công ty để lấy lịch sử hồ sơ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/database-64bf5857.webp', '[\"databank\", \"repository\", \"archive\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"access a database\", \"meaning\": \"truy cập cơ sở dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"update the database\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật cơ sở dữ liệu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-cori-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru0-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru5-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru6-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru10-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru9-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru3-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru7-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru8-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-aru2-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-ljspeech-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt408-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt138-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt624-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt396-6d613a1e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt498-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt132-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt288-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt42-6d613a1e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/database-lt90-6d613a1e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Database\' viết liền thành một từ. Thường đi với các động từ \'access\' (truy cập), \'update\' (cập nhật), \'maintain\' (bảo trì).', 'technology', 1, 1),
('638e5f6d-5f26-5059-9d9e-79cb2aa078db', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'perspective', '/pəˈspektɪv/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cách nhìn nhận hoặc đánh giá một tình huống, sự việc cụ thể.', 'a particular way of considering something or thinking about a situation.', 'Hiring an external consultant gave the board a fresh perspective on international expansion.', 'Việc thuê một cố vấn bên ngoài đã mang lại cho hội đồng quản trị một góc nhìn mới về việc mở rộng quốc tế.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing director offered a fresh perspective on how to attract new clients.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc tiếp thị đã đưa ra một góc nhìn mới mẻ về cách thu hút khách hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-ljspeech-aa6af31d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-cori-aa6af31d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perspective-ab144d08.webp', '[\"viewpoint\", \"standpoint\", \"outlook\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"from a perspective\", \"meaning\": \"từ một góc nhìn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a fresh perspective\", \"meaning\": \"góc nhìn mới mẻ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"prospective\", \"note_vi\": \"prospective nghĩa là tiềm năng, tương lai; perspective là góc nhìn.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-cori-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru0-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru5-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru6-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru10-aa6af31d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru9-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru3-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru7-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru8-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-aru2-aa6af31d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-ljspeech-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt408-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt138-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt624-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt396-aa6af31d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt498-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt132-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt288-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt42-aa6af31d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perspective-lt90-aa6af31d.mp3\"]}}', 'Dễ nhầm với \'prospective\' (tiềm năng). Nhớ \'per-\' là xuyên qua, nhìn thấu vấn đề.', 'business', 1, 2),
('4bbbd470-722a-55e8-9acd-92a9ba308c5a', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'disturb', '/dɪˈstɜːb/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Gây gián đoạn, làm phiền ai đó hoặc làm xáo trộn sự yên tĩnh.', 'to interrupt someone and stop them from continuing what they were doing before.', 'Please do not disturb me while I am working on this important report.', 'Xin đừng làm phiền tôi khi tôi đang làm báo cáo quan trọng này.', '{\"en\": \"Please do not disturb the staff while they are preparing the conference room for meetings.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng không làm phiền nhân viên trong khi họ đang chuẩn bị phòng họp cho các cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-ljspeech-f7b617c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-cori-f7b617c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/disturb-2d6134b8.webp', '[\"interrupt\", \"bother\"]', '[\"assist\", \"help\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"disturb someone\", \"meaning\": \"làm phiền ai\"}, {\"phrase\": \"disturb the peace\", \"meaning\": \"gây mất trật tự\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"disturbance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"disturbing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-cori-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru0-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru5-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru6-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru10-f7b617c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru9-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru3-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru7-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/disturb-aru8-f7b617c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronu