('127421aa-124a-5bd5-b253-21b446c68261', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'cone', 'UK: /kəʊn/ | US: /koʊn/', 'B2', 'noun', 'cọc tiêu chóp nón', 'A plastic pointed object used on roads to alert drivers or divert traffic.', 'Traffic cones were placed to redirect vehicles.', 'Cọc tiêu giao thông được đặt để định hướng lại các phương tiện.', '{\"en\": \"Orange traffic cones were placed along the lane to mark the road construction area.\", \"vi\": \"Các cọc tiêu chóp nón màu cam được đặt dọc theo làn đường để đánh dấu khu vực thi công đường.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-ljspeech-be60dc73.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-cori-be60dc73.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/cone-85217bef.webp', '[\"marker\", \"pylon\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"traffic cone\", \"meaning\": \"cọc tiêu giao thông\"}, {\"phrase\": \"safety cone\", \"meaning\": \"cọc chóp nón an toàn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"conical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-cori-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru0-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru5-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru6-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru10-be60dc73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru9-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru3-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru7-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru8-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-aru2-be60dc73.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-ljspeech-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt408-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt138-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt624-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt396-be60dc73.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt498-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt132-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt288-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt42-be60dc73.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/cone-lt90-be60dc73.mp3\"]}}', 'Hay xuất hiện trong TOEIC Part 1 (mô tả tranh giao thông/công trường): \'traffic cones\'.', 'travel', 1, 10),
('1f2b856d-49f3-5d16-bba9-713af0c815c8', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'compile', '/kəmˈpaɪl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thu thập và sắp xếp thông tin thành tài liệu.', 'to collect information from different sources to create a book or report.', 'The researchers had to compile data from various sources for their study.', 'Các nhà nghiên cứu phải tổng hợp dữ liệu từ nhiều nguồn khác nhau cho nghiên cứu của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The secretary will compile the financial figures into a final annual summary report.\", \"vi\": \"Thư ký sẽ biên soạn các số liệu tài chính thành một báo cáo tổng kết hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-ljspeech-36d0981b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-cori-36d0981b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/compile-9bb339b9.webp', '[\"assemble\", \"gather\", \"collect\"]', '[\"disperse\", \"scatter\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"compile data\", \"meaning\": \"thu thập và biên soạn dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"compile a report\", \"meaning\": \"biên soạn một báo cáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"compose\", \"note_vi\": \"compose là sáng tác nghệ thuật, compile là tổng hợp tài liệu\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"compilation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-cori-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru0-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru5-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru6-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru10-36d0981b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru9-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru3-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru7-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru8-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-aru2-36d0981b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-ljspeech-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt408-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt138-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt624-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt396-36d0981b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt498-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt132-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt288-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt42-36d0981b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/compile-lt90-36d0981b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh tổng hợp dữ liệu, báo cáo văn phòng.', 'office', 1, 11),
('8cbd2f42-6f1e-5fb9-9d5f-be621e131cd4', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'resolve', '/rɪˈzɒlv/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Giải quyết một vấn đề, mâu thuẫn hoặc khó khăn.', 'to find an acceptable solution to a problem, argument, or difficult situation.', 'We need to resolve this issue before it escalates into a bigger problem.', 'Chúng ta cần giải quyết vấn đề này trước khi nó leo thang thành một vấn đề lớn hơn.', '{\"en\": \"Our customer service team is working hard to resolve the technical issues with the website.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi đang nỗ lực giải quyết các vấn đề kỹ thuật với trang web.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-ljspeech-4e7a2084.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-cori-4e7a2084.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/resolve-5c0b332c.webp', '[\"settle\", \"solve\", \"fix\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"resolve a conflict\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết xung đột\"}, {\"phrase\": \"resolve a dispute\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết tranh chấp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solve\", \"note_vi\": \"solve thường dùng cho bài toán, resolve dùng cho mâu thuẫn phức tạp\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"resolution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-cori-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru0-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru5-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru6-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru10-4e7a2084.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru9-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru3-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru7-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru8-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-aru2-4e7a2084.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-ljspeech-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt408-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt138-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt624-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt396-4e7a2084.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt498-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt132-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt288-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt42-4e7a2084.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/resolve-lt90-4e7a2084.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bối cảnh giải quyết khiếu nại hoặc mâu thuẫn nội bộ.', 'office', 1, 12),
('f1012568-ba40-5039-afe0-187f71db326d', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'accept', '/əkˈsept/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Đồng ý nhận hoặc chấp thuận một điều gì đó.', 'to agree to take something that is offered to you.', 'She decided to accept the job offer after careful consideration.', 'Cô ấy đã quyết định chấp nhận lời mời làm việc sau khi cân nhắc kỹ lưỡng.', '{\"en\": \"We regret to inform you that we cannot accept any late applications.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi rất tiếc phải thông báo rằng chúng tôi không thể chấp nhận bất kỳ đơn đăng ký trễ hạn nào.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-ljspeech-5fb801f2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-cori-5fb801f2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accept-cebe315d.webp', '[\"approve\", \"receive\", \"agree\"]', '[\"reject\", \"decline\", \"refuse\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accept an offer\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận một lời đề nghị\"}, {\"phrase\": \"accept responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"nhận trách nhiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"except\", \"note_vi\": \"ngoại trừ, phát âm gần giống accept\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acceptance\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"acceptable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-cori-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru0-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru5-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru6-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru10-5fb801f2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru9-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru3-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru7-5fb801f2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accept-aru