('c078efec-3cc7-56bf-98d6-8ebb3c27fb82', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'behaviour', '/bɪˈheɪvjə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Cách một người, động vật hoặc vật thể hành động hoặc phản ứng.', 'the way that a person acts or reacts in a particular situation or towards others.', 'Her polite behaviour during the interview left a very good impression on the manager.', 'Thái độ lịch sự của cô ấy trong buổi phỏng vấn đã để lại ấn tượng rất tốt cho người quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"The manager addressed the unprofessional behaviour of the staff during the meeting with the client.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã giải quyết hành vi thiếu chuyên nghiệp của nhân viên trong cuộc họp với khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-ljspeech-bf78d7a8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-cori-bf78d7a8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/behaviour-61caa57e.webp', '[\"conduct\", \"manner\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"professional behaviour\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi chuyên nghiệp\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bad behaviour\", \"meaning\": \"hành vi xấu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"attitude\", \"note_vi\": \"behaviour là hành động cụ thể, attitude là thái độ bên trong.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"behave\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-cori-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru0-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru5-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru6-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru10-bf78d7a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru9-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru3-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru7-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru8-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-aru2-bf78d7a8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-ljspeech-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt408-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt138-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt624-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt396-bf78d7a8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt498-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt132-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt288-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt42-bf78d7a8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/behaviour-lt90-bf78d7a8.mp3\"]}}', 'Anh-Anh viết là \'behaviour\', Anh-Mỹ viết là \'behavior\'.', 'office', 1, 14),
('cc869b8f-9824-5d9a-9b6c-2d8858c1745a', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '25c1fc62-3306-50b4-bb28-30658b2239d6', '0dedb205-6964-5ac0-88a0-4f4976c1f96b', 'significantly', 'UK: /sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəntli/ | US: /sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'đáng kể', 'to a noticeable, important, or meaningful degree that alters the overall context.', 'Sales have increased significantly over the past year.', 'Doanh số đã tăng đáng kể trong năm qua.', '{\"en\": \"Production costs decreased significantly after the factory installed automated machinery.\", \"vi\": \"Chi phí sản xuất đã giảm đáng kể sau khi nhà máy lắp đặt máy móc tự động.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-ljspeech-acb03f8f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-cori-acb03f8f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/significantly-1e69b82d.webp', '[\"substantially\", \"considerably\", \"markedly\", \"noticeably\"]', '[\"slightly\", \"marginally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"significantly higher\", \"meaning\": \"cao hơn đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"improve significantly\", \"meaning\": \"cải thiện đáng kể\"}, {\"phrase\": \"differ significantly\", \"meaning\": \"khác biệt đáng kể\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"significant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"significance\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-cori-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru0-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru5-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru6-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru10-acb03f8f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru9-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/significantly-aru3-acb03f8f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/sig