('bf2c9230-4b51-51be-92dd-e8c9bed35d41', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '5e220f5c-df25-5169-8a72-80b28689b8fd', '1c88527e-4f24-5006-bbdd-418f073a995d', 'surge', 'UK: /sɜːdʒ/ | US: /sɜːrdʒ/', 'B2', 'noun', 'sự gia tăng đột ngột', 'A sudden and significant increase in the amount or intensity of something.', 'There was a sudden surge in customer complaints.', 'Có một sự gia tăng đột ngột trong các khiếu nại của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"The store experienced a sudden surge in online orders during the holiday sale.\", \"vi\": \"Cửa hàng đã ghi nhận sự gia tăng đột ngột các đơn hàng trực tuyến trong đợt giảm giá lễ hội.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-ljspeech-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surge-8ca74d7d.webp', '[\"spike\", \"jump\", \"increase\"]', '[\"drop\", \"decline\", \"plunge\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a surge in demand\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng vọt về nhu cầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"power surge\", \"meaning\": \"sự tăng áp đột ngột (điện)\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"surge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-cori-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru0-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru5-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru6-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru10-c5b9c04c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru9-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru3-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru7-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru8-c5b9c04c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surge-aru2-c5b9c04c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/su