('2e3fe943-bc3f-55c4-9015-0acf95b26014', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '61bd62c9-a1f3-58b3-ab4f-657f386c1d08', 'de76a2b7-d7fd-5a27-893c-ae93814d48b9', 'enhance', '/ɪnˈhɑːns/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm tăng chất lượng, giá trị hoặc vẻ hấp dẫn của cái gì đó.', 'to improve the quality, amount, or strength of something in order to make it better.', 'Attending this training workshop will help employees enhance their communication skills effectively.', 'Tham gia buổi thảo luận tập huấn này sẽ giúp nhân viên nâng cao kỹ năng giao tiếp hiệu quả.', '{\"en\": \"The software update will significantly enhance the security features of our corporate network system.\", \"vi\": \"Bản cập nhật phần mềm sẽ nâng cao đáng kể các tính năng bảo mật của hệ thống mạng công ty chúng ta.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-ljspeech-3f96894f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-cori-3f96894f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/enhance-ff3a411b.webp', '[\"improve\", \"boost\", \"upgrade\"]', '[\"diminish\", \"worsen\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"enhance performance\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao hiệu suất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"enhance reputation\", \"meaning\": \"nâng cao danh tiếng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"enhancement\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"enhanced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-cori-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru0-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru5-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru6-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru10-3f96894f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru9-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru3-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru7-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru8-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-aru2-3f96894f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-ljspeech-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt408-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt138-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt624-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt396-3f96894f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt498-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt132-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt288-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt42-3f96894f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/enhance-lt90-3f96894f.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi kèm với các danh từ như performance, quality, image, security.', 'technology', 1, 20),
('91948ba6-563c-51dc-9db1-9ccb909465a7', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '61bd62c9-a1f3-58b3-ab4f-657f386c1d08', 'de76a2b7-d7fd-5a27-893c-ae93814d48b9', 'appeal', '/əˈpiːl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự hấp dẫn, lời kêu gọi khẩn thiết hoặc yêu cầu xem xét lại quyết định.', 'a quality that makes something attractive, or a formal request for help.', 'The new marketing campaign has a strong appeal to younger consumers.', 'Chiến dịch tiếp thị mới có sức hấp dẫn mạnh mẽ đối với người tiêu dùng trẻ tuổi.', '{\"en\": \"The new product design has a strong appeal to younger consumers in Asia.\", \"vi\": \"Thiết kế sản phẩm mới có sức hấp dẫn mạnh mẽ đối với người tiêu dùng trẻ tuổi ở châu Á.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-ljspeech-c9120087.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-cori-c9120087.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appeal-4753ec3b.webp', '[\"attraction\", \"request\", \"petition\"]', '[\"repulsion\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"broad appeal\", \"meaning\": \"sức hấp dẫn rộng rãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make an appeal\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra lời kêu gọi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"lodge an appeal\", \"meaning\": \"nộp đơn kháng cáo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"repeal\", \"note_vi\": \"repeal có nghĩa là bãi bỏ (một đạo luật)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"appeal\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"appealing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-cori-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru0-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru5-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru6-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru10-c9120087.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru9-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appeal-aru3-c9120087.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc