('e3b46d88-2316-56fa-888c-4faad938b243', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '624ecff7-f3d9-5206-9f52-21bce5c1f362', 'e593b3be-7530-5900-af5c-0dd7fda48d34', 'coincide', '/ˌkəʊɪnˈsaɪd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Xảy ra cùng lúc hoặc trùng khớp với một sự kiện khác.', 'to happen at the same time or be in agreement.', 'The release of the new product was planned to coincide with the annual trade show.', 'Việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới được lên kế hoạch trùng với triển lãm thương mại hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The annual conference will coincide with the launch of our new product line.\", \"vi\": \"Hội nghị thường niên sẽ trùng với thời điểm ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-ljspeech-bbf2a53a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-cori-bbf2a53a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/coincide-98d3b2ee.webp', '[\"concur\", \"overlap\"]', '[\"differ\", \"diverge\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"coincide with\", \"meaning\": \"trùng hợp với\"}, {\"phrase\": \"coincide perfectly\", \"meaning\": \"trùng khớp hoàn hảo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"collide\", \"note_vi\": \"va chạm, khác với trùng hợp thời gian\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"coincidence\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"coincident\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-cori-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru0-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru5-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru6-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru10-bbf2a53a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru9-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru3-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru7-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru8-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-aru2-bbf2a53a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-ljspeech-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt408-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt138-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt624-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt396-bbf2a53a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt498-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt132-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt288-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt42-bbf2a53a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/coincide-lt90-bbf2a53a.mp3\"]}}', 'Luôn đi kèm giới từ \'with\' khi muốn nói trùng với sự kiện nào đó.', 'business', 1, 14),
('84377c90-d75c-5352-9d44-13a480fc80ce', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '624ecff7-f3d9-5206-9f52-21bce5c1f362', 'e593b3be-7530-5900-af5c-0dd7fda48d34', 'stationery', '/ˈsteɪʃənri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Các vật dụng cần thiết cho việc viết lách hoặc dùng trong văn phòng.', 'materials for writing and using in an office, such as paper and pens.', 'We need to order more stationery, such as pens and notebooks, for the office.', 'Chúng ta cần đặt thêm văn phòng phẩm, như bút và sổ, cho văn phòng.', '{\"en\": \"Please submit a request form if you need more stationery for your department.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng nộp mẫu yêu cầu nếu bạn cần thêm văn phòng phẩm cho phòng ban của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-ljspeech-3b12ea31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-cori-3b12ea31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stationery-5e70bf40.webp', '[\"office supplies\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"office stationery\", \"meaning\": \"văn phòng phẩm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stationery store\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng văn phòng phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"stationary\", \"note_vi\": \"nghĩa là đứng yên, không chuyển động.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-cori-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru0-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru5-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru6-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru10-3b12ea31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru9-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru3-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru7-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stationery-aru8-3b12ea31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunci