('a5363833-5110-529d-b167-598e82586319', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '64271236-20dc-5726-923f-58c2cbb5cbd5', '83f15ee5-93ad-5d22-b90e-892892c497e5', 'ultimately', 'UK: /ˈʌltɪmətli/ | US: /ˈʌltəmətli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'cuối cùng, sau cùng', 'In the end, especially after a long process, series of events, or period of time.', 'The project was ultimately successful after many delays.', 'Dự án cuối cùng đã thành công sau nhiều lần trì hoãn.', '{\"en\": \"After weeks of negotiation, the board of directors ultimately approved the merger proposal.\", \"vi\": \"Sau nhiều tuần thương lượng, hội đồng quản trị cuối cùng đã thông qua đề xuất sáp nhập.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-ljspeech-68d16beb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-cori-68d16beb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ultimately-57a78583.webp', '[\"eventually\", \"finally\", \"in the end\"]', '[\"initially\", \"firstly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ultimately responsible for\", \"meaning\": \"chịu trách nhiệm cuối cùng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ultimately lead to\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng dẫn đến\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"ultimate\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-cori-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru0-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru5-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru6-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru10-68d16beb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru9-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru3-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru7-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ultimately-aru8-68d16beb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/publi