('38322b61-1934-52de-9173-11adb5322b9c', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '75ac6c56-61b5-5fc0-9a48-24e3a6421aa1', '41f3af2c-5d90-5175-ae3d-499b2c511716', 'weakness', '/ˈwiːknəs/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một khuyết điểm hoặc điều gì đó không mạnh.', 'a particular quality that makes someone or something less effective.', 'His biggest weakness is his inability to say no to extra work.', 'Điểm yếu lớn nhất của anh ấy là không thể từ chối công việc phát sinh.', '{\"en\": \"The manager asked the applicant to describe his main professional weakness during the interview.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã yêu cầu ứng viên mô tả điểm yếu chuyên môn chính của mình trong buổi phỏng vấn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-ljspeech-301ce395.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-cori-301ce395.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/weakness-65812b19.webp', '[\"flaw\", \"shortcoming\", \"fault\"]', '[\"strength\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"major weakness\", \"meaning\": \"điểm yếu lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"identify weaknesses\", \"meaning\": \"xác định các điểm yếu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"weak\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"weaken\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-cori-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru0-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru5-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru6-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru10-301ce395.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru9-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru3-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru7-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/weakness-aru8-301ce395.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia