('172f6d68-ea32-521c-81b9-648682e451f8', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '75ac6c56-61b5-5fc0-9a48-24e3a6421aa1', '41f3af2c-5d90-5175-ae3d-499b2c511716', 'leisure', '/ˈleʒə(r)/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Thời gian không phải làm việc hoặc học tập.', 'time when you are not working and can relax or do things you enjoy.', 'He spends his leisure time reading books and playing chess.', 'Anh ấy dành thời gian rảnh rỗi để đọc sách và chơi cờ.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel features excellent facilities for guests seeking leisure and relaxation during their stay.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn có các tiện ích tuyệt vời cho khách hàng muốn nghỉ ngơi và thư giãn trong kỳ lưu trú.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-ljspeech-6188ba09.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-cori-6188ba09.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/leisure-04af67ce.webp', '[\"free time\", \"recreation\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"leisure activity\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động giải trí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at your leisure\", \"meaning\": \"vào lúc bạn rảnh rỗi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"leisurely\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-cori-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru0-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru5-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru6-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru10-6188ba09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru9-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru3-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru7-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru8-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-aru2-6188ba09.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-ljspeech-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt408-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt138-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt624-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt396-6188ba09.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt498-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt132-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt288-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt42-6188ba09.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/leisure-lt90-6188ba09.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'at your leisure\' hay gặp trong thư từ thương mại TOEIC với nghĩa \'khi nào rảnh\'.', 'travel', 1, 9),
('bb9ad06b-468c-5b10-948a-7eacb9eaaac6', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '75ac6c56-61b5-5fc0-9a48-24e3a6421aa1', '41f3af2c-5d90-5175-ae3d-499b2c511716', 'individual', '/ˌɪndɪˈvɪdʒuəl/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Riêng lẻ, của từng cá nhân.', 'existing and considered separately from the other things or people in a group.', 'Each individual has the right to express their opinion.', 'Mỗi cá nhân đều có quyền bày tỏ ý kiến của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will schedule individual meetings with each team member to discuss their performance.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý sẽ lên lịch các cuộc họp cá nhân với từng thành viên nhóm để thảo luận về hiệu suất của họ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-ljspeech-589d230a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-cori-589d230a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/individual-c528bf89.webp', '[\"single\", \"separate\", \"personal\"]', '[\"collective\", \"shared\", \"group\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"individual needs\", \"meaning\": \"nhu cầu cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"individual attention\", \"meaning\": \"sự chú ý đến từng cá nhân\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"individual\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"individually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-cori-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru0-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru5-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru6-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru10-589d230a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru9-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru3-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-aru7-589d230a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/individual-a