('4b646de5-fb8b-599a-953a-abd862c46f4f', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '75ac6c56-61b5-5fc0-9a48-24e3a6421aa1', '41f3af2c-5d90-5175-ae3d-499b2c511716', 'dissolve', 'UK: /dɪˈzɒlv/ | US: /dɪˈzɑːlv/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm tan, hòa tan', 'to mix with a liquid so that it becomes part of the solution.', 'The sugar will dissolve in the hot coffee.', 'Đường sẽ tan trong cà phê nóng.', '{\"en\": \"The two partners decided to dissolve their joint business due to conflicting long-term goals.\", \"vi\": \"Hai đối tác đã quyết định giải thể doanh nghiệp chung của họ do mục tiêu dài hạn xung đột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-ljspeech-00fd7a27.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-cori-00fd7a27.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/dissolve-a092cabe.webp', '[\"melt\", \"disband\", \"terminate\", \"liquefy\"]', '[\"solidify\", \"form\", \"establish\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"dissolve a partnership\", \"meaning\": \"giải thể mối quan hệ hợp tác\"}, {\"phrase\": \"dissolve completely\", \"meaning\": \"hòa tan hoàn toàn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"solve\", \"note_vi\": \"giải quyết (vấn đề/bài toán), khác với dissolve (hòa tan/giải thể)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"dissolution\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-cori-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru0-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru5-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru6-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru10-00fd7a27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru9-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru3-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru7-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru8-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-aru2-00fd7a27.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-ljspeech-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt408-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt138-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt624-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt396-00fd7a27.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt498-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt132-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt288-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt42-00fd7a27.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/dissolve-lt90-00fd7a27.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài nghĩa hòa tan chất hóa học/chất rắn, trong thương mại \'dissolve a partnership/company\' nghĩa là giải thể công ty/chấm dứt hợp tác.', 'legal', 1, 16),
('3675c3f6-adb4-5747-8a1b-6ce7cfe8aece', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '75ac6c56-61b5-5fc0-9a48-24e3a6421aa1', '41f3af2c-5d90-5175-ae3d-499b2c511716', 'adjustment', '/əˈdʒʌstmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự thay đổi nhỏ để thích nghi hoặc cải thiện.', 'a small change made to something in order to correct or improve it.', 'We had to make some adjustments to the schedule due to unexpected delays.', 'Chúng tôi phải thực hiện một số điều chỉnh lịch trình do những chậm trễ bất ngờ.', '{\"en\": \"The technician made a slight adjustment to the machine settings to improve its efficiency.\", \"vi\": \"Kỹ thuật viên đã thực hiện một điều chỉnh nhỏ đối với cài đặt máy để cải thiện hiệu quả của nó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-ljspeech-cf8e0872.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-cori-cf8e0872.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/adjustment-e9c9f2dc.webp', '[\"modification\", \"alteration\", \"correction\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make an adjustment\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện điều chỉnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slight adjustment\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"price adjustment\", \"meaning\": \"điều chỉnh giá\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"adjust\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"adjustable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-cori-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru0-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru5-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru6-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru10-cf8e0872.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru9-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru3-cf8e0872.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/adjustment-aru7-cf8e0872