('969706bb-663d-577c-95f8-bd931941e7b6', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '7dba1bd2-62ad-512c-af43-389c6e3884c1', 'b1abb894-3ee5-58c2-bbc2-1bc6f52966ac', 'appoint', 'UK: /əˈpɔɪnt/ | US: /əˈpɔɪnt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'bổ nhiệm', 'To officially choose someone for a job, position, or specific responsibility.', 'The board decided to appoint a new CEO next month.', 'Ban giám đốc quyết định bổ nhiệm một CEO mới vào tháng tới.', '{\"en\": \"The board of directors voted to appoint Mr. Harrison as the new vice president.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng quản trị đã bỏ phiếu bổ nhiệm ông Harrison làm phó chủ tịch mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-ljspeech-1b2a623b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-cori-1b2a623b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/appoint-c6e766eb.webp', '[\"designate\", \"name\", \"select\"]', '[\"dismiss\", \"fire\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"appoint a committee\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ định thành lập một ủy ban\"}, {\"phrase\": \"newly appointed\", \"meaning\": \"mới được bổ nhiệm\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"appointment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-cori-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru0-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru5-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru6-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru10-1b2a623b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru9-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru3-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru7-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru8-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-aru2-1b2a623b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-ljspeech-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt408-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt138-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt624-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt396-1b2a623b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt498-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt132-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt288-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt42-1b2a623b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/appoint-lt90-1b2a623b.mp3\"]}}', 'Rất thường gặp ở dạng bị động: \'be appointed as + chức danh\' (được bổ nhiệm làm...).', 'corporate', 1, 0),
('c1108f52-5043-583c-814a-28cf580891d1', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '7dba1bd2-62ad-512c-af43-389c6e3884c1', 'b1abb894-3ee5-58c2-bbc2-1bc6f52966ac', 'uniformly', '/ˈjuːnɪfɔːmli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Một cách nhất quán, không có sự khác biệt.', 'in a way that is the same in all parts or at all times.', 'The new policy will be applied uniformly across all departments.', 'Chính sách mới sẽ được áp dụng đồng đều trên tất cả các phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"The new policy was uniformly applied across all branch offices last month.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách mới được áp dụng đồng đều tại tất cả các chi nhánh vào tháng trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-ljspeech-7fb859d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-cori-7fb859d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/uniformly-f88b59ec.webp', '[\"evenly\", \"consistently\", \"identically\"]', '[\"unevenly\", \"variably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"uniformly distributed\", \"meaning\": \"phân bố đồng đều\"}, {\"phrase\": \"uniformly applied\", \"meaning\": \"được áp dụng đồng đều\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"uniquely\", \"note_vi\": \"khác nghĩa: uniquely là duy nhất, uniformly là đồng đều\"}, {\"word\": \"formally\", \"note_vi\": \"formally là chính thức, uniformly là đồng đều\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"uniform\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"uniformity\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-cori-7fb859d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru0-7fb859d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru5-7fb859d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru6-7fb859d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru10-7fb859d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru9-7fb859d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/uniformly-aru3-7fb859d1.mp3\",