('9c572207-f855-5e96-ab0e-789016f15ef6', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '80c0f167-4fc3-52ba-877b-a6a75faef92f', '0a1ef63a-b1ab-5c76-a474-8433f8208d1e', 'account', 'UK: /əˈkaʊntɪŋ/ | US: /əˈkaʊntɪŋ/', 'B1', 'noun', 'kế toán', 'a detailed record of financial transactions or money spent and received by a business.', 'She works in the accounting department.', 'Cô ấy làm việc ở phòng kế toán.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting firm is currently auditing all client accounts for the previous fiscal year.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty kiểm toán hiện đang kiểm tra toàn bộ các tài khoản khách hàng trong năm tài chính trước.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-ljspeech-ca20728d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-cori-ca20728d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/account-6c06862a.webp', '[\"record\", \"ledger\", \"report\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take into account\", \"meaning\": \"tính đến, cân nhắc đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bank account\", \"meaning\": \"tài khoản ngân hàng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accountant\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accountable\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"accounting\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-cori-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru0-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru5-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru6-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru10-ca20728d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru9-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru3-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru7-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru8-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-aru2-ca20728d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-ljspeech-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt408-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt138-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt624-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt396-ca20728d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt498-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt132-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt288-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt42-ca20728d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/account-lt90-ca20728d.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý các cụm TOEIC quan trọng: \'take into account\' (cân nhắc đến), \'account balance\' (số dư tài khoản), \'client account\' (tài khoản khách hàng).', 'finance', 1, 13),
('d7bf0411-3c69-5cc9-a68d-acdefb1382c3', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '80c0f167-4fc3-52ba-877b-a6a75faef92f', '0a1ef63a-b1ab-5c76-a474-8433f8208d1e', 'charm', 'UK: /tʃɑːm/ | US: /tʃɑːrm/', 'B2', 'noun', 'vẻ quyến rũ, sức hấp dẫn', 'A pleasant quality or feature that makes a person, place, or thing attractive.', 'The old building has a unique charm.', 'Toà nhà cũ có một vẻ quyến rũ độc đáo.', '{\"en\": \"The historic hotel retained its original charm while offering modern amenities to guests.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn cổ kính vẫn giữ được nét quyến rũ ban đầu trong khi cung cấp các tiện nghi hiện đại cho du khách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-ljspeech-c9469a9c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-cori-c9469a9c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/charm-a0998083.webp', '[\"appeal\", \"attractiveness\", \"fascination\", \"allure\"]', '[\"repulsiveness\", \"ugliness\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"personal charm\", \"meaning\": \"sức hút cá nhân\"}, {\"phrase\": \"rustic charm\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ đẹp mộc mạc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"works like a charm\", \"meaning\": \"hoạt động cực kỳ hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"charming\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-cori-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru0-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru5-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru6-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru10-c9469a9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru9-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru3-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru7-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru8-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-aru2-c9469a9c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-ljspeech-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt408-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt138-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt624-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt396-c9469a9c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt498-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt132-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt288-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt42-c9469a9c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charm-lt90-c9469a9c.mp3\"]}}', 'Tính từ của \'charm\' là \'charming\' (duyên dáng, quyến rũ) rất hay xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC để mô tả địa điểm hoặc phong cách.', 'tourism', 1, 14),
('a40aa277-e055-52a7-940f-addea18ce21a', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '80c0f167-4fc3-52ba-877b-a6a75faef92f', '0a1ef63a-b1ab-5c76-a474-8433f8208d1e', 'tempt', '/tempt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khiến ai đó muốn làm điều gì đó, đặc biệt là điều không nên làm.', 'to make someone want to do or have something that they should not.', 'The delicious smell of freshly baked cookies tempted me to buy a whole box.', 'Mùi thơm hấp dẫn của bánh quy mới nướng đã cám dỗ tôi mua cả một hộp.', '{\"en\": \"The low prices during the sale might tempt customers to buy more than they need.\", \"vi\": \"Giá thấp trong đợt giảm giá có thể cám dỗ khách hàng mua nhiều hơn mức họ cần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-ljspeech-e976c086.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-cori-e976c086.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tempt-4923432e.webp', '[\"entice\", \"attract\"]', '[\"discourage\", \"dissuade\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tempt someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"cám dỗ ai làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tempting offer\", \"meaning\": \"lời đề nghị hấp dẫn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"temptation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-cori-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru0-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru5-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru6-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru10-e976c086.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru9-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru3-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru7-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru8-e976c086.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tempt-aru2-e976c086.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public