('960c3c29-011f-5b55-91c7-a232079dab50', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'mix up', '/mɪks ʌp/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Sự lẫn lộn, nhầm lẫn giữa nhiều thứ.', 'a mistake caused by confusion or lack of organization.', 'There was a mix-up with the room numbers, so we ended up in the wrong one.', 'Đã có sự nhầm lẫn về số phòng nên chúng tôi đã vào nhầm phòng.', '{\"en\": \"There was a mix-up at the front desk regarding our reservation for the conference room.\", \"vi\": \"Đã có một sự nhầm lẫn tại quầy lễ tân liên quan đến việc đặt phòng họp của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-ljspeech-200174f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-cori-200174f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mix-up-54fe040b.webp', '[\"confusion\", \"error\"]', '[\"order\", \"clarity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a slight mix-up\", \"meaning\": \"một sự nhầm lẫn nhỏ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"clear up a mix-up\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết sự nhầm lẫn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"mix up\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-cori-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru0-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru5-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru6-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru10-200174f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru9-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru3-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru7-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru8-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-aru2-200174f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-ljspeech-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt408-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt138-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt624-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt396-200174f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt498-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt132-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt288-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt42-200174f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mix-up-lt90-200174f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Danh từ viết có gạch nối, động từ thì không.', 'office', 1, 17),
('d64c42fd-49b6-5822-91c7-a7d064a190e9', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'call in', '/kɔːl ɪn/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Gọi điện để báo cáo, yêu cầu giúp đỡ, hoặc mời ai đó đến.', 'to ask a specialist or an expert to come and help with a problem.', 'The manager had to call in extra staff to handle the unexpected rush of customers.', 'Người quản lý đã phải gọi thêm nhân viên để xử lý lượng khách hàng tăng đột biến.', '{\"en\": \"We had to call in a technician to repair the office printing machine.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi phải gọi kỹ thuật viên đến để sửa máy in văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-ljspeech-68b9aa33.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-cori-68b9aa33.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/call-in-d03f6085.webp', '[\"summon\", \"bring in\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"call in an expert\", \"meaning\": \"gọi một chuyên gia đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"call in sick\", \"meaning\": \"gọi điện báo nghỉ ốm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"call off\", \"note_vi\": \"call off có nghĩa là hủy bỏ một sự kiện hay kế hoạch\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-cori-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru0-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru5-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru6-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru10-68b9aa33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru9-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru3-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru7-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru8-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-aru2-68b9aa33.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-ljspeech-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt408-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt138-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt624-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt396-68b9aa33.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt498-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt132-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt288-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt42-68b9aa33.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/call-in-lt90-68b9aa33.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt call in (gọi đến trợ giúp/báo ốm) với call off (hủy bỏ).', 'office', 1, 18),
('8cb27cb3-cafe-5b4c-af6d-781b18b7321e', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'bend', 'UK: /bɛnd/ | US: /bɛnd/', 'B1', 'verb', 'cúi xuống', 'to lean the body forward and downward from an upright position.', 'He had to bend to pass under the low archway.', 'Anh ấy phải cúi người để đi qua vòm cửa thấp.', '{\"en\": \"Warehouse employees are taught how to bend their knees properly when lifting heavy crates.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên kho hàng được hướng dẫn cách gập đầu gối đúng cách khi nâng các kiện hàng nặng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-ljspeech-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/bend-8fbc9a1b.webp', '[\"lean\", \"incline\", \"bow\"]', '[\"straighten\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"bend down\", \"meaning\": \"cúi người xuống\"}, {\"phrase\": \"bend the rules\", \"meaning\": \"nới lỏng/lách quy định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"bind\", \"note_vi\": \"Bind nghĩa là buộc, ràng buộc hoặc đóng (sách), khác với bend (cúi/uốn)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"bent\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-cori-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru0-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru5-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru6-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru10-abf1da7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru9-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru3-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru7-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru8-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-aru2-abf1da7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-ljspeech-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt408-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt138-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt624-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt396-abf1da7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt498-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt132-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt288-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt42-abf1da7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/bend-lt90-abf1da7e.mp3\"]}}', '\'Bend down\' hoặc \'bend over\' mô tả hành động cúi gập người xuống (ví dụ khi nâng đồ nặng trong kho).', 'logistics', 1, 19),
('465a5798-0d64-56d0-8704-11327b5364fc', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'constantly', '/ˈkɒnstəntli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Xảy ra hoặc làm gì đó một cách thường xuyên, không ngừng.', 'happening or continuing without stopping, all the time.', 'Software developers must constantly update their skills to keep up with industry trends.', 'Các nhà phát triển phần mềm phải liên tục cập nhật kỹ năng để bắt kịp xu hướng ngành.', '{\"en\": \"Our customer service team is constantly updating the complaint database.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm dịch vụ khách hàng của chúng tôi liên tục cập nhật cơ sở dữ liệu khiếu nại.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-ljspeech-1d78db90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-cori-1d78db90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/constantly-d6741dd2.webp', '[\"continuously\", \"always\", \"repeatedly\"]', '[\"occasionally\", \"rarely\", \"seldom\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"constantly changing\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục thay đổi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constantly improving\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục cải thiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constantly monitoring\", \"meaning\": \"liên tục theo dõi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"consistently\", \"note_vi\": \"consistently nhấn mạnh sự nhất quán, constantly nhấn mạnh không ngừng nghỉ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"constant\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"constancy\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-cori-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru0-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru5-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru6-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru10-1d78db90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru9-1d