('c9a9c1b7-fe73-5b58-8068-36c7792f84a5', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'approachable', '/əˈprəʊtʃəbl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Dễ tiếp cận, thân thiện và dễ nói chuyện.', 'friendly and easy to talk to or deal with.', 'Our new teacher is very approachable, making it easy to ask questions.', 'Giáo viên mới của chúng tôi rất dễ gần, khiến việc đặt câu hỏi trở nên dễ dàng.', '{\"en\": \"The new human resources manager is very approachable and always willing to help employees.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng phòng nhân sự mới rất dễ gần và luôn sẵn lòng giúp đỡ nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-ljspeech-01f0f8cc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-cori-01f0f8cc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/approachable-17552c32.webp', '[\"friendly\", \"accessible\", \"sociable\"]', '[\"unapproachable\", \"distant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"approachable leader\", \"meaning\": \"người lãnh đạo dễ gần\"}, {\"phrase\": \"friendly and approachable\", \"meaning\": \"thân thiện và dễ gần\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"accessible\", \"note_vi\": \"accessible chỉ nơi chốn dễ tiếp cận hoặc tài liệu dễ dùng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"approach\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"approach\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"approachability\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-cori-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru0-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru5-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru6-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru10-01f0f8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru9-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru3-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru7-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru8-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-aru2-01f0f8cc.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-ljspeech-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt408-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt138-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt624-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt396-01f0f8cc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt498-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt132-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt288-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt42-01f0f8cc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/approachable-lt90-01f0f8cc.mp3\"]}}', 'Đuôi -able chỉ khả năng, ghép với approach (tiếp cận) nghĩa là có thể tiếp cận, dễ gần.', 'hr', 1, 25),
('a2260be0-f3c2-5d87-9e8e-06de597ac54e', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'critique', 'UK: /krɪˈtiːk/ | US: /krɪˈtiːk/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Phê bình, đánh giá', 'To examine and assess a work or idea carefully, giving detailed feedback and opinions.', 'The manager will critique the proposal before its final submission.', 'Người quản lý sẽ phê bình đề xuất trước khi nộp cuối cùng.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team will critique the new promotional campaign proposal during tomorrow\'s meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm tiếp thị sẽ đánh giá chi tiết đề xuất chiến dịch quảng cáo mới trong cuộc họp ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-ljspeech-e08906a1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-cori-e08906a1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/critique-d2995fd2.webp', '[\"evaluate\", \"assess\", \"review\", \"appraise\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"critique a proposal\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá một đề xuất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constructively critique\", \"meaning\": \"góp ý/đánh giá mang tính xây dựng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"criticize\", \"note_vi\": \"Criticize nghĩa là phê bình, chỉ trích khuyết điểm, trong khi critique là phân tích đánh giá chuyên sâu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"critique\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"critic\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"criticism\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-cori-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru0-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru5-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru6-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru10-e08906a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru9-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru3-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru7-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru8-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-aru2-e08906a1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-ljspeech-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt408-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt138-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt624-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt396-e08906a1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt498-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt132-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt288-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt42-e08906a1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/critique-lt90-e08906a1.mp3\"]}}', '\'Critique\' vừa là động từ vừa là danh từ mang nghĩa phân tích/đánh giá chi tiết (thường mang tính xây dựng), khác với \'criticize\' (thường nghiêng về chỉ trích, chê bai).', 'office', 1, 26),
('2ae887d4-234c-56e0-92ce-2925171f2b8a', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'minimize', '/ˈmɪnɪmaɪz/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Làm cho một cái gì đó nhỏ nhất có thể về kích thước, số lượng hoặc mức độ.', 'to make something as small or as low as possible.', 'We should try to minimize waste during the production process.', 'Chúng ta nên cố gắng giảm thiểu chất thải trong quá trình sản xuất.', '{\"en\": \"We must minimize the risk of errors during the data entry process for the project.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta phải giảm thiểu nguy cơ sai sót trong quá trình nhập liệu cho dự án.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-ljspeech-0c3639c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-cori-0c3639c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/minimize-37a1956b.webp', '[\"reduce\", \"decrease\"]', '[\"maximize\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"minimize risk\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"minimize costs\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu chi phí\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"minimum\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"minimal\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-cori-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru0-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru5-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru6-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru10-0c3639c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru9-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru3-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru7-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru8-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-aru2-0c3639c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-ljspeech-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt408-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt138-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt624-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt396-0c3639c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt498-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt132-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt288-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt42-0c3639c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/minimize-lt90-0c3639c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Trái nghĩa với \'maximize\' (tối đa hóa).', 'business', 1, 27),
('fe9e71d3-7209-568c-87f9-58f837035b83', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'review', '/rɪˈvjuː/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Một bài viết hoặc ý kiến đánh giá về một sản phẩm, dịch vụ, hoặc tác phẩm.', 'a formal examination or report on a situation, product, or performance.', 'The movie received excellent reviews from critics and audiences alike.', 'Bộ phim nhận được những đánh giá xuất sắc từ cả giới phê bình và khán giả.', '{\"en\": \"Our team will conduct a thorough review of the financial report tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Đội của chúng tôi sẽ tiến hành đánh giá kỹ lưỡng báo cáo tài chính vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/review-55735555.webp', '[\"evaluation\", \"assessment\", \"analysis\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"performance review\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá hiệu suất công việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under review\", \"meaning\": \"đang được xem xét\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"revision\", \"note_vi\": \"sự chỉnh sửa tài liệu hoặc ôn tập bài học\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"review\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"reviewer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-cori-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru0-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru5-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru6-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru10-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru9-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru3-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru7-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru8-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-aru2-61e62b21.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-ljspeech-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt408-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt138-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt624-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt396-61e62b21.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt498-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt132-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt288-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt42-61e62b21.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/review-lt90-61e62b21.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm performance review mang nghĩa là buổi đánh giá hiệu quả làm việc định kỳ.', 'business', 1, 28),
('34fb8234-84ac-5ab6-9205-1259bf1eb864', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83da2068-4668-599b-ae33-770b199ca135', '655fe3e8-2c67-534c-b6cc-270a61d513df', 'abide by', '/əˈbaɪd baɪ/', 'B2', 'phrasal verb', 'Tuân theo, chấp hành (quy tắc, luật lệ).', 'to accept and follow a rule, decision, or agreement carefully.', 'All employees must abide by the company\'s code of conduct.', 'Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân thủ quy tắc ứng xử của công ty.', '{\"en\": \"All employees must abide by the safety regulations set by the company management.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả nhân viên phải tuân thủ các quy định an toàn do ban quản lý công ty đề ra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-ljspeech-8724378b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-cori-8724378b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/abide-by-fc48032b.webp', '[\"comply with\", \"conform to\"]', '[\"violate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"abide by rules\", \"meaning\": \"tuân thủ quy định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"abide by a decision\", \"meaning\": \"tuân theo một quyết định\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"comply with\", \"note_vi\": \"Cùng nghĩa tuân thủ, nhưng abide đi với by, comply đi với with.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-cori-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru0-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru5-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru6-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru10-8724378b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru9-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru3-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru7-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru8-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-aru2-8724378b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-ljspeech-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt408-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt138-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt624-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt396-8724378b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt498-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt132-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt288-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt42-8724378b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/abide-by-lt90-8724378b.mp3\"]}}', 'Bẫy giới từ trong TOEIC: abide BY = comply WITH = conform TO = adhere TO.', 'law', 1, 29),
('d1d57ca7-ed54-5bdc-9157-19ba94d7cdc2', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'ability', '/əˈbɪləti/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng, năng lực để làm điều gì đó.', 'the physical or mental power that allows a person to do something successfully.', 'Her ability to learn new languages quickly is impressive.', 'Khả năng học ngôn ngữ mới nhanh chóng của cô ấy thật ấn tượng.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate demonstrated an excellent ability to manage multiple projects under tight deadlines effectively.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã thể hiện năng lực tuyệt vời trong việc quản lý nhiều dự án dưới áp lực thời gian hiệu quả.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-ljspeech-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ability-e268772d.webp', '[\"capability\", \"skill\", \"talent\"]', '[\"inability\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ability to do\", \"meaning\": \"năng lực làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"proven ability\", \"meaning\": \"năng lực đã được chứng minh\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"able\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-cori-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru0-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru5-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru6-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru10-083dbabe.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru9-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru3-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru7-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru8-083dbabe.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ability-aru2-083dbabe.mp3\"]}, 