('791acf4d-aad5-5ace-a0d0-da0aa9a2e748', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'shipper', '/ˈʃɪpə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cá nhân hoặc công ty gửi hàng hóa đi.', 'a person or company that sends goods from one place to another by transport.', 'The shipper is responsible for ensuring the goods are packed safely for transport.', 'Người gửi hàng có trách nhiệm đảm bảo hàng hóa được đóng gói an toàn để vận chuyển.', '{\"en\": \"The shipper confirmed that the cargo will arrive at the warehouse early next week.\", \"vi\": \"Người gửi hàng xác nhận rằng lô hàng sẽ đến kho vào đầu tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-ljspeech-99211ca0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-cori-99211ca0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/shipper-0b4056f4.webp', '[\"carrier\", \"sender\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"reliable shipper\", \"meaning\": \"người gửi hàng đáng tin cậy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"international shipper\", \"meaning\": \"người gửi hàng quốc tế\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"ship\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"shipment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-cori-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru0-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru5-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru6-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru10-99211ca0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru9-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru3-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru7-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru8-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-aru2-99211ca0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-ljspeech-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt408-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt138-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt624-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt396-99211ca0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt498-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt132-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt288-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt42-99211ca0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/shipper-lt90-99211ca0.mp3\"]}}', 'Shipper trong tiếng Anh chuyên ngành là đơn vị vận chuyển, không phải \'shipper\' giao đồ ăn.', 'business', 1, 6),
('f01c9ba0-7eca-5ed6-a55b-1ce65f7c99c7', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'schedule', '/ˈʃedjuːl/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một kế hoạch về thời gian cho các sự kiện hoặc hoạt động.', 'A timetable detailing intended activities and their planned execution times.', 'The project manager updated the construction schedule after consulting with the engineers.', 'Quản lý dự án đã cập nhật lịch trình xây dựng sau khi tham khảo ý kiến của các kỹ sư.', '{\"en\": \"Please send me the updated meeting schedule before the end of the day.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng gửi cho tôi lịch trình cuộc họp đã cập nhật trước khi kết thúc ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-ljspeech-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/schedule-b619bdcd.webp', '[\"timetable\", \"agenda\", \"itinerary\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"ahead of schedule\", \"meaning\": \"trước thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"behind schedule\", \"meaning\": \"trễ thời hạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tight schedule\", \"meaning\": \"lịch trình dày đặc\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"scheme\", \"note_vi\": \"kế hoạch mưu đồ hoặc chương trình, không phải lịch trình làm việc\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"schedule\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"scheduled\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-cori-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru0-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru5-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru6-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru10-11e9ba26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru9-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru3-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru7-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru8-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-aru2-11e9ba26.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-ljspeech-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt408-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt138-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt624-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt396-11e9ba26.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt498-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt132-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt288-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt42-11e9ba26.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/schedule-lt90-11e9ba26.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý các cụm từ quan trọng: on schedule (đúng tiến độ), ahead of schedule (trước tiến độ).', 'office', 1, 7),
('0abecdf4-41a4-56c2-b16c-1ee3f661e523', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'constantly', '/ˈkɒnstəntli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách liên tục, không ngừng nghỉ.', 'happening all the time or repeatedly without any stopping or changing.', 'Technology advances so fast that software developers must constantly update their knowledge.', 'Công nghệ tiến bộ rất nhanh nên các nhà phát triển phần mềm phải liên tục cập nhật kiến thức của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our IT team constantly monitors the server to prevent unexpected network outages.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ CNTT của chúng tôi liên tục giám sát máy chủ để ngăn ngừa sự cố mạng bất ngờ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-ljspeech-1d78db90.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-cori-1d78db90.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/constantly-d6741dd2.webp', '[\"continuously\", \"frequently\", \"repeatedly\"]', '[\"rarely\", \"occasionally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"constantly changing\", \"meaning\": \"thay đổi liên tục\"}, {\"phrase\": \"constantly update\", \"meaning\": \"cập nhật liên tục\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"instantly\", \"note_vi\": \"ngay lập tức, không có khoảng thời gian chờ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"constant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-cori-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru0-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru5-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru6-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru10-1d78db90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru9-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru3-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru7-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru8-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-aru2-1d78db90.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-ljspeech-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt408-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt138-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt624-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt396-1d78db90.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt498-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt132-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt288-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt42-1d78db90.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/constantly-lt90-1d78db90.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm \'constantly\' (liên tục kéo dài) với \'instantly\' (ngay lập tức).', 'office', 1, 8),
('2ddacfff-9ea1-58d4-84eb-2a81ac9e6b87', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'perceptive', '/pəˈseptɪv/', 'C1', 'verb', 'Có khả năng nhận biết và hiểu rõ những điều tinh tế, sâu sắc.', 'able to notice and understand things quickly that other people might miss.', 'Her perceptive comments showed she understood the problem deeply.', 'Những nhận xét sâu sắc của cô ấy cho thấy cô ấy hiểu vấn đề rất rõ.', '{\"en\": \"The perceptive auditor quickly noticed the minor inconsistencies in the financial report.\", \"vi\": \"Viên kiểm toán nhạy bén đã nhanh chóng nhận ra những điểm bất hợp lý nhỏ trong báo cáo tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-ljspeech-42c2cec2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-cori-42c2cec2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/perceptive-74cbc006.webp', '[\"insightful\", \"observant\", \"sharp\"]', '[\"imperceptive\", \"unobservant\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"perceptive observer\", \"meaning\": \"người quan sát tinh tế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perceptive remark\", \"meaning\": \"nhận xét nhạy bén\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"receptive\", \"note_vi\": \"receptive nghĩa là cởi mở đón nhận ý kiến, perceptive là tinh tế nhạy bén\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"perceive\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"perception\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"perceptively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-cori-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru0-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru5-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru6-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru10-42c2cec2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru9-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru3-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru7-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru8-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-aru2-42c2cec2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-ljspeech-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt408-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt138-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt624-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt396-42c2cec2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt498-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt132-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt288-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt42-42c2cec2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/perceptive-lt90-42c2cec2.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để miêu tả người hoặc nhận xét có tính quan sát và thấu hiểu sâu sắc.', 'finance', 1, 9),
('585fb433-9452-5124-a183-cb65e2002198', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'stage', '/steɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tổ chức và thực hiện một sự kiện hoặc buổi biểu diễn.', 'to organize and present a public event, performance, or protest.', 'The local drama club plans to stage a famous musical at the city center.', 'Câu lạc bộ kịch địa phương dự định tổ chức một vở nhạc kịch nổi tiếng tại trung tâm thành phố.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing department will stage a promotional event to launch the new product line.\", \"vi\": \"Bộ phận tiếp thị sẽ tổ chức một sự kiện quảng bá để ra mắt dòng sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-ljspeech-ac5d84bf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-cori-ac5d84bf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/stage-2a69aa7b.webp', '[\"organize\", \"arrange\", \"present\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"stage an event\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một sự kiện\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stage a protest\", \"meaning\": \"tổ chức một cuộc biểu tình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"perform\", \"note_vi\": \"perform là biểu diễn, stage là tổ chức chuẩn bị cho buổi diễn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"stage\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-cori-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru0-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru5-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru6-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru10-ac5d84bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru9-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru3-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru7-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru8-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-aru2-ac5d84bf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-ljspeech-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt408-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt138-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt624-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt396-ac5d84bf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt498-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt132-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt288-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt42-ac5d84bf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/stage-lt90-ac5d84bf.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với danh từ stage nghĩa là sân khấu hoặc giai đoạn.', 'marketing', 1, 10),
('fc53fab6-48f2-5240-b827-664548f73827', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '83ed673a-d7c8-56fd-92ed-b47205f1629c', '9ca8d168-b494-5abe-b065-71e7d0b04a57', 'fluctuate', '/ˈflʌktʃueɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Thay đổi không ngừng, lên xuống thất thường.', 'to change frequently in size, amount, or quality in an irregular way over time.', 'The stock market can fluctuate wildly from day to day.', 'Thị trường chứng khoán có thể biến động dữ dội từ ngày này sang ngày khác.', '{\"en\": \"Market analysts expect that stock prices will fluctuate significantly before the end of the quarter.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà phân tích thị trường dự đoán rằng giá cổ phiếu sẽ biến động đáng kể trước khi kết thúc quý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-ljspeech-43d89cfc.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-cori-43d89cfc.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fluctuate-4dbb96f7.webp', '[\"vary\", \"waver\"]', '[\"stabilize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"fluctuate wildly\", \"meaning\": \"biến động mạnh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fluctuate between\", \"meaning\": \"dao động giữa\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"fluctuation\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-cori-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru0-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru5-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru6-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru10-43d89cfc.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru9-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru3-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru7-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru8-43d89cfc.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fluctuate-aru2-43d89cfc.