('34c171ce-8dc4-5aa2-a8a6-6414ee94d64c', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '855c27c3-83ed-5e98-9b14-912dddc57250', '87fd3236-5995-5294-ab26-9f3471aec721', 'surgery', '/ˈsɜːdʒəri/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Phương pháp điều trị y tế bằng cách cắt hoặc vá các bộ phận cơ thể.', 'a branch of medicine involving operative techniques on living tissues to treat illness or injury.', 'She had to undergo emergency surgery after the accident.', 'Cô ấy phải trải qua ca phẫu thuật khẩn cấp sau tai nạn.', '{\"en\": \"The medical insurance plan covers the costs of the surgery and the subsequent hospital recovery period.\", \"vi\": \"Gói bảo hiểm y tế chi trả chi phí phẫu thuật và thời gian hồi phục tại bệnh viện sau đó.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-ljspeech-59f6a267.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-cori-59f6a267.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/surgery-1f52c411.webp', '[\"operation\", \"procedure\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"undergo surgery\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua phẫu thuật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"perform surgery\", \"meaning\": \"thực hiện phẫu thuật\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"surgeon\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-cori-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru0-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru5-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru6-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru10-59f6a267.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru9-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru3-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru7-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru8-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-aru2-59f6a267.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-ljspeech-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt408-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt138-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt624-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt396-59f6a267.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt498-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt132-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt288-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt42-59f6a267.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/surgery-lt90-59f6a267.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng \'have surgery\' hoặc \'undergo surgery\' thay vì \'do surgery\'.', 'health', 1, 9),
('6b44b4d5-d6ab-5808-b35f-077de541f57c', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '855c27c3-83ed-5e98-9b14-912dddc57250', '87fd3236-5995-5294-ab26-9f3471aec721', 'inconsiderately', '/ˌɪnkənˈsɪdərətli/', 'C1', 'adverb', 'Một cách thiếu suy nghĩ, không quan tâm đến cảm xúc của người khác.', 'in a way that does not think about the feelings or needs of other people.', 'He acted inconsiderately by playing loud music late at night.', 'Anh ấy đã hành động thiếu cân nhắc khi bật nhạc lớn vào đêm khuya.', '{\"en\": \"The contractor inconsiderately left heavy equipment blocking the main entrance to the office building.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà thầu đã thiếu cân nhắc khi để lại thiết bị nặng chắn lối vào chính của tòa nhà văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-ljspeech-04543cb9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-cori-04543cb9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/inconsiderately-1a9462c7.webp', '[\"thoughtlessly\", \"selfishly\"]', '[\"considerately\", \"thoughtfully\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"act inconsiderately\", \"meaning\": \"hành động thiếu suy nghĩ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"behave inconsiderately\", \"meaning\": \"cư xử thiếu ý tứ\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inconsiderate\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"consideration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-cori-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru0-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru5-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru6-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru10-04543cb9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru9-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/inconsiderately-aru3-04543cb9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pu