('87378639-b58a-578b-ad90-eae61893518d', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '855c27c3-83ed-5e98-9b14-912dddc57250', '87fd3236-5995-5294-ab26-9f3471aec721', 'anxiety', '/æŋˈzaɪəti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Cảm giác lo âu, bồn chồn về điều gì đó.', 'A state of mental distress caused by fear of impending danger or misfortune.', 'Regular exercise helped reduce his level of work-related anxiety significantly.', 'Tập thể dục đều đặn đã giúp giảm đáng kể mức độ lo lắng liên quan đến công việc của anh ấy.', '{\"en\": \"The unexpected budget cuts caused a lot of anxiety among the department staff.\", \"vi\": \"Việc cắt giảm ngân sách đột ngột đã gây ra nhiều sự lo lắng cho nhân viên bộ phận.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-ljspeech-ad0053ab.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-cori-ad0053ab.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxiety-67b330ed.webp', '[\"worry\", \"concern\", \"apprehension\"]', '[\"calmness\", \"confidence\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"cause anxiety\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra lo lắng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce anxiety\", \"meaning\": \"giảm bớt lo lắng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"anxious\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"anxiously\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-cori-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru0-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru5-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru6-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru10-ad0053ab.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru9-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru3-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru7-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxiety-aru8-ad0053ab.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object