('e1bf81e4-a4e7-5309-a072-06e70fe7d6b6', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '855c27c3-83ed-5e98-9b14-912dddc57250', '87fd3236-5995-5294-ab26-9f3471aec721', 'initiative', '/ɪˈnɪʃətɪv/', 'B1', 'noun', 'Khả năng tự khởi xướng, hoặc một kế hoạch mới.', 'a new plan or the ability to act without being told.', 'Taking the initiative at work can lead to new opportunities.', 'Chủ động trong công việc có thể mang lại những cơ hội mới.', '{\"en\": \"The employee took the initiative to improve the customer service system.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên đã chủ động cải thiện hệ thống dịch vụ khách hàng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-ljspeech-700d1460.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-cori-700d1460.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/initiative-08def630.webp', '[\"enterprise\", \"proactiveness\", \"originality\"]', '[\"passivity\", \"inaction\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take initiative\", \"meaning\": \"chủ động\"}, {\"phrase\": \"new initiative\", \"meaning\": \"sáng kiến mới\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"initiation\", \"note_vi\": \"initiation là sự khởi đầu, initiative là sáng kiến/chủ động\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"initiate\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"initiatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-cori-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru0-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru5-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru6-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru10-700d1460.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru9-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru3-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/initiative-aru7-700d1460.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/init