('beba715d-1295-594c-875c-68f58ac73148', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8b0485ae-74d9-5edb-887f-9bbed5c204ea', 'e3ec6f52-4834-50ef-9584-7bbdea4991d0', 'owe', '/əʊ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Có nghĩa vụ phải trả lại tiền hoặc bày tỏ lòng biết ơn.', 'to need to pay money to someone for something you bought.', 'The client still owes three thousand dollars to the design agency for their services.', 'Khách hàng vẫn còn nợ công ty thiết kế ba nghìn đô la cho các dịch vụ của họ.', '{\"en\": \"The client still owes our company five thousand dollars for the marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng vẫn còn nợ công ty chúng tôi năm nghìn đô la cho chiến dịch tiếp thị.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-ljspeech-f66d5d14.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-cori-f66d5d14.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/owe-af20c8da.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"owe money\", \"meaning\": \"nợ tiền\"}, {\"phrase\": \"owe an apology\", \"meaning\": \"nợ một lời xin lỗi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"own\", \"note_vi\": \"own nghĩa là sở hữu, còn owe nghĩa là nợ\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"owing\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-cori-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru0-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru5-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru6-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru10-f66d5d14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru9-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru3-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru7-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru8-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-aru2-f66d5d14.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-ljspeech-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt408-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt138-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt624-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt396-f66d5d14.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt498-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt132-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt288-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt42-f66d5d14.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/owe-lt90-f66d5d14.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm lẫn giữa \'owe\' (nợ) và \'own\' (sở hữu) vì viết gần giống nhau.', 'finance', 1, 17),
('7ce00ed9-5743-5c92-91c9-c98e41cdae05', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8b0485ae-74d9-5edb-887f-9bbed5c204ea', 'e3ec6f52-4834-50ef-9584-7bbdea4991d0', 'catch up', '/kætʃ ʌp/', 'B1', 'phrasal verb', 'Bắt kịp, theo kịp (về tốc độ, thông tin, công việc).', 'to reach the same quality, standard, or level as someone or something else.', 'After being sick for a week, I had to work extra hours to catch up on my assignments.', 'Sau một tuần bị ốm, tôi phải làm thêm giờ để bắt kịp các bài tập của mình.', '{\"en\": \"Our team needs to work overtime this week to catch up with the schedule.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm của chúng tôi cần làm thêm giờ tuần này để bắt kịp tiến độ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-ljspeech-c270cbef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-cori-c270cbef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/catch-up-3eafb394.webp', '[\"overtake\", \"reach\"]', '[\"fall behind\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"catch up with\", \"meaning\": \"bắt kịp với ai hoặc cái gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"catch up on\", \"meaning\": \"làm bù để bắt kịp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"keep up\", \"note_vi\": \"keep up là duy trì cùng tốc độ, catch up là đuổi kịp\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-cori-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru0-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru5-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru6-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru10-c270cbef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru9-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru3-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru7-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/catch-up-aru8-c270cbef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/