('8cb24948-bd49-5f1c-b58d-77b33676a273', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8b87e05a-a2c4-59a1-bf2c-c275f2a65c86', '427aced2-a7ef-5adc-8430-3c35ec99abbb', 'creative', '/kriˈeɪtɪv/', 'A2', 'adjective', 'Có khả năng tạo ra ý tưởng mới, độc đáo.', 'having the ability to produce new ideas or original things using imagination.', 'Children often have very creative ideas for games.', 'Trẻ em thường có những ý tưởng rất sáng tạo cho các trò chơi.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team proposed several creative ideas to boost our new product sales.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã đề xuất một số ý tưởng sáng tạo để thúc đẩy doanh số sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-ljspeech-df0b6c41.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-cori-df0b6c41.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/creative-375dcc10.webp', '[\"innovative\", \"imaginative\", \"inventive\"]', '[\"unimaginative\", \"unoriginal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"creative solution\", \"meaning\": \"giải pháp sáng tạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"creative thinking\", \"meaning\": \"tư duy sáng tạo\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"creation\", \"note_vi\": \"là danh từ chỉ sự tạo ra hoặc tác phẩm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"create\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"creation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"creatively\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-cori-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru0-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru5-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru6-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru10-df0b6c41.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru9-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru3-df0b6c41.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/creative-aru7-