('375f8914-ed81-5ff2-92de-fd766bc02b9d', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8b87e05a-a2c4-59a1-bf2c-c275f2a65c86', '427aced2-a7ef-5adc-8430-3c35ec99abbb', 'blanket', '/ˈblæŋkɪt/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Một tấm vải dày dùng để giữ ấm, thường dùng khi ngủ.', 'a large piece of thick cloth used on a bed to keep you warm.', 'I always keep an extra blanket in the car for emergencies.', 'Tôi luôn giữ một chiếc chăn dự phòng trong xe để phòng trường hợp khẩn cấp.', '{\"en\": \"Passengers on the overnight flight can request an extra blanket from the flight attendant.\", \"vi\": \"Hành khách trên chuyến bay đêm có thể yêu cầu thêm chăn từ tiếp viên hàng không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-ljspeech-60791989.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-cori-60791989.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blanket-482cb2a4.webp', '[\"cover\", \"quilt\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"wool blanket\", \"meaning\": \"chăn len\"}, {\"phrase\": \"electric blanket\", \"meaning\": \"chăn điện\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"blanket\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-cori-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru0-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru5-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru6-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru10-60791989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru9-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru3-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru7-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru8-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-aru2-60791989.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-ljspeech-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt408-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt138-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt624-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt396-60791989.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt498-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt132-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt288-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt42-60791989.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blanket-lt90-60791989.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong TOEIC thường xuất hiện trong bối cảnh dịch vụ hàng không hoặc khách sạn.', 'travel', 1, 10),
('d692e3e6-d583-5cbd-949d-98e7189b5fd0', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8b87e05a-a2c4-59a1-bf2c-c275f2a65c86', '427aced2-a7ef-5adc-8430-3c35ec99abbb', 'liability', '/ˌlaɪəˈbɪləti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Trách nhiệm về mặt pháp lý đối với một khoản nợ hoặc thiệt hại.', 'the state of being legally responsible for something.', 'The company accepted full liability for the accident and offered compensation.', 'Công ty đã nhận hoàn toàn trách nhiệm pháp lý về vụ tai nạn và đề nghị bồi thường.', '{\"en\": \"The company accepted full liability for the damaged goods during shipping.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã chấp nhận hoàn toàn trách nhiệm pháp lý đối với hàng hóa bị hư hỏng trong quá trình vận chuyển.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-ljspeech-cf7a5bd0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-cori-cf7a5bd0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/liability-4da0d8ce.webp', '[\"responsibility\", \"obligation\", \"accountability\"]', '[\"immunity\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accept liability\", \"meaning\": \"nhận trách nhiệm pháp lý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"limited liability\", \"meaning\": \"trách nhiệm hữu hạn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"reliability\", \"note_vi\": \"sự đáng tin cậy, tránh nhầm với trách nhiệm pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"liable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-cori-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru0-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru5-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru6-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru10-cf7a5bd0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru9-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru3-cf7a5bd0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/liability-aru7-cf7a5bd