('3c22e9bd-edf8-5f2e-9796-8109f1a2241c', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'circumstance', '/ˈsɜːkəmstəns/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Hoàn cảnh, tình hình hoặc điều kiện cụ thể.', 'a condition or fact that affects an event or a particular situation.', 'Due to unforeseen financial circumstances, the company decided to delay its expansion plan.', 'Do các hoàn cảnh tài chính không lường trước được, công ty đã quyết định hoãn kế hoạch mở rộng.', '{\"en\": \"Due to unforeseen circumstances, the quarterly management meeting has been rescheduled for next Monday.\", \"vi\": \"Do những hoàn cảnh không lường trước được, cuộc họp quản lý hàng quý đã được dời sang thứ Hai tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-ljspeech-a40ec44a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-cori-a40ec44a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/circumstance-731aaf01.webp', '[\"situation\", \"condition\", \"state\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"unforeseen circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn cảnh không lường trước\"}, {\"phrase\": \"under no circumstances\", \"meaning\": \"trong bất kỳ hoàn cảnh nào cũng không\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"circumstantial\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-cori-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru0-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru5-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru6-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru10-a40ec44a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru9-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru3-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru7-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru8-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-aru2-a40ec44a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-ljspeech-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt408-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt138-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt624-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt396-a40ec44a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt498-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt132-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt288-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt42-a40ec44a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/circumstance-lt90-a40ec44a.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'under no circumstances\' thường đi với đảo ngữ trong tiếng Anh.', 'business', 1, 14),
('75e3f5e6-5ea8-5ef0-976c-c593ecad8518', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'physically', '/ˈfɪzɪkli/', 'B1', 'adverb', 'Về mặt thể chất, liên quan đến cơ thể.', 'in a manner that relates to the body rather than the mind or spirit.', 'Regular exercise makes you feel physically stronger and healthier.', 'Tập thể dục đều đặn giúp bạn cảm thấy khỏe mạnh hơn về thể chất.', '{\"en\": \"Factory workers must be physically fit to handle the heavy equipment safely every day.\", \"vi\": \"Công nhân nhà máy phải có sức khỏe tốt về mặt thể chất để vận hành các thiết bị nặng an toàn mỗi ngày.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-ljspeech-6c0f7488.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-cori-6c0f7488.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/physically-d4ee3a38.webp', '[\"corporally\"]', '[\"mentally\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"physically fit\", \"meaning\": \"khỏe mạnh về thể chất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"physically demanding\", \"meaning\": \"đòi hỏi thể lực\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"mentally\", \"note_vi\": \"mentally là về mặt tinh thần hoặc trí óc, trái nghĩa với physically\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"physical\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"physics\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-cori-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru0-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru5-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru6-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru10-6c0f7488.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru9-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru3-6c0f7488.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/physically-aru7-6c0f7488.mp3\", 