('8eb872df-6bd3-582b-a0a1-7d6620e0e19e', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'tackle', 'UK: /ˈtækəl/ | US: /ˈtækəl/', 'B2', 'verb', 'giải quyết, xử lý', 'To make an effort to deal with or solve a difficult problem or situation.', 'The new manager will tackle the issue of staff understaffing immediately.', 'Quản lý mới sẽ giải quyết ngay vấn đề thiếu nhân sự.', '{\"en\": \"The management committee met this morning to tackle the budget deficit.\", \"vi\": \"Ủy ban quản lý đã họp sáng nay để giải quyết vấn đề thâm hụt ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-ljspeech-93d42315.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-cori-93d42315.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tackle-b9e41069.webp', '[\"address\", \"handle\", \"deal with\", \"resolve\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"avoid\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"tackle a problem\", \"meaning\": \"giải quyết một vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tackle a challenge\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt giải quyết thách thức\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-cori-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru0-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru5-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru6-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru10-93d42315.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru9-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru3-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru7-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru8-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-aru2-93d42315.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-ljspeech-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt408-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt138-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt624-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt396-93d42315.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt498-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt132-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt288-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt42-93d42315.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tackle-lt90-93d42315.mp3\"]}}', 'Là ngoại động từ đi thẳng với tân ngữ (tackle a problem / tackle an issue) không cần giới từ.', 'management', 1, 17),
('1ca69a10-e39d-5c07-8298-ec3547422d02', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'committee', 'UK: /kəˈmɪti/ | US: /kəˈmɪti/', 'B2', 'noun', 'ủy ban', 'a group of people chosen to represent a larger organization and make decisions', 'The committee will review all project proposals next week.', 'Ủy ban sẽ xem xét tất cả các đề xuất dự án vào tuần tới.', '{\"en\": \"The organizing committee will review all conference proposals by the end of the week.\", \"vi\": \"Ban tổ chức sẽ xem xét tất cả các đề xuất hội nghị trước cuối tuần.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-ljspeech-faa75322.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-cori-faa75322.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/committee-76362cd1.webp', '[\"board\", \"panel\", \"council\", \"commission\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"steering committee\", \"meaning\": \"ban chỉ đạo\"}, {\"phrase\": \"advisory committee\", \"meaning\": \"ban cố vấn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"commission\", \"note_vi\": \"commission cũng có nghĩa ủy ban nhưng còn có nghĩa phổ biến khác là tiền hoa hồng.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-cori-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru0-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru5-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru6-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru10-faa75322.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru9-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru3-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru7-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru8-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-aru2-faa75322.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-ljspeech-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt408-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt138-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt624-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt396-faa75322.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt498-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt132-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt288-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt42-faa75322.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/committee-lt90-faa75322.mp3\"]}}', 'Là danh từ tập hợp. Trong bài thi TOEIC thường đi với động từ số ít.', 'office', 1, 18),
('ceafe6f6-0078-5cb1-805f-8b7d4ff322bb', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'diversify', '/daɪˈvɜːsɪfaɪ/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'Làm cho cái gì đó trở nên đa dạng hơn.', 'to start to include more different types of things or people in something.', 'Companies often need to diversify their products to reach a wider customer base.', 'Các công ty thường cần đa dạng hóa sản phẩm của mình để tiếp cận nhiều đối tượng khách hàng hơn.', '{\"en\": \"To reduce financial risk, the investment firm decided to diversify its portfolio.\", \"vi\": \"Để giảm thiểu rủi ro tài chính, công ty đầu tư quyết định đa dạng hóa danh mục đầu tư của mình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-ljspeech-5806b64a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-cori-5806b64a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/diversify-0ffb0687.webp', '[\"vary\", \"expand\", \"branch out\"]', '[\"specialize\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"diversify investments\", \"meaning\": \"đa dạng hóa các khoản đầu tư\"}, {\"phrase\": \"diversify the product range\", \"meaning\": \"đa dạng hóa dòng sản phẩm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"divert\", \"note_vi\": \"divert là làm chệch hướng hoặc làm phân tâm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"diverse\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diversity\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"diversification\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-cori-5806b64a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-aru0-5806b64a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-aru5-5806b64a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-aru6-5806b64a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-aru10-5806b64a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/diversify-aru9-5806b64a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunc