('a64292a2-70e6-5496-ba89-e4370524652e', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'judge', '/dʒʌdʒ/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đánh giá hoặc đưa ra ý kiến về ai đó/điều gì đó.', 'To evaluate or form a considered conclusion regarding the quality or value of something.', 'It\'s unfair to judge a book by its cover; you should read it first.', 'Đánh giá một cuốn sách qua bìa của nó là không công bằng; bạn nên đọc nó trước đã.', '{\"en\": \"The panel will judge all business proposals based on their financial feasibility.\", \"vi\": \"Hội đồng sẽ đánh giá tất cả các đề xuất kinh doanh dựa trên khả năng thi thi hành tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-ljspeech-d1c10fb0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-cori-d1c10fb0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/judge-9052c90f.webp', '[\"evaluate\", \"assess\", \"estimate\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"judge objectively\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá khách quan\"}, {\"phrase\": \"judge by appearance\", \"meaning\": \"đánh giá qua vẻ bề ngoài\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"adjudicate\", \"note_vi\": \"dùng trong bối cảnh xét xử pháp lý chính thức hơn\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"judge\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"judgment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-cori-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru0-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru5-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru6-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru10-d1c10fb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru9-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru3-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru7-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru8-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-aru2-d1c10fb0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-ljspeech-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt408-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt138-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt624-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt396-d1c10fb0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt498-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt132-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt288-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt42-d1c10fb0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/judge-lt90-d1c10fb0.mp3\"]}}', 'Động từ judge thường đi với giới từ by khi nói về căn cứ đánh giá.', 'office', 1, 25),
('77208933-b723-5b40-9b2a-71bf832d41af', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', '8d4720c5-92f0-5b25-9d9a-cae2b63490f6', 'c378b129-9b54-5189-8e7a-f9eb48303f23', 'mentor', '/ˈmentɔː(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Người có kinh nghiệm hướng dẫn, hỗ trợ người khác phát triển.', 'A knowledgeable individual who offers guidance, support, and advice to a less experienced peer.', 'A good mentor can provide valuable advice and support throughout your career.', 'Một người cố vấn tốt có thể đưa ra lời khuyên và hỗ trợ quý giá trong suốt sự nghiệp của bạn.', '{\"en\": \"Every new employee is assigned a mentor to guide them through the training process.\", \"vi\": \"Mỗi nhân viên mới đều được chỉ định một người cố vấn để hướng dẫn họ qua quá trình đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-ljspeech-c17e7c31.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-cori-c17e7c31.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/mentor-49781a62.webp', '[\"advisor\", \"guide\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"act as a mentor\", \"meaning\": \"đóng vai trò cố vấn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"find a mentor\", \"meaning\": \"tìm người cố vấn\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"mentorship\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-cori-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru0-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru5-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru6-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru10-c17e7c31.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru9-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru3-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru7-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru8-c17e7c31.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/mentor-aru2-c17e7c31.m