('d2dfd25e-a3f2-56ef-8ff9-f5ee532cec94', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'aabd4177-7ad1-5113-b933-289cac6e54e6', '51a8f1f3-d343-5f6f-9dc6-e998f2ef38a1', 'anxious', '/ˈæŋkʃəs/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Cảm thấy lo lắng, bồn chồn về điều gì đó.', 'feeling worried or nervous because you are not sure about the result of something.', 'The manager was anxious while waiting for the board\'s decision on the budget proposal.', 'Quản lý đã lo lắng khi chờ đợi quyết định của hội đồng về đề xuất ngân sách.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees felt anxious about the upcoming company restructuring and potential job losses.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy lo lắng về việc tái cơ cấu công ty sắp tới và nguy cơ mất việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-ljspeech-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/anxious-5ebf0d83.webp', '[\"worried\", \"nervous\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"anxious about\", \"meaning\": \"lo lắng về\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel anxious\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy lo âu\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"anxiety\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-cori-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru0-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru5-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru6-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru10-3d58dabf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru9-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru3-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru7-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru8-3d58dabf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/anxious-aru2-3d58dabf.mp3\"]}, \"