('ced8206a-7e7e-5905-b6ee-6bd47c9f90e3', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'bd06fdb4-aaee-573a-88da-8be75b94f77f', '7d041f49-ed3c-576f-b4fb-1a623a43534d', 'tier', '/tɪə(r)/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Một cấp độ hoặc tầng trong một hệ thống phân cấp.', 'one of several levels or layers, often arranged one above the other in a structure.', 'The company offers different membership tiers with various benefits.', 'Công ty cung cấp các cấp độ thành viên khác nhau với nhiều lợi ích.', '{\"en\": \"The new subscription plan offers three tiers of service based on the company\'s monthly budget.\", \"vi\": \"Gói đăng ký mới cung cấp ba cấp độ dịch vụ dựa trên ngân sách hàng tháng của công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-ljspeech-600279c8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-cori-600279c8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tier-949d3ac2.webp', '[\"level\", \"layer\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"top tier\", \"meaning\": \"cấp cao nhất\"}, {\"phrase\": \"price tier\", \"meaning\": \"mức giá\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"tear\", \"note_vi\": \"tear là nước mắt hoặc xé, tier là tầng/cấp.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-cori-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru0-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru5-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru6-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru10-600279c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru9-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru3-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru7-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru8-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-aru2-600279c8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-ljspeech-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt408-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt138-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt624-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt396-600279c8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt498-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt132-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt288-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt42-600279c8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tier-lt90-600279c8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong kinh doanh để chỉ các gói dịch vụ hoặc cấp bậc.', 'business', 1, 17),
('4aed5a52-3b13-58ea-8bc7-9f6ec71d8b73', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'bd06fdb4-aaee-573a-88da-8be75b94f77f', '7d041f49-ed3c-576f-b4fb-1a623a43534d', 'encouragement', '/ɪnˈkʌrɪdʒmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Sự động viên, khích lệ.', 'words or action that give someone support, confidence, or hope to do something.', 'The supervisor offered constant encouragement to the new interns during their training period.', 'Người giám sát đã liên tục đưa ra lời động viên cho các thực tập sinh mới trong suốt thời gian đào tạo.', '{\"en\": \"The manager offered constant encouragement to the new interns during their training period.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã đưa ra sự khuyến khích liên tục cho các thực tập sinh mới trong suốt thời gian đào tạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-ljspeech-d0e72539.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-cori-d0e72539.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/encouragement-aa593089.webp', '[\"support\", \"motivation\", \"inspiration\"]', '[\"discouragement\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"words of encouragement\", \"meaning\": \"những lời động viên\"}, {\"phrase\": \"give encouragement\", \"meaning\": \"khuyến khích, động viên\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"encourage\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"encouraging\"}, {\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"encouragingly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-cori-d0e72539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru0-d0e72539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru5-d0e72539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru6-d0e72539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru10-d0e72539.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru9-d0e72539.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/encouragement-aru