('90409b87-f7ef-5e5b-a01f-c731eca6f8f9', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'bd06fdb4-aaee-573a-88da-8be75b94f77f', '7d041f49-ed3c-576f-b4fb-1a623a43534d', 'risk', '/rɪsk/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Khả năng xảy ra điều không mong muốn, nguy hiểm.', 'the possibility of something dangerous, unpleasant, or bad happening in a situation.', 'There is a high risk of injury if you don\'t wear protective gear.', 'Có nguy cơ chấn thương cao nếu bạn không mặc đồ bảo hộ.', '{\"en\": \"Investing in new technology involves a financial risk that management must evaluate carefully.\", \"vi\": \"Việc đầu tư vào công nghệ mới tiềm ẩn rủi ro tài chính mà ban quản lý phải đánh giá kỹ lưỡng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-ljspeech-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/risk-8f478e8e.webp', '[\"danger\", \"hazard\", \"threat\"]', '[\"safety\", \"security\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"take a risk\", \"meaning\": \"chấp nhận rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at risk\", \"meaning\": \"gặp nguy hiểm, có rủi ro\"}, {\"phrase\": \"reduce risk\", \"meaning\": \"giảm thiểu rủi ro\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"risky\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-cori-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru0-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru5-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru6-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru10-11a110bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru9-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru3-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru7-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru8-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-aru2-11a110bb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-ljspeech-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt408-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt138-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt624-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt396-11a110bb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt498-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt132-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt288-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt42-11a110bb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/risk-lt90-11a110bb.mp3\"]}}', 'Risk vừa là danh từ (rủi ro) vừa là động từ (liều mạng/mạo hiểm).', 'finance', 1, 27),
('fd41b244-2651-597f-87c2-52befe992a5d', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'bd06fdb4-aaee-573a-88da-8be75b94f77f', '7d041f49-ed3c-576f-b4fb-1a623a43534d', 'claim', '/kleɪm/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Phát biểu rằng điều gì đó là sự thật mà không cần bằng chứng.', 'to state that something is true even though it has not been proved.', 'He claims to be an expert, but he doesn\'t have much experience.', 'Anh ta tuyên bố mình là chuyên gia, nhưng anh ta không có nhiều kinh nghiệm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager will claim that the project was completed on time during the meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý sẽ tuyên bố rằng dự án đã hoàn thành đúng hạn trong cuộc họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-ljspeech-013872e3.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-cori-013872e3.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/claim-6061e0d8.webp', '[\"assert\", \"state\", \"declare\"]', '[\"deny\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"claim responsibility\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố nhận trách nhiệm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"claim that\", \"meaning\": \"tuyên bố rằng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"exclaim\", \"note_vi\": \"thốt lên do ngạc nhiên hoặc cảm xúc mạnh\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"claim\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"claimant\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-cori-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru0-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru5-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru6-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru10-013872e3.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru9-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru3-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru7-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/claim-aru8-013872e3.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object