('eab663c8-e6e8-582d-a7f2-1bd3d6a7529b', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd3b89f70-2a74-5ffa-bf40-783e3bf806a9', '905a7106-fc20-5066-a01f-f183324a3fab', 'retail', 'UK: /ˈriːteɪl/ | US: /ˈriːteɪl/', 'B2', 'noun', 'bán lẻ', 'the business of selling goods directly to individual consumers for their personal use rather than resale.', 'The new mall will offer a variety of retail stores.', 'Trung tâm thương mại mới sẽ cung cấp nhiều cửa hàng bán lẻ.', '{\"en\": \"The retail industry saw a significant increase in online sales during the holiday shopping season.\", \"vi\": \"Ngành bán lẻ đã ghi nhận sự gia tăng đáng kể về doanh số bán hàng trực tuyến trong mùa mua sắm lễ tết.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-ljspeech-46bb7e3c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-cori-46bb7e3c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/retail-33b75b52.webp', '[\"merchandising\", \"selling\"]', '[\"wholesale\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"retail store\", \"meaning\": \"cửa hàng bán lẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"retail price\", \"meaning\": \"giá bán lẻ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"retail outlet\", \"meaning\": \"đại lý/điểm bán lẻ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"wholesale\", \"note_vi\": \"Retail là bán lẻ tới tay người tiêu dùng cuối; wholesale là bán buôn số lượng lớn cho đại lý.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"retail\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"retailer\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-cori-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru0-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru5-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru6-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru10-46bb7e3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru9-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru3-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru7-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru8-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-aru2-46bb7e3c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-ljspeech-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt408-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt138-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt624-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt396-46bb7e3c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt498-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt132-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt288-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt42-46bb7e3c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/retail-lt90-46bb7e3c.mp3\"]}}', '\'Retail\' (bán lẻ trực tiếp cho khách tiêu dùng) trái nghĩa với \'wholesale\' (bán buôn/bán sỉ).', 'shopping', 1, 9),
('db9503fd-6087-5817-86a7-776e1fd4dbba', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd3b89f70-2a74-5ffa-bf40-783e3bf806a9', '905a7106-fc20-5066-a01f-f183324a3fab', 'chief', 'UK: /tʃiːf/ | US: /tʃiːf/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'chính, trọng yếu', 'holding the highest rank or being the most important element among several options.', 'The chief concern is customer satisfaction.', 'Mối quan tâm chính là sự hài lòng của khách hàng.', '{\"en\": \"Increasing market share is the chief objective of our marketing campaign.\", \"vi\": \"Gia tăng thị phần là mục tiêu chính trong chiến dịch tiếp thị của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-ljspeech-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/chief-4021343c.webp', '[\"main\", \"primary\", \"principal\", \"leading\"]', '[\"minor\", \"secondary\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"chief objective\", \"meaning\": \"mục tiêu chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chief executive officer\", \"meaning\": \"giám đốc điều hành (CEO)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"chief reason\", \"meaning\": \"lý do chính\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"chef\", \"note_vi\": \"Chef là đầu bếp, còn chief là người đứng đầu hoặc có tính chất chính yếu.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"chiefly\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-cori-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru0-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru5-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru6-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru10-c4b038d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru9-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru3-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru7-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru8-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-aru2-c4b038d0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-ljspeech-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt408-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt138-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt624-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt396-c4b038d0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt498-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt132-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt288-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt42-c4b038d0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/chief-lt90-c4b038d0.mp3\"]}}', 'Ngoài tính từ (chính, chủ yếu), \'chief\' còn là danh từ chỉ người đứng đầu (Chief Executive Officer - CEO).', 'management', 1, 10),
('93138363-8b23-5e8a-a043-c28477019bfd', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd3b89f70-2a74-5ffa-bf40-783e3bf806a9', '905a7106-fc20-5066-a01f-f183324a3fab', 'fill out', '/fɪl aʊt/', 'A2', 'phrasal verb', 'Hoàn thành một biểu mẫu hoặc tài liệu bằng cách điền thông tin.', 'To complete an official questionnaire or paper by entering required details into specified blanks.', 'Please remember to fill out all the required sections of the application form.', 'Xin hãy nhớ điền đầy đủ tất cả các phần bắt buộc của mẫu đơn đăng ký.', '{\"en\": \"Please fill out the registration form before you enter the conference room this morning.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng điền vào mẫu đăng ký trước khi bạn vào phòng hội nghị sáng nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-ljspeech-d5e7896f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-cori-d5e7896f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fill-out-3f75a5dc.webp', '[\"complete\", \"fill in\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"fill out a form\", \"meaning\": \"điền vào mẫu đơn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"fill out an application\", \"meaning\": \"điền vào đơn ứng tuyển\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"fill in\", \"note_vi\": \"Tương đương, nhưng \'fill out\' nhấn mạnh việc hoàn thành toàn bộ form.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-cori-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru0-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru5-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru6-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru10-d5e7896f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru9-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru3-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru7-d5e7896f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fill-out-aru8-