('14abaee9-c067-52ff-a7b8-6669f1c18349', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd58b5a66-0911-5432-9104-41a5a08081e4', 'e6b9d9b3-5538-59eb-bdaa-23b8352b312a', 'admire', '/ədˈmaɪə(r)/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Kính trọng và thích ai đó hoặc điều gì đó.', 'to look at someone or something with pleasure and respect for their good qualities.', 'Many young employees admire the CEO for his leadership and professional integrity.', 'Nhiều nhân viên trẻ ngưỡng mộ vị giám đốc điều hành vì năng lực lãnh đạo và sự liêm chính trong nghề nghiệp của ông.', '{\"en\": \"We all admire the CEO for her ability to lead the company through difficult financial times.\", \"vi\": \"Tất cả chúng tôi đều ngưỡng mộ nữ CEO vì khả năng lãnh đạo công ty vượt qua những thời điểm tài chính khó khăn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-ljspeech-af964fdf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-cori-af964fdf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/admire-9bcb7b21.webp', '[\"respect\", \"appreciate\"]', '[\"despise\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"greatly admire\", \"meaning\": \"rất ngưỡng mộ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"admire someone for\", \"meaning\": \"ngưỡng mộ ai vì điều gì\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"admiration\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-cori-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru0-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru5-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru6-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru10-af964fdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru9-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru3-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru7-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru8-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-aru2-af964fdf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-ljspeech-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt408-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt138-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt624-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt396-af964fdf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt498-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt132-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt288-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt42-af964fdf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admire-lt90-af964fdf.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để bày tỏ sự tôn trọng đối với năng lực hoặc phẩm chất.', 'office', 1, 14),
('a1568c44-664b-5fb2-9f95-f67049635ba3', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd58b5a66-0911-5432-9104-41a5a08081e4', 'e6b9d9b3-5538-59eb-bdaa-23b8352b312a', 'casual', '/ˈkæʒuəl/', 'B2', 'adjective', 'thông thường, bình thường, không trang trọng.', 'suitable for informal situations rather than formal or official events.', 'For the office picnic, you can wear casual clothes like jeans and a T-shirt.', 'Đối với buổi dã ngoại của văn phòng, bạn có thể mặc quần áo thông thường như quần jean và áo phông.', '{\"en\": \"Employees are allowed to wear casual clothes on Fridays in this corporate office.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên được phép mặc quần áo bình thường vào thứ Sáu tại văn phòng công ty này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-ljspeech-7b664f70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-cori-7b664f70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/casual-b3ea0506.webp', '[\"informal\", \"relaxed\"]', '[\"formal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"casual clothes\", \"meaning\": \"trang phục thường ngày\"}, {\"phrase\": \"casual wear\", \"meaning\": \"quần áo thường ngày\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"causal\", \"note_vi\": \"causal thuộc về nguyên nhân, casual là bình thường/không trang trọng.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adverb\", \"word\": \"casually\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-cori-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru0-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru5-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru6-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru10-7b664f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru9-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru3-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru7-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru8-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-aru2-7b664f70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-ljspeech-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt408-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt138-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt624-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt396-7b664f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt498-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt132-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt288-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt42-7b664f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/casual-lt90-7b664f70.mp3\"]}}', 'Chú ý chính tả: casual (bình thường) rất dễ viết nhầm thành causal (nguyên nhân).', 'office', 1, 15),
('6979dcc2-2ab3-54d3-a8c2-63e3fc677116', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd58b5a66-0911-5432-9104-41a5a08081e4', 'e6b9d9b3-5538-59eb-bdaa-23b8352b312a', 'applaud', 'UK: /əˈplɔːd/ | US: /əˈplɔːd/', 'B2', 'verb', 'tán dương, vỗ tay', 'To show strong approval or praise by striking one\'s hands together loudly.', 'The CEO applauded the team\'s efforts on the new project.', 'CEO đã tán dương những nỗ lực của nhóm trong dự án mới.', '{\"en\": \"Board members applauded the CEO for her outstanding leadership during the crisis.\", \"vi\": \"Các thành viên hội đồng quản trị đã khen ngợi Giám đốc điều hành vì sự lãnh đạo xuất sắc của bà trong thời kỳ khủng hoảng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-ljspeech-d1f669ed.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-cori-d1f669ed.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/applaud-fa0cba33.webp', '[\"praise\", \"commend\", \"clap\"]', '[\"criticize\", \"condemn\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"applaud a decision\", \"meaning\": \"hoan nghênh một quyết định\"}, {\"phrase\": \"applaud warmly\", \"meaning\": \"nhiệt liệt vỗ tay tán thưởng\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"applause\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-cori-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru0-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru5-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru6-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru10-d1f669ed.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru9-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru3-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru7-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru8-d1f669ed.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/applaud-aru2-d1f669ed.mp3\"