('42d9fe2a-54db-508a-85b0-495de2b277e5', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'd58b5a66-0911-5432-9104-41a5a08081e4', 'e6b9d9b3-5538-59eb-bdaa-23b8352b312a', 'profitably', '/ˈprɒfɪtəbli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Một cách có lợi nhuận, mang lại tiền lời.', 'in a way that makes more money than the amount spent on a business activity.', 'The company managed to operate profitably even during the economic downturn.', 'Công ty đã xoay sở để hoạt động có lợi nhuận ngay cả trong thời kỳ suy thoái kinh tế.', '{\"en\": \"Our retail branch has been trading profitably since the new manager took over last year.\", \"vi\": \"Chi nhánh bán lẻ của chúng tôi đã kinh doanh có lợi nhuận kể từ khi người quản lý mới tiếp quản năm ngoái.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-ljspeech-187a1f1b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-cori-187a1f1b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/profitably-9723a7fc.webp', '[\"lucratively\", \"gainfully\"]', '[\"unprofitably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"operate profitably\", \"meaning\": \"vận hành có lãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"grow profitably\", \"meaning\": \"phát triển có lợi nhuận\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"profit\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"profitable\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-cori-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru0-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru5-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru6-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru10-187a1f1b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru9-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru3-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/profitably-aru7-187a1f1b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronuncia