('b0323867-2d0f-5756-8d8b-e33cb738dca9', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'e835ce7b-ff5f-5317-afd9-b4a37b50d589', 'a121933b-7c8f-5070-bb89-a7a5da6023d5', 'deadline', '/ˈdedlaɪn/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Thời hạn cuối cùng để hoàn thành một công việc hoặc nhiệm vụ.', 'a time or day by which something must be finished.', 'We need to submit the report before the Friday deadline.', 'Chúng ta cần nộp báo cáo trước hạn chót vào thứ Sáu.', '{\"en\": \"We are working hard to meet the strict deadline for the new product launch.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi đang làm việc chăm chỉ để kịp thời hạn nghiêm ngặt cho việc ra mắt sản phẩm mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-ljspeech-e23839cd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-cori-e23839cd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deadline-ba7155e3.webp', '[\"time limit\", \"due date\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"meet a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"kịp hạn chót\"}, {\"phrase\": \"miss a deadline\", \"meaning\": \"trễ hạn chót\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-cori-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru0-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru5-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru6-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru10-e23839cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru9-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru3-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru7-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru8-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-aru2-e23839cd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-ljspeech-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt408-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt138-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt624-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt396-e23839cd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt498-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt132-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt288-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt42-e23839cd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deadline-lt90-e23839cd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'meet the deadline\' rất hay xuất hiện trong bài thi TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 29),
('d7c43728-816d-5e6b-9d97-0b97de5c7917', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'admit', '/ədˈmɪt/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Đồng ý rằng điều gì đó là đúng, thường là miễn cưỡng.', 'to agree that something is true or that you have done something wrong or bad.', 'The museum will admit visitors free of charge on the first Sunday of every month.', 'Bảo tàng sẽ cho phép du khách vào cửa miễn phí vào Chủ Nhật đầu tiên của mỗi tháng.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor had to admit that the project deadline was too tight for the team.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát phải thừa nhận rằng thời hạn dự án là quá gấp rút đối với nhóm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/admit-8919f5df.webp', '[\"confess\", \"acknowledge\"]', '[\"deny\", \"reject\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"admit to\", \"meaning\": \"thừa nhận\"}, {\"phrase\": \"freely admit\", \"meaning\": \"thẳng thắn thừa nhận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"confess\", \"note_vi\": \"admit là thừa nhận sự thật, confess là thú tội (thường là tội lỗi).\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"admission\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"admissible\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-cori-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru0-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru5-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru6-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru10-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru9-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru3-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru7-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru8-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-aru2-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-ljspeech-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt408-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt138-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt624-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt396-4a4f47d5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt498-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt132-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt288-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt42-4a4f47d5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/admit-lt90-4a4f47d5.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc: admit (to) doing something.', 'office', 1, 0),
('7efa71aa-2531-5b6a-8fc7-6fba615ea02a', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'monitor', '/ˈmɒnɪtə(r)/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Theo dõi, giám sát một cách cẩn thận.', 'to watch and check a situation carefully for a period of time.', 'Parents should monitor their children\'s internet usage.', 'Cha mẹ nên giám sát việc sử dụng internet của con cái.', '{\"en\": \"Managers should monitor the progress of the project to ensure deadlines are met.\", \"vi\": \"Các quản lý nên giám sát tiến độ của dự án để đảm bảo thời hạn được đáp ứng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-ljspeech-9796809f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/monitor-87856ddd.webp', '[\"supervise\", \"track\", \"observe\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"monitor progress\", \"meaning\": \"giám sát tiến độ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"monitor performance\", \"meaning\": \"giám sát hiệu suất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"monitor\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-cori-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru0-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru5-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru6-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru10-9796809f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru9-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru3-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru7-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru8-9796809f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-aru2-9796809f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/monitor-l