('706dafbf-8232-5746-8baf-27b411b923e8', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'deduct', '/dɪˈdʌkt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Khấu trừ, trừ đi.', 'to take an amount of money away from a total before you pay someone.', 'You can deduct business travel expenses when filing your tax return this year.', 'Bạn có thể khấu trừ các chi phí đi tác nghiệp khi nộp tờ khai thuế năm nay.', '{\"en\": \"The accounting department will deduct the cost of the damaged equipment from your monthly paycheck.\", \"vi\": \"Phòng kế toán sẽ khấu trừ chi phí thiết bị bị hỏng từ tiền lương hàng tháng của bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-ljspeech-adebab7e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-cori-adebab7e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/deduct-e7bf8000.webp', '[\"subtract\", \"remove\"]', '[\"add\", \"increase\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"deduct from\", \"meaning\": \"khấu trừ từ\"}, {\"phrase\": \"tax deduction\", \"meaning\": \"sự khấu trừ thuế\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"conduct\", \"note_vi\": \"conduct là tiến hành, deduct là khấu trừ.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"deduction\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-cori-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru0-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru5-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru6-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru10-adebab7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru9-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru3-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru7-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru8-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-aru2-adebab7e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-ljspeech-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt408-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt138-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt624-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt396-adebab7e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt498-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt132-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt288-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt42-adebab7e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/deduct-lt90-adebab7e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong bảng lương hoặc hóa đơn.', 'finance', 1, 10),
('70f23013-4a38-5c01-a549-b19029b63253', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'concern', '/kənˈsɜːn/', 'B1', 'verb', 'Có liên quan hoặc ảnh hưởng đến ai/cái gì.', 'to be about something or to affect or involve someone directly.', 'The new policy primarily concerns employee benefits.', 'Chính sách mới chủ yếu liên quan đến phúc lợi của nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"This new policy concerns all staff who work in the finance department.\", \"vi\": \"Chính sách mới này liên quan đến tất cả nhân viên làm việc trong bộ phận tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-ljspeech-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/concern-cf08ed6d.webp', '[\"involve\", \"affect\", \"relate to\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"concern yourself with\", \"meaning\": \"quan tâm đến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"as far as ... is concerned\", \"meaning\": \"về phần ... / liên quan đến ...\"}, {\"phrase\": \"concern all parties\", \"meaning\": \"liên quan đến tất cả các bên\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"concern\", \"note_vi\": \"concern là danh từ \'mối lo ngại\', động từ \'liên quan đến\', chú ý ngữ cảnh (noun)\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"concern\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"concerned\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"concerning\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-cori-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru0-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru5-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru6-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru10-c5c3bf59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru9-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru3-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru7-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru8-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-aru2-c5c3bf59.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-ljspeech-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt408-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt138-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt624-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt396-c5c3bf59.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt498-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt132-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt288-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt42-c5c3bf59.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/concern-lt90-c5c3bf59.mp3\"]}}', '\'as far as I\'m concerned\' là cụm cố định nghĩa \'theo tôi thấy\', rất hay gặp trong TOEIC.', 'office', 1, 11),
('e65351a3-1f33-552a-ab95-870c74532186', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'obligate', '/ˈɒblɪɡeɪt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Buộc ai đó phải làm gì theo luật pháp hoặc đạo đức.', 'to force someone to do something because of a law or rule.', 'As a citizen, you are obligated to pay your taxes every year.', 'Là một công dân, bạn có nghĩa vụ phải nộp thuế hàng năm.', '{\"en\": \"The contract will obligate the supplier to deliver the goods within ten business days.\", \"vi\": \"Hợp đồng sẽ bắt buộc nhà cung cấp phải giao hàng trong vòng mười ngày làm việc.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-ljspeech-24dafddb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-cori-24dafddb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/obligate-849e15a8.webp', '[\"compel\", \"force\", \"require\"]', '[\"permit\", \"exempt\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"obligate someone to do\", \"meaning\": \"bắt buộc ai đó làm gì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"feel obligated\", \"meaning\": \"cảm thấy có nghĩa vụ\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"oblige\", \"note_vi\": \"oblige mang nghĩa giúp đỡ hoặc bắt buộc, obligate chỉ mang nghĩa bắt buộc pháp lý\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"obligation\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"obligatory\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-cori-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru0-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru5-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru6-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru10-24dafddb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru9-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru3-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/obligate-aru7-24dafddb.mp3\", \"/s