('0ef97862-e3a5-59dd-8835-fac4cf0f6b4f', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'charge', '/tʃɑːdʒ/', 'A2', 'verb', 'Yêu cầu thanh toán một số tiền cho dịch vụ hoặc hàng hóa.', 'to ask an amount of money for a service or activity.', 'The hotel will charge you an extra fee for late check-out.', 'Khách sạn sẽ tính thêm phí cho bạn nếu trả phòng muộn.', '{\"en\": \"The hotel will charge a small fee if you request a late checkout tomorrow.\", \"vi\": \"Khách sạn sẽ tính một khoản phí nhỏ nếu bạn yêu cầu trả phòng trễ vào ngày mai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-ljspeech-5ea9c348.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-cori-5ea9c348.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/charge-5aa1d017.webp', '[\"bill\", \"invoice\", \"demand\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"charge a fee\", \"meaning\": \"tính phí\"}, {\"phrase\": \"charge interest\", \"meaning\": \"tính lãi\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"cost\", \"note_vi\": \"cost là trị giá bao nhiêu, charge là chủ động đòi/tính phí\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"charge\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-cori-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru0-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru5-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru6-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru10-5ea9c348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru9-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru3-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru7-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru8-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-aru2-5ea9c348.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-ljspeech-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt408-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt138-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt624-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt396-5ea9c348.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt498-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt132-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt288-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt42-5ea9c348.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/charge-lt90-5ea9c348.mp3\"]}}', 'Cấu trúc thường gặp: charge someone for something (tính phí ai về cái gì).', 'finance', 1, 16),
('8f308f9c-34b5-5ff4-8234-6c6da9e38258', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'success', '/səkˈses/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Sự thành công, đạt được mục tiêu mong muốn.', 'the achievement of desired results, goals, or a high status in a particular field.', 'Hard work and dedication are key factors for success in any field.', 'Làm việc chăm chỉ và cống hiến là những yếu tố then chốt để thành công trong bất kỳ lĩnh vực nào.', '{\"en\": \"The success of the marketing campaign led to a significant increase in our quarterly revenue.\", \"vi\": \"Sự thành công của chiến dịch tiếp thị đã dẫn đến sự gia tăng đáng kể doanh thu hàng quý của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-ljspeech-53a5687c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-cori-53a5687c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/success-435c1274.webp', '[\"achievement\", \"triumph\"]', '[\"failure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"achieve success\", \"meaning\": \"đạt được thành công\"}, {\"phrase\": \"ensure success\", \"meaning\": \"đảm bảo thành công\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"succeed\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"successful\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-cori-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru0-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru5-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru6-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru10-53a5687c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru9-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru3-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru7-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/success-aru8-53a5687c.mp3\", \"/st