('8a3305a1-af1f-5e7c-8a17-c12e0115757d', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'analyze', 'UK: /ˈæn.ə.laɪz/ | US: /ˈæn.ə.laɪz/', 'B1', 'verb', 'phân tích', 'to examine something methodically and in detail to understand its essential features.', 'They need to analyze the data before making a decision.', 'Họ cần phân tích dữ liệu trước khi đưa ra quyết định.', '{\"en\": \"Engineers need to analyze the test results before approving the new model.\", \"vi\": \"Các kỹ sư cần phân tích kết quả thử nghiệm trước khi phê duyệt mẫu mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-ljspeech-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/analyze-f40eca88.webp', '[\"examine\", \"inspect\", \"evaluate\", \"assess\"]', '[\"ignore\", \"neglect\", \"overlook\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"analyze data\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích dữ liệu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"analyze results\", \"meaning\": \"phân tích kết quả\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analysis\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"analyst\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"analytical\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-cori-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru0-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru5-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru6-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru10-6257f84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru9-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru3-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru7-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru8-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-aru2-6257f84c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-ljspeech-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt408-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt138-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt624-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt396-6257f84c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt498-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt132-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt288-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt42-6257f84c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/analyze-lt90-6257f84c.mp3\"]}}', 'Tiếng Anh-Mỹ viết là \'analyze\', còn tiếng Anh-Anh viết là \'analyse\'.', 'office', 1, 20),
('226e4fa0-7bf9-5cb2-9d1f-2af497c31ea4', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'f630ea06-1553-585d-9e3e-228224219279', '80325265-481a-57a0-ae1c-64ae17b294a1', 'detect', '/dɪˈtekt/', 'B2', 'verb', 'Tìm ra hoặc nhận thấy sự hiện diện của điều gì đó.', 'to notice or discover something that is not easy to see or hear clearly.', 'Modern technology can detect very small changes in the environment.', 'Công nghệ hiện đại có thể phát hiện những thay đổi rất nhỏ trong môi trường.', '{\"en\": \"The quality control team could not detect any defects in the latest shipment of goods.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kiểm soát chất lượng không thể phát hiện bất kỳ lỗi nào trong lô hàng mới nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-ljspeech-2b66455f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-cori-2b66455f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/detect-31ae1a5c.webp', '[\"discover\", \"identify\"]', '[\"miss\", \"overlook\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"detect a problem\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"detect a change\", \"meaning\": \"phát hiện sự thay đổi\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"detection\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"detector\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-cori-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru0-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru5-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru6-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru10-2b66455f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru9-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru3-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru7-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru8-2b66455f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/detect-aru2-