('9cdec653-ad39-5f60-a750-a9af87598b03', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'accomplishment', '/əˈkʌmplɪʃmənt/', 'B2', 'noun', 'Thành quả đạt được sau nỗ lực.', 'something successful or impressive that somebody has done after making a lot of effort.', 'Securing the international contract was considered a remarkable accomplishment for the sales division.', 'Giành được hợp đồng quốc tế được xem là một thành tựu đáng chú ý của bộ phận kinh doanh.', '{\"en\": \"Completing the major construction project ahead of schedule was a significant accomplishment for the team.\", \"vi\": \"Việc hoàn thành dự án xây dựng lớn trước thời hạn là một thành tựu đáng kể của đội ngũ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-ljspeech-b0495f6e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-cori-b0495f6e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/accomplishment-f2eadb61.webp', '[\"achievement\", \"attainment\"]', '[\"failure\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"great accomplishment\", \"meaning\": \"thành tựu lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"sense of accomplishment\", \"meaning\": \"cảm giác thành tựu\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"achievement\", \"note_vi\": \"cả hai đều chỉ thành tựu, nhưng accomplishment nhấn mạnh vào kỹ năng và nỗ lực hoàn thành\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"accomplish\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"accomplished\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-cori-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru0-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru5-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru6-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru10-b0495f6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru9-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru3-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru7-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru8-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-aru2-b0495f6e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-ljspeech-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt408-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt138-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt624-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt396-b0495f6e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt498-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt132-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt288-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt42-b0495f6e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/accomplishment-lt90-b0495f6e.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm \'a sense of accomplishment\' (cảm giác tự hào/thành tựu) rất hay xuất hiện.', 'hr', 1, 6),
('a9e04f72-6c7a-5a0b-9595-7705c130e343', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'on track', '/ɒn træk/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Đang tiến hành theo đúng kế hoạch hoặc mục tiêu đã định.', 'making progress as expected towards a goal or meeting a scheduled deadline.', 'Sales figures remain on track to reach our financial targets by the quarter end.', 'Doanh số bán hàng vẫn đi đúng hướng để đạt được các mục tiêu tài chính của chúng tôi vào cuối quý.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team is on track to meet the quarterly target by next week.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kinh doanh của chúng tôi đang đi đúng hướng để đạt mục tiêu quý vào tuần tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-ljspeech-464e4361.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-cori-464e4361.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/on-track-26e402fc.webp', '[\"on schedule\", \"progressing\"]', '[\"off track\", \"behind schedule\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"stay on track\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vững tiến độ/đúng hướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"keep somebody on track\", \"meaning\": \"giúp ai đi đúng hướng\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"off track\", \"note_vi\": \"Off track mang nghĩa ngược lại: chệch hướng, sai tiến độ.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-cori-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru0-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru5-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru6-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru10-464e4361.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru9-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru3-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/on-track-aru7-464e4361.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pro