('bc0996e7-0357-549d-b5fd-bae8471343b8', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'productive', '/prəˈdʌktɪv/', 'B1', 'adjective', 'Có năng suất cao, hiệu quả.', 'doing a lot of work and achieving good results in a short period of time.', 'Working from home helped the software developers remain highly productive throughout the week.', 'Làm việc tại nhà đã giúp các lập trình viên phần mềm duy trì hiệu quả công việc cao trong suốt cả tuần.', '{\"en\": \"Our team had a highly productive morning finalizing the project proposal for the new client.\", \"vi\": \"Nhóm chúng tôi đã có một buổi sáng làm việc hiệu quả để hoàn thiện đề xuất dự án cho khách hàng mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/productive-7335048c.webp', '[\"efficient\", \"fruitful\"]', '[\"unproductive\", \"inefficient\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"productive meeting\", \"meaning\": \"cuộc họp hiệu quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"highly productive\", \"meaning\": \"rất năng suất\"}]', NULL, '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"production\"}, {\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"produce\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-cori-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru0-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru5-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru6-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru10-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru9-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru3-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru7-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru8-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-aru2-f3f80621.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-ljspeech-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt408-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt138-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt624-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt396-f3f80621.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt498-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt132-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt288-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt42-f3f80621.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/productive-lt90-f3f80621.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khen ngợi kết quả công việc tốt.', 'office', 1, 9),
('4ca4b4bd-adbe-554c-8b38-0751ffb5f0c9', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'acknowledge', 'UK: /əkˈnɒlɪdʒ/ | US: /əkˈnɑːlɪdʒ/', 'B2', 'verb', 'công nhận, cảm ơn', 'to accept or admit the truth or existence of something publicly', 'She acknowledged the team\'s hard work.', 'Cô ấy công nhận công việc chăm chỉ của đội.', '{\"en\": \"Please acknowledge receipt of this email as soon as you have reviewed the document.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng xác nhận đã nhận được email này ngay khi bạn xem xong tài liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-ljspeech-4f6c0a36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-cori-4f6c0a36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/acknowledge-00f5aca1.webp', '[\"admit\", \"recognize\", \"confirm\"]', '[\"deny\", \"ignore\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"acknowledge receipt of\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận đã nhận được\"}, {\"phrase\": \"publicly acknowledge\", \"meaning\": \"công khai ghi nhận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"accept\", \"note_vi\": \"Accept là đồng ý nhận/chấp nhận điều gì, còn acknowledge là xác nhận đã nhận hoặc thừa nhận sự tồn tại.\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"acknowledgment\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-cori-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru0-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru5-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru6-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru10-4f6c0a36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru9-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru3-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/acknowledge-aru7-4f6c0a36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciatio