('32658eef-23b3-5eaa-94ef-0ef675e52927', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'experience', '/ɪkˈspɪəriəns/', 'A2', 'noun', 'Trải nghiệm, kinh nghiệm.', 'something that has happened to you and that you have learned from or felt.', 'Working abroad was a valuable experience for her personal growth.', 'Làm việc ở nước ngoài là một trải nghiệm quý giá cho sự phát triển cá nhân của cô ấy.', '{\"en\": \"Candidates with experience in logistics are preferred for this warehouse position.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên có kinh nghiệm trong lĩnh vực logistics được ưu tiên cho vị trí kho hàng này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/experience-33f448f8.webp', '[\"background\", \"knowledge\", \"expertise\"]', '[\"inexperience\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm làm việc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"hands-on experience\", \"meaning\": \"kinh nghiệm thực tiễn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"years of experience\", \"meaning\": \"nhiều năm kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"experiment\", \"note_vi\": \"experiment là thí nghiệm khoa học, experience là trải nghiệm hoặc kinh nghiệm\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"verb\", \"word\": \"experience\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"experienced\"}, {\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"inexperienced\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-cori-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru0-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru5-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru6-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru10-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru9-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru3-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru7-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru8-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-aru2-f96da029.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-ljspeech-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt408-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt138-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt624-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt396-f96da029.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt498-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt132-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt288-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt42-f96da029.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/experience-lt90-f96da029.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong CV tiếng Anh, dùng \'work experience\' chứ không nói \'working experience\' — đây là lỗi phổ biến.', 'hr', 1, 23),
('5a5b0f30-a1eb-5411-9b95-9d2237643bac', '1e3e6ebb-26a1-52f6-bdc5-1d743722fae2', 'ff4ed1a6-a2ae-5263-99df-dc0c7ffb29d3', 'e18dcb8d-30dc-5b75-9028-d7be65fbe4f8', 'verbally', '/ˈvɜːbəli/', 'B2', 'adverb', 'Bằng cách nói, không phải viết.', 'using spoken words rather than writing or other means to share information.', 'He expressed his concerns verbally during the meeting, rather than in an email.', 'Anh ấy đã bày tỏ những lo ngại của mình bằng lời nói trong cuộc họp, thay vì qua email.', '{\"en\": \"The manager verbally approved the overtime request before the written form was submitted.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý đã phê duyệt bằng lời nói yêu cầu làm thêm giờ trước khi mẫu đơn bằng văn bản được nộp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-ljspeech-41ff5d16.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-cori-41ff5d16.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/verbally-8038a7e9.webp', '[\"orally\", \"spoken\", \"aloud\"]', '[\"in writing\", \"written\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"verbally communicate\", \"meaning\": \"giao tiếp bằng lời nói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verbally agree\", \"meaning\": \"đồng ý bằng lời nói\"}, {\"phrase\": \"verbally confirm\", \"meaning\": \"xác nhận bằng lời nói\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"orally\", \"note_vi\": \"orally và verbally gần nghĩa; orally thường dùng trong y tế hoặc thi cử\"}]', '[{\"pos\": \"adjective\", \"word\": \"verbal\"}, {\"pos\": \"noun\", \"word\": \"verb\"}]', '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-cori-41ff5d16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-aru0-41ff5d16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-aru5-41ff5d16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-aru6-41ff5d16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-aru10-41ff5d16.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/verbally-aru9-41ff5d16.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/pub