('688d4475-7353-5a45-bfc7-e51435f703f3', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a black sheep of the family', '/ə blæk ʃiːp əv ðə ˈfæmɪli/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Người khác biệt, không giống ai trong gia đình.', 'an individual viewed as strange or dishonorable by close relatives.', 'My uncle was always considered the black sheep of the family because he chose to be an artist instead of a businessman.', 'Chú tôi luôn bị coi là người cá biệt trong gia đình vì chú chọn làm nghệ sĩ thay vì doanh nhân.', '{\"en\": \"The young rebel was a black sheep of the family owned company.\", \"vi\": \"Chàng thanh niên nổi loạn là kẻ lạc lõng trong công ty thuộc gia đình.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-ljspeech-aaecb169.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-cori-aaecb169.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-600a5b27.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"the black sheep of the family\", \"meaning\": \"kẻ lạc lõng trong gia đình\"}, {\"phrase\": \"consider someone black sheep of the family\", \"meaning\": \"coi ai đó là kẻ lạc lõng gia đình\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"black sheep\", \"note_vi\": \"black sheep luôn đi với of the family mới đủ nghĩa\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-cori-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru0-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru5-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru6-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru10-aaecb169.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru9-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru3-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru7-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru8-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-aru2-aaecb169.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-ljspeech-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt408-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt138-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt624-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt396-aaecb169.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt498-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt132-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt288-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt42-aaecb169.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-sheep-of-the-family-lt90-aaecb169.mp3\"]}}', 'Phải có \'of the family\', không dùng một mình black sheep.', 'business', 1, 1),
('a447462f-507a-519c-97ba-928101a395a3', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'let the cat out of the bag', '/lɛt ðə kæt aʊt əv ðə bæɡ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Vô tình tiết lộ một bí mật.', 'to reveal a secret unintentionally or without meaning to do so.', 'David accidentally let the cat out of the bag concerning our confidential launch date.', 'David đã vô tình làm lộ bí mật liên quan đến ngày ra mắt bảo mật của chúng tôi.', '{\"en\": \"The manager accidentally let the cat out of the bag about the upcoming bonus.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã vô tình tiết lộ bí mật về khoản tiền thưởng sắp tới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-ljspeech-d2a41076.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-cori-d2a41076.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-5aa31cb5.webp', '[\"spill the beans\", \"give the game away\"]', '[\"keep a secret\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"accidentally let the cat out of the bag\", \"meaning\": \"vô tình tiết lộ bí mật\"}, {\"phrase\": \"let the cat out of the bag about\", \"meaning\": \"làm lộ bí mật về chuyện gì\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-cori-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru0-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru5-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru6-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru10-d2a41076.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru9-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru3-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru7-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru8-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-aru2-d2a41076.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-ljspeech-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt408-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt138-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt624-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt396-d2a41076.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt498-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt132-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt288-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt42-d2a41076.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/let-the-cat-out-of-the-bag-lt90-d2a41076.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường đi cùng với trạng từ \'accidentally\' để diễn tả hành động vô tình.', 'office', 1, 2),
('0a569c8c-45a3-575f-beca-a7e083609704', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'back to square one', '/bæk tə skweə wʌn/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'quay lại điểm xuất phát, làm lại từ đầu', 'returning to the very beginning of a process because previous attempts have failed.', 'After the initial plan failed, they had to go back to square one.', 'Sau khi kế hoạch ban đầu thất bại, họ phải quay lại từ đầu.', '{\"en\": \"Since the software update failed, the development team is back to square one.\", \"vi\": \"Vì bản cập nhật phần mềm thất bại, đội ngũ phát triển phải quay lại vạch xuất phát.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-ljspeech-0a0a03e1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-cori-0a0a03e1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/back-to-square-one-98e5c2c7.webp', '[\"start over\", \"back to the drawing board\"]', '[\"make progress\", \"move forward\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be back to square one\", \"meaning\": \"quay lại vạch xuất phát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"go back to square one\", \"meaning\": \"trở lại điểm bắt đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-cori-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru0-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru5-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru6-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru10-0a0a03e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru9-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru3-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru7-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru8-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-aru2-0a0a03e1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-ljspeech-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt408-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt138-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt624-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt396-0a0a03e1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt498-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt132-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt288-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt42-0a0a03e1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/back-to-square-one-lt90-0a0a03e1.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi một kế hoạch thất bại hoàn toàn và bạn phải làm lại từ đầu.', 'technology', 1, 3),
('30ae67f2-d7ae-5674-8a7c-c844d28c3fe7', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'fool\'s haste is no speed', '/fuːlz heɪst ɪz nəʊ spiːd/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Nôn nóng, vội vàng thường không mang lại kết quả tốt.', 'doing things too quickly and carelessly usually leads to mistakes and delays.', 'The project manager reminded his team that fool\'s haste is no speed, urging them to check their work carefully.', 'Trưởng dự án nhắc nhở đội của mình rằng dục tốc bất đạt, thúc giục họ kiểm tra công việc cẩn thận.', '{\"en\": \"The director reminded staff that fool\'s haste is no speed during inspection.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc nhắc nhở nhân viên rằng dục tốc bất đạt trong đợt kiểm tra.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-ljspeech-efa9fabd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-cori-efa9fabd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-7764b0d5.webp', '[\"haste makes waste\"]', '[\"slow and steady wins the race\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"remember fool\'s haste is no speed\", \"meaning\": \"ghi nhớ việc nôn nóng sẽ không hiệu quả\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-cori-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru0-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru5-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru6-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru10-efa9fabd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru9-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru3-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru7-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru8-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-aru2-efa9fabd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-ljspeech-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt408-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt138-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt624-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt396-efa9fabd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt498-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt132-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt288-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt42-efa9fabd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/fool-s-haste-is-no-speed-lt90-efa9fabd.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương câu thành ngữ \'Dục tốc bất đạt\' trong tiếng Việt.', 'office', 1, 4),
('0311371a-fa43-5dc0-892d-237ea11d4515', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'make a pig of oneself', '/meɪk ə pɪɡ əv wʌnˈself/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Ăn quá nhiều, ăn ngấu nghiến.', 'to eat far too much food at one time in a greedy way.', 'I felt a bit guilty after the buffet, as I really made a pig of myself with all the desserts.', 'Tôi cảm thấy hơi có lỗi sau bữa tiệc buffet vì tôi đã ăn quá nhiều món tráng miệng.', '{\"en\": \"At the annual company dinner, some employees really made a pig of themselves at the buffet.\", \"vi\": \"Tại bữa tối thường niên của công ty, một số nhân viên thực sự đã ăn uống quá mức tại quầy buffet.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-ljspeech-13136f2c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-cori-13136f2c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/make-a-pig-of-oneself-bf6fbb34.webp', '[\"overeat\", \"gorge\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-cori-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru0-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru5-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru6-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru10-13136f2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru9-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru3-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru7-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru8-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-aru2-13136f2c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-ljspeech-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt408-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt138-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt624-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt396-13136f2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt498-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt132-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt288-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt42-13136f2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/make-a-pig-of-oneself-lt90-13136f2c.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ ví von việc ăn uống tham lam, quá nhiều như loài heo (pig).', 'dining', 1, 5),
('2cd34a4d-99a7-5e77-8355-0fead24a1477', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a wild goose chase', '/ə waɪld ɡuːs tʃeɪs/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Một cuộc tìm kiếm hoặc nỗ lực vô ích, không mang lại kết quả gì.', 'a search for something that is impossible to find or reach.', 'After hours of searching for the mythical creature, they realized it was all a wild goose chase.', 'Sau nhiều giờ tìm kiếm sinh vật thần thoại, họ nhận ra đó chỉ là một cuộc tìm kiếm vô ích.', '{\"en\": \"Searching for the missing original invoice turned out to be a wild goose chase.\", \"vi\": \"Việc tìm kiếm hóa đơn gốc bị thất lạc hóa ra là một nỗ lực vô ích.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-ljspeech-6a4ca8ac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-cori-6a4ca8ac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-wild-goose-chase-95c56a1f.webp', '[\"futile search\", \"fruitless effort\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"send someone on a wild goose chase\", \"meaning\": \"sai ai đó làm một việc vô ích\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-cori-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru0-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru5-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru6-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru10-6a4ca8ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru9-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru3-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru7-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru8-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-aru2-6a4ca8ac.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-ljspeech-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt408-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt138-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt624-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt396-6a4ca8ac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt498-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt132-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt288-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt42-6a4ca8ac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-wild-goose-chase-lt90-6a4ca8ac.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng khi mô tả việc tìm kiếm cái gì đó mà hoàn toàn không có kết quả.', 'office', 1, 6),
('0c6e2c87-afa1-52aa-b969-5acbbc19b556', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a red herring', '/ə rɛd hɛrɪŋ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Một thông tin hoặc hành động được dùng để đánh lạc hướng khỏi vấn đề chính.', 'something that takes attention away from the main topic or important problem.', 'The suspect\'s elaborate story was just a red herring to distract the police from the real evidence.', 'Câu chuyện phức tạp của nghi phạm chỉ là một đòn đánh lạc hướng để đánh lừa cảnh sát khỏi bằng chứng thực sự.', '{\"en\": \"The rumor about salary cuts was just a red herring to cover the company expansion.\", \"vi\": \"Tin đồn cắt giảm lương chỉ là trò đánh lạc hướng để che đậy việc mở rộng công ty.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-ljspeech-5fd424f8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-cori-5fd424f8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-red-herring-571ed5d9.webp', '[\"distraction\", \"diversion\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"introduce a red herring\", \"meaning\": \"đưa ra thông tin đánh lạc hướng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a complete red herring\", \"meaning\": \"hoàn toàn là thông tin đánh lạc hướng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-cori-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru0-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru5-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru6-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru10-5fd424f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru9-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru3-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru7-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru8-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-aru2-5fd424f8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-ljspeech-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt408-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt138-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt624-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt396-5fd424f8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt498-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt132-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt288-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt42-5fd424f8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-red-herring-lt90-5fd424f8.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh đàm phán, tranh luận hoặc điều tra để chỉ sự đánh lạc hướng.', 'business', 1, 7),
('7ad41c22-ac44-5bb9-82e0-c31ee3ecf6f0', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'at sixes and sevens', '/æt ˌsɪksɪz ən ˈsɛvənz/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Trong tình trạng lộn xộn, không có trật tự.', 'in a state of confusion, disorder, or not being organized.', 'After the sudden departure of the manager, the whole office was at sixes and sevens.', 'Sau sự ra đi đột ngột của người quản lý, cả văn phòng trở nên hỗn loạn.', '{\"en\": \"The office was at sixes and sevens after the sudden power outage yesterday morning.\", \"vi\": \"Văn phòng ở trong tình trạng hỗn loạn sau sự cố mất điện đột ngột sáng qua.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-ljspeech-5003742c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-cori-5003742c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/at-sixes-and-sevens-b39b647b.webp', '[\"in a mess\", \"topsy-turvy\", \"disorganized\"]', '[\"in apple-pie order\", \"well-organized\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be at sixes and sevens\", \"meaning\": \"ở trong tình trạng hỗn loạn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leave someone at sixes and sevens\", \"meaning\": \"khiến ai đó bối rối\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"at six and seven\", \"note_vi\": \"Sai ngữ pháp, luôn phải dùng dạng số nhiều.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-cori-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru0-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru5-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru6-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru10-5003742c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru9-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru3-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru7-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru8-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-aru2-5003742c.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-ljspeech-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt408-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt138-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt624-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt396-5003742c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt498-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt132-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt288-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt42-5003742c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-sixes-and-sevens-lt90-5003742c.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để mô tả tình trạng lộn xộn của đồ vật hoặc sự bối rối của con người.', 'office', 1, 8),
('2bb5f907-8473-5bc2-a8ae-969231c9d865', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'see red', '/siː red/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Trở nên vô cùng tức giận, mất bình tĩnh.', 'to become extremely angry or lose control of your temper suddenly.', 'He immediately saw red when he realized someone had stolen his bicycle.', 'Anh ấy lập tức nổi giận khi nhận ra ai đó đã trộm xe đạp của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The manager started to see red when the client rejected the final contract proposal again.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý bắt đầu nổi giận khi khách hàng từ chối đề xuất hợp đồng cuối cùng một lần nữa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-ljspeech-b29fd8fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-cori-b29fd8fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/see-red-f5a6dac1.webp', '[\"furious\", \"enraged\"]', '[\"calm\", \"composed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"see red at\", \"meaning\": \"tức giận vì\"}, {\"phrase\": \"make someone see red\", \"meaning\": \"khiến ai đó nổi giận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-cori-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru0-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru5-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru6-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru10-b29fd8fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru9-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru3-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru7-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru8-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-aru2-b29fd8fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-ljspeech-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt408-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt138-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt624-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt396-b29fd8fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt498-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt132-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt288-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt42-b29fd8fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/see-red-lt90-b29fd8fb.mp3\"]}}', 'Hình ảnh ẩn dụ về việc máu dồn lên não khi giận dữ.', 'office', 1, 9),
('208dbd64-f719-5b48-b9ca-9003055e9e1f', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a bolt from the blue', '/ə bɒlt frəm ðə bluː/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Một sự kiện bất ngờ, không mong đợi, thường là xấu.', 'a sudden and completely unexpected event that surprises or shocks everyone involved.', 'The news of the company\'s bankruptcy came as a bolt from the blue to all employees.', 'Tin tức về việc công ty phá sản là một tin sét đánh đối với tất cả nhân viên.', '{\"en\": \"The sudden resignation of the director came as a bolt from the blue to the staff.\", \"vi\": \"Việc giám đốc đột ngột từ chức là một tin sét đánh đối với toàn thể nhân viên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-ljspeech-6cf42bc7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-cori-6cf42bc7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-bolt-from-the-blue-9768303a.webp', '[\"surprise\", \"shock\"]', '[\"expected\", \"predictable\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"come as a shock\", \"meaning\": \"gây sốc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"unexpected news\", \"meaning\": \"tin bất ngờ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-cori-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru0-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru5-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru6-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru10-6cf42bc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru9-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru3-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru7-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru8-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-aru2-6cf42bc7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-ljspeech-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt408-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt138-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt624-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt396-6cf42bc7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt498-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt132-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt288-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt42-6cf42bc7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-bolt-from-the-blue-lt90-6cf42bc7.mp3\"]}}', 'Blue ở đây chỉ bầu trời xanh, bolt là tia sét.', 'business', 1, 10),
('80268025-4f44-520e-a575-fbd12dac53d8', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'money makes the mare go', '/mʌn.i meɪks ðə mɛə ɡəʊ/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Tiền bạc là động lực mạnh mẽ để hoàn thành công việc.', 'financial reward or payment acts as a strong motivation to get things done.', 'In business, sometimes you find that money makes the mare go, encouraging people to work harder.', 'Trong kinh doanh, đôi khi bạn thấy tiền bạc là động lực mạnh mẽ, khuyến khích mọi người làm việc chăm chỉ hơn.', '{\"en\": \"The director offered a bonus to speed up production, knowing money makes the mare go.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc đã đưa ra khoản tiền thưởng để đẩy nhanh sản xuất, biết rằng tiền bạc là động lực thúc đẩy.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-ljspeech-456fa6e7.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-cori-456fa6e7.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/money-makes-the-mare-go-28226199.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial incentive\", \"meaning\": \"động lực tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"speed up production\", \"meaning\": \"đẩy nhanh sản xuất\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-cori-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru0-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru5-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru6-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru10-456fa6e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru9-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru3-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru7-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru8-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-aru2-456fa6e7.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-ljspeech-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt408-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt138-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt624-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt396-456fa6e7.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt498-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt132-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt288-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt42-456fa6e7.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/money-makes-the-mare-go-lt90-456fa6e7.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ cổ hàm ý có tiền thì công việc gì cũng trôi chảy, thuận lợi.', 'business', 1, 11)
INSERT INTO system_vocabulary_words (id, set_id, topic_id, part_id, word, ipa, cefr, part_of_speech, meaning_vi, definition_en, example_en, example_vi, example_toeic, audio_us, audio_uk, image_url, synonyms, antonyms, phrases, confusables, word_family, audio_voices, note_vi, toeic_topic, difficulty_level, order_index) VALUES
('f553c80e-d891-59be-a1da-b6ae52c2d8f6', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'birds of a feather flock together', '/bɜːdz əv ə fɛðə flɒk təˈɡɛðə/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Những người có cùng sở thích, tính cách thường kết bạn với nhau.', 'people who share similar interests, characters, or backgrounds tend to spend time with each other.', 'It\'s not surprising that all the artists hang out together; birds of a feather flock together.', 'Không có gì ngạc nhiên khi tất cả các nghệ sĩ đều chơi với nhau; ngưu tầm ngưu, mã tầm mã mà.', '{\"en\": \"The creative designers always eat lunch together; indeed, birds of a feather flock together.\", \"vi\": \"Các nhà thiết kế sáng tạo luôn ăn trưa cùng nhau; quả thực, ngưu tầm ngưu mã tầm mã.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-ljspeech-9dbebd51.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-cori-9dbebd51.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-b9298508.webp', '[\"like associates with like\"]', '[\"opposites attract\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-cori-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru0-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru5-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru6-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru10-9dbebd51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru9-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru3-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru7-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru8-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-aru2-9dbebd51.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-ljspeech-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt408-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt138-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt624-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt396-9dbebd51.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt498-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt132-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt288-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt42-9dbebd51.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/birds-of-a-feather-flock-together-lt90-9dbebd51.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này chỉ những người có cùng tính cách, sở thích thường tụ tập với nhau.', 'hr', 1, 12),
('02b55b74-7aab-5c5d-97a2-b3bde227cb95', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a blue-collar job', '/ə bluːˈkɒlə dʒɒb/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Công việc lao động chân tay, thường không yêu cầu bằng cấp cao.', 'a job that involves physical work rather than office or professional work.', 'Many people start their careers with **a blue-collar job** before moving into management roles.', 'Nhiều người bắt đầu sự nghiệp với một công việc lao động chân tay trước khi chuyển sang các vai trò quản lý.', '{\"en\": \"The factory is currently hiring workers for a blue-collar job to help with the new production line.\", \"vi\": \"Nhà máy hiện đang tuyển dụng công nhân cho công việc lao động chân tay để hỗ trợ dây chuyền sản xuất mới.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-ljspeech-91ba0673.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-cori-91ba0673.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-blue-collar-job-eae9235f.webp', '[\"manual job\", \"laborer\"]', '[\"white-collar job\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"blue-collar worker\", \"meaning\": \"công nhân lao động chân tay\"}, {\"phrase\": \"manual labor\", \"meaning\": \"lao động chân tay\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"white-collar job\", \"note_vi\": \"Công việc văn phòng, trí óc, trái ngược với lao động chân tay.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-cori-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru0-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru5-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru6-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru10-91ba0673.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru9-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru3-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru7-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru8-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-aru2-91ba0673.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-ljspeech-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt408-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt138-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt624-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt396-91ba0673.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt498-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt132-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt288-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt42-91ba0673.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-collar-job-lt90-91ba0673.mp3\"]}}', 'Phân biệt với \'white-collar\' (nhân viên văn phòng).', 'manufacturing', 1, 13),
('536bebdd-efa4-50c2-9adc-a54ea80305b9', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a home bird', '/ə həʊm bɜːd/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Người thích ở nhà, không thích đi ra ngoài nhiều.', 'a person who enjoys staying inside rather than going out.', 'My sister is a real home bird; she prefers spending her weekends reading books at home.', 'Em gái tôi đúng là người thích ở nhà; nó thích dành những ngày cuối tuần để đọc sách ở nhà.', '{\"en\": \"Our new accountant is a home bird who rarely attends networking events.\", \"vi\": \"Kế toán mới của chúng ta là người thích ở nhà, hiếm khi đi sự kiện.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-ljspeech-7b596520.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-cori-7b596520.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-home-bird-4b8c4e28.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be a home bird\", \"meaning\": \"là người thích ở nhà\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a real home bird\", \"meaning\": \"một người rất thích ở nhà\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"homebody\", \"note_vi\": \"homebody cùng nghĩa nhưng là từ đơn, không phải thành ngữ\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-cori-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru0-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru5-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru6-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru10-7b596520.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru9-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru3-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru7-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru8-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-aru2-7b596520.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-ljspeech-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt408-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt138-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt624-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt396-7b596520.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt498-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt132-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt288-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt42-7b596520.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-home-bird-lt90-7b596520.mp3\"]}}', 'Home bird không phải con chim, mà là người thích ở nhà.', 'housing', 1, 14),
('95f7b813-7d0c-5922-9678-bc0fa8afe368', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'one of these days', '/wʌn əv ðiːz deɪz/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Một lúc nào đó trong tương lai không xa.', 'at some time in the future, usually quite soon.', 'I really need to clean out my garage; I\'ll do it one of these days.', 'Tôi thực sự cần dọn dẹp gara của mình; tôi sẽ làm việc đó vào một ngày nào đó.', '{\"en\": \"One of these days, the manager will promote her to a senior position.\", \"vi\": \"Một ngày không xa, người quản lý sẽ thăng chức cho cô ấy lên một vị trí cấp cao.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-ljspeech-ff71b880.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-cori-ff71b880.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/one-of-these-days-22e5f459.webp', '[\"someday\", \"sooner or later\", \"eventually\"]', '[\"never\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-cori-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru0-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru5-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru6-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru10-ff71b880.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru9-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru3-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru7-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru8-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-aru2-ff71b880.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-ljspeech-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt408-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt138-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt624-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt396-ff71b880.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt498-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt132-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt288-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt42-ff71b880.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-these-days-lt90-ff71b880.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm từ này thường dùng để nói về một dự định hoặc dự đoán chắc chắn sẽ xảy ra.', 'hr', 1, 15),
('ab1e8a8d-d391-5a99-b1b0-caf9fd1ce4d3', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'do the donkey\'s work', '/duː ðə dɒŋkiːz wɜːk/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Làm công việc nặng nhọc, vất vả, thường không được đánh giá cao.', 'to do the hardest, most tiring part of a job that others do not want to do.', 'He always ends up doing the donkey\'s work while others take the credit.', 'Anh ấy luôn phải làm công việc nặng nhọc trong khi những người khác nhận công lao.', '{\"en\": \"The junior staff always end up doing the donkey\'s work during the annual inventory check.\", \"vi\": \"Nhân viên cấp thấp luôn phải làm phần việc nặng nhọc nhất trong đợt kiểm kê hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-ljspeech-580668c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-cori-580668c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/do-the-donkey-s-work-a36eedee.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"end up doing the donkey\'s work\", \"meaning\": \"cuối cùng phải gánh việc nặng nhọc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"always do the donkey\'s work\", \"meaning\": \"luôn phải làm việc vất vả\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"donkey work\", \"note_vi\": \"\'Donkey work\' là dạng rút gọn, cùng nghĩa, không có \'s sau donkey\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-cori-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru0-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru5-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru6-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru10-580668c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru9-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru3-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru7-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru8-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-aru2-580668c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-ljspeech-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt408-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt138-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt624-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt396-580668c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt498-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt132-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt288-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt42-580668c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/do-the-donkey-s-work-lt90-580668c1.mp3\"]}}', '\'Donkey\' (lừa) tượng trưng cho sự chăm chỉ, chịu đựng; thành ngữ này mang hàm ý phàn nàn.', 'office', 1, 16),
('e293e0a7-3d0c-5466-a053-4da8305b78e3', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'it never rains but it pours', '/ɪt ˈnevə reɪnz bʌt ɪt pɔːz/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Khi một điều tồi tệ xảy ra, nhiều điều tồi tệ khác cũng thường kéo theo.', 'bad things do not happen singly, but always in large numbers.', 'First, I got a flat tire, then my phone died, and now I\'m late for work; it never rains but it pours!', 'Đầu tiên, tôi bị xịt lốp, sau đó điện thoại hết pin, và giờ tôi lại muộn làm; đúng là họa vô đơn chí!', '{\"en\": \"First the printer broke, then the internet went down; it never rains but it pours.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu tiên là máy in hỏng, sau đó mạng internet bị sập; đúng là họa vô đơn chí.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-ljspeech-de087652.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-cori-de087652.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-6afd96c2.webp', '[\"misfortunes never come singly\", \"when it rains, it pours\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"prove that it never rains but it pours\", \"meaning\": \"chứng minh họa vô đơn chí\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"when it rains, it pours\", \"note_vi\": \"Phiên bản tiếng Anh Mỹ phổ biến hơn của thành ngữ này.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-cori-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru0-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru5-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru6-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru10-de087652.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru9-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru3-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru7-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru8-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-aru2-de087652.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-ljspeech-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt408-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt138-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt624-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt396-de087652.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt498-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt132-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt288-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt42-de087652.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-never-rains-but-it-pours-lt90-de087652.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương với câu tục ngữ họa vô đơn chí hoặc tránh vỏ dưa gặp vỏ dừa.', 'office', 1, 17),
('950a8d34-be0b-5ac0-b540-1f068dab67a2', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a blue-eyed boy', '/ə ˈbluːˌaɪd ˈbɔɪ/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Người được yêu mến, ưu ái đặc biệt.', 'a person who is liked very much and treated better than others.', 'He quickly became the blue-eyed boy of the department thanks to his excellent performance.', 'Anh ấy nhanh chóng trở thành người được ưu ái của phòng nhờ vào thành tích xuất sắc của mình.', '{\"en\": \"David became the blue-eyed boy of the manager after closing the big contract.\", \"vi\": \"David đã trở thành đứa con cưng của người quản lý sau khi ký được hợp đồng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-ljspeech-de6605d1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-cori-de6605d1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-blue-eyed-boy-fd5db919.webp', '[\"fair-haired boy\", \"teacher\'s pet\", \"favorite\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"become a blue-eyed boy\", \"meaning\": \"trở thành người được ưu ái\"}, {\"phrase\": \"the boss\'s blue-eyed boy\", \"meaning\": \"cưng của sếp\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"blue-eyed\", \"note_vi\": \"Chỉ màu mắt xanh dương thực tế của một người.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-cori-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru0-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru5-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru6-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru10-de6605d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru9-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru3-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru7-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru8-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-aru2-de6605d1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-ljspeech-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt408-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt138-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt624-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt396-de6605d1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt498-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt132-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt288-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt42-de6605d1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-blue-eyed-boy-lt90-de6605d1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường mang hàm ý hơi mỉa mai về sự thiên vị trong công việc.', 'hr', 1, 18),
('1fa955c1-d836-51db-ba8a-9885250c2c8a', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'a cat nap', '/ə kæt næp/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Một giấc ngủ ngắn, chợp mắt.', 'a short sleep during the day to get some energy back.', 'I usually take a cat nap after lunch to feel refreshed for the afternoon.', 'Tôi thường chợp mắt một chút sau bữa trưa để cảm thấy sảng khoái cho buổi chiều.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO often takes a cat nap in his office before attending the evening board meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành thường chợp mắt một chút trong văn phòng trước khi dự cuộc họp hội đồng quản trị buổi tối.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-ljspeech-1df7c220.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-cori-1df7c220.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-cat-nap-1dcf1901.webp', '[\"a snooze\", \"a short sleep\", \"a doze\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take a cat nap\", \"meaning\": \"chợp mắt một lát\"}, {\"phrase\": \"have a cat nap\", \"meaning\": \"ngủ một giấc ngắn\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-cori-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru0-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru5-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru6-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru10-1df7c220.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru9-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru3-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru7-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru8-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-aru2-1df7c220.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-ljspeech-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt408-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt138-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt624-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt396-1df7c220.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt498-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt132-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt288-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt42-1df7c220.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cat-nap-lt90-1df7c220.mp3\"]}}', 'Giống như loài mèo thường ngủ những giấc rất ngắn trong ngày.', 'daily', 1, 19),
('0083cd2d-64fe-5e44-a025-6db67f203258', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'scream blue murder', '/skriːm bluː ˈmɜːdə/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'la hét rất to, kêu gào dữ dội', 'to make a very loud and angry complaint or noise about something.', 'When she saw the mouse, she started to scream blue murder.', 'Khi nhìn thấy con chuột, cô ấy bắt đầu la hét dữ dội.', '{\"en\": \"The client will scream blue murder if we do not deliver the project on time.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng sẽ lu loa lên nếu chúng ta không bàn giao dự án đúng hạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-ljspeech-599e4b4b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-cori-599e4b4b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/scream-blue-murder-2d3f75bc.webp', '[\"make a fuss\", \"cry blue murder\", \"protest loudly\"]', '[\"keep quiet\", \"accept silently\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"start to scream blue murder\", \"meaning\": \"bắt đầu la hét/kêu gào dữ dội\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-cori-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru0-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru5-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru6-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru10-599e4b4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru9-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru3-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru7-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru8-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-aru2-599e4b4b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-ljspeech-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt408-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt138-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt624-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt396-599e4b4b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt498-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt132-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt288-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt42-599e4b4b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/scream-blue-murder-lt90-599e4b4b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng khi ai đó phản đối hoặc phàn nàn một cách cực kỳ gay gắt và ồn ào.', 'business', 1, 20),
('e5e6a792-4b84-52c1-be65-cf7516c2ceed', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'not hurt a fly', '/nɒt hɜːt ə flaɪ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Rất hiền lành, không làm hại ai.', 'to be extremely peaceful gentle and kind so as never to cause harm to anyone.', 'Despite his tough appearance, he wouldn\'t hurt a fly and is actually a very gentle person.', 'Mặc dù vẻ ngoài có vẻ dữ dằn, anh ấy rất hiền lành và thực ra là một người rất dịu dàng.', '{\"en\": \"Although Mr. Davis looks very strict, he would not hurt a fly in the office.\", \"vi\": \"Mặc dù ông Davis trông rất nghiêm khắc, ông ấy cực kỳ hiền lành và không bao giờ làm hại ai trong văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-ljspeech-6f505529.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-cori-6f505529.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/not-hurt-a-fly-4110fda4.webp', '[\"harmless\", \"gentle\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-cori-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru0-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru5-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru6-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru10-6f505529.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru9-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru3-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru7-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru8-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-aru2-6f505529.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-ljspeech-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt408-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt138-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt624-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt396-6f505529.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt498-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt132-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt288-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt42-6f505529.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/not-hurt-a-fly-lt90-6f505529.mp3\"]}}', 'Vì bản thân từ này là thành ngữ (idiom) nên mục idioms để mảng rỗng [].', 'daily', 1, 21),
('1df9e504-ff37-5feb-b1e4-b07338280e68', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'out of sight , out of mind', '/aʊt əv saɪt , aʊt əv maɪnd/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Không nhìn thấy thì dễ quên đi.', 'it is easy to forget people or things that you do not see for a long time.', 'After she moved abroad, her old friends rarely contacted her; it was a case of out of sight, out of mind.', 'Sau khi cô ấy chuyển ra nước ngoài, những người bạn cũ hiếm khi liên lạc; đó là trường hợp xa mặt cách lòng.', '{\"en\": \"After the manager moved to another branch, he became out of sight, out of mind for his team.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi người quản lý chuyển sang chi nhánh khác, anh ấy dần bị đội ngũ của mình quên lãng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-ljspeech-77202b2f.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-cori-77202b2f.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-529d220e.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be out of sight\", \"meaning\": \"không nhìn thấy\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slip out of mind\", \"meaning\": \"dần bị quên lãng\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-cori-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru0-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru5-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru6-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru10-77202b2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru9-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru3-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru7-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru8-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-aru2-77202b2f.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-ljspeech-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt408-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt138-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt624-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt396-77202b2f.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt498-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt132-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt288-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt42-77202b2f.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/out-of-sight-out-of-mind-lt90-77202b2f.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để giải thích lý do tại sao các mối quan hệ trở nên xa cách.', 'daily', 1, 22),
('4d4ba069-0681-598e-ae22-e450558fd550', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'in black and white', '/ɪn blæk ən waɪt/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Bằng văn bản; được ghi lại rõ ràng.', 'something that is written down clearly so that there is no doubt about it.', 'We need to get this agreement **in black and white** to avoid any misunderstandings later.', 'Chúng ta cần có thỏa thuận này bằng văn bản để tránh mọi hiểu lầm sau này.', '{\"en\": \"Please ensure all the terms of the contract are in black and white before you sign it.\", \"vi\": \"Vui lòng đảm bảo tất cả các điều khoản của hợp đồng được ghi rõ bằng văn bản trước khi bạn ký.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-ljspeech-0fb9ac91.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-cori-0fb9ac91.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/in-black-and-white-2f283993.webp', '[\"in writing\", \"documented\"]', '[\"verbal\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"put in black and white\", \"meaning\": \"ghi rõ bằng văn bản\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get in black and white\", \"meaning\": \"có được văn bản xác nhận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-cori-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru0-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru5-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru6-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru10-0fb9ac91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru9-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru3-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru7-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru8-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-aru2-0fb9ac91.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-ljspeech-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt408-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt138-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt624-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt396-0fb9ac91.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt498-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt132-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt288-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt42-0fb9ac91.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/in-black-and-white-lt90-0fb9ac91.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh tính pháp lý và sự minh bạch của văn bản.', 'law', 1, 23),
('81675975-9056-5e42-a11e-2c77833eafc3', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'have other fish to fry', '/hæv ˈʌðə fɪʃ tə fraɪ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Có những việc quan trọng hơn cần làm.', 'to have more important or urgent tasks that require your immediate attention.', 'I can\'t help you with that right now; I have other fish to fry.', 'Tôi không thể giúp bạn việc đó ngay bây giờ; tôi có những việc quan trọng hơn cần làm.', '{\"en\": \"I cannot review your proposal today because I have other fish to fry regarding the budget audit.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi không thể xem xét đề xuất của bạn hôm nay vì tôi có những việc quan trọng hơn cần làm liên quan đến kiểm toán ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-ljspeech-400e66c2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-cori-400e66c2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-other-fish-to-fry-380aed53.webp', '[\"have more important things to do\", \"be busy with urgent matters\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-cori-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru0-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru5-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru6-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru10-400e66c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru9-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru3-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru7-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru8-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-aru2-400e66c2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-ljspeech-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt408-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt138-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt624-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt396-400e66c2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt498-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt132-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt288-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt42-400e66c2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-other-fish-to-fry-lt90-400e66c2.mp3\"]}}', 'Cách nói lịch sự để từ chối một yêu cầu vì bạn đang bận việc khác.', 'business', 1, 24),
('8c7d4107-9583-5838-a0fe-6dde505963b0', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '169d2953-b3ca-5faa-8b7f-51aa7ecec9e5', 'a07affb2-c1bc-5a02-907d-399b0bbe7632', 'one for the road', '/wʌn fɔː ðə rəʊd/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Một ly đồ uống cuối cùng trước khi rời đi.', 'a final drink that someone has just before they leave a place to go somewhere else.', 'Before we leave, how about one for the road?', 'Trước khi chúng ta đi, làm một ly cuối cùng nhé?', '{\"en\": \"After the farewell dinner, the team had one for the road before heading to the airport.\", \"vi\": \"Sau bữa tiệc chia tay, nhóm uống một ly cuối trước khi ra sân bay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-ljspeech-f6cf8965.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-cori-f6cf8965.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/one-for-the-road-4125d456.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have one for the road\", \"meaning\": \"uống một ly cuối trước khi đi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"offer one for the road\", \"meaning\": \"mời một ly trước khi khách ra về\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-cori-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru0-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru5-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru6-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru10-f6cf8965.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru9-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru3-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru7-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru8-f6cf8965.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-for-the-road-aru2-f6cf8965.mp3\"]}, \"