('6e245500-e784-5624-bc2e-dac048470e0c', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '28050084-6fbf-589d-9e8d-0c43b3f3a628', 'b3f669d6-7cf9-5bd2-adf0-09da7b7bc25b', 'have a bee in one\'s bonnet', '/hæv ə biː ɪn wʌnz ˈbɒnɪt/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Bị ám ảnh hoặc không ngừng nói về một ý tưởng nào đó.', 'to be obsessed with an idea and talk about it repeatedly to others.', 'My aunt has a bee in her bonnet about organic food and talks about it constantly.', 'Dì tôi bị ám ảnh về thực phẩm hữu cơ và nói về nó không ngừng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO has a bee in her bonnet about reducing paper waste, so she insists on digital reports.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành bị ám ảnh về việc giảm lãng phí giấy, vì vậy bà ấy khăng khăng yêu cầu các báo cáo kỹ thuật số.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-ljspeech-2dff3de0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-cori-2dff3de0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-f9c0d383.webp', '[\"be obsessed with\", \"fixate on\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-cori-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru0-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru5-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru6-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru10-2dff3de0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru9-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru3-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru7-2dff3de0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-a-bee-in-one-s-bonnet-aru8-2dff3de