('8cfcc4d6-2d9e-506f-8417-d426c4603e5d', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '28050084-6fbf-589d-9e8d-0c43b3f3a628', 'b3f669d6-7cf9-5bd2-adf0-09da7b7bc25b', 'no wisdom like silence', '/nəʊ ˈwɪz.dəm laɪk ˈsaɪ.ləns/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'im lặng là điều khôn ngoan nhất', 'a phrase meaning that saying nothing is often the smartest choice in difficult situations.', 'Sometimes, when you\'re unsure what to say, remember that no wisdom like silence.', 'Đôi khi, khi bạn không chắc nên nói gì, hãy nhớ rằng im lặng là điều khôn ngoan nhất.', '{\"en\": \"During the tense client negotiation, the manager believed there is no wisdom like silence.\", \"vi\": \"Trong cuộc đàm phán căng thẳng với khách hàng, người quản lý tin rằng im lặng là điều khôn ngoan nhất.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-ljspeech-977a1cac.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-cori-977a1cac.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/no-wisdom-like-silence-221c04a7.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-cori-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru0-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru5-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru6-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru10-977a1cac.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru9-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru3-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru7-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-aru8-977a1cac.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/no-wisdom-like-silence-