('7aa69b36-33d4-5165-9c31-f2aa2136f93d', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '28050084-6fbf-589d-9e8d-0c43b3f3a628', 'b3f669d6-7cf9-5bd2-adf0-09da7b7bc25b', 'to let the wolf into the fold', '/tə let ðə wʊlf ɪntə ðə fəʊld/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Đón nhận hoặc tin tưởng một kẻ thù nguy hiểm vào vòng an toàn của mình.', 'to allow a dangerous person to enter a safe group, causing potential harm to others.', 'Hiring someone with a history of fraud is like **letting the wolf into the fold**.', 'Thuê một người có tiền sử lừa đảo giống như rước họa vào thân vậy.', '{\"en\": \"Hiring that dishonest consultant was like letting the wolf into the fold for our small company.\", \"vi\": \"Thuê người tư vấn không trung thực đó giống như rước họa vào nhà cho công ty nhỏ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-ljspeech-40b7d2ec.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-cori-40b7d2ec.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-94b024a8.webp', '[\"invite trouble\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"let the wolf into the fold\", \"meaning\": \"rước họa vào nhà\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-cori-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru0-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru5-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru6-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru10-40b7d2ec.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru9-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-fold-aru3-40b7d2ec.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-let-the-wolf-into-the-f