('25bf04da-0d52-5a97-a3b9-3d5a21cf9ac4', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '28050084-6fbf-589d-9e8d-0c43b3f3a628', 'b3f669d6-7cf9-5bd2-adf0-09da7b7bc25b', 'ten a penny', '/tɛn ə ˈpɛni/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Rất phổ biến, dễ tìm thấy hoặc có giá trị thấp.', 'something that is very common and therefore not worth very much money.', 'These days, cheap plastic toys are ten a penny.', 'Ngày nay, đồ chơi nhựa rẻ tiền thì đầy rẫy.', '{\"en\": \"Cheap office supplies are ten a penny, so we can easily replace the broken stapler.\", \"vi\": \"Đồ dùng văn phòng rẻ tiền thì nhan nhản, nên chúng ta có thể dễ dàng thay thế cái dập ghim bị hỏng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-ljspeech-99b0abd8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-cori-99b0abd8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ten-a-penny-a68b6842.webp', '[\"common\", \"abundant\"]', '[\"rare\", \"scarce\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a dime a dozen\", \"meaning\": \"rất phổ biến\"}, {\"phrase\": \"common as dirt\", \"meaning\": \"rất tầm thường\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-cori-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru0-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru5-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru6-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru10-99b0abd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru9-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru3-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru7-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru8-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-aru2-99b0abd8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-ljspeech-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt408-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt138-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt624-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt396-99b0abd8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt498-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt132-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt288-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt42-99b0abd8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-a-penny-lt90-99b0abd8.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để chỉ những thứ quá phổ biến đến mức mất giá trị.', 'business', 1, 29),
('6a8d0a7c-7bc5-5856-a81a-d63b5de31bbd', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'it\'s all one to me', '/ɪts ɔːl wʌn tə miː/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Không có sự khác biệt, điều gì cũng được.', 'used to say that you do not care which choice is made because it does not matter.', 'You can choose to go to the beach or the mountains; it\'s all one to me.', 'Bạn có thể chọn đi biển hay lên núi; đối với tôi thì cái nào cũng như nhau.', '{\"en\": \"Whether we schedule the client meeting for Monday or Tuesday, it\'s all one to me.\", \"vi\": \"Dù chúng ta lên lịch họp khách hàng vào thứ Hai hay thứ Ba, với tôi đều được.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-ljspeech-d8ea0703.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-cori-d8ea0703.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/it-s-all-one-to-me-06638eef.webp', '[\"it makes no difference\", \"I don\'t mind\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-cori-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru0-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru5-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru6-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru10-d8ea0703.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru9-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru3-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru7-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru8-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-aru2-d8ea0703.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-ljspeech-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt408-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt138-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt624-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt396-d8ea0703.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt498-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt132-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt288-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt42-d8ea0703.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/it-s-all-one-to-me-lt90-d8ea0703.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng trong văn nói để thể hiện sự dễ dãi, không kén chọn.', 'office', 1, 0),
('9ee37a84-bb98-57b8-8889-ea798ebf26d4', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'grasp all, lose all', '/ɡrɑːsp ɔːl luːz ɔːl/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Cố gắng đạt được quá nhiều có thể dẫn đến mất tất cả.', 'trying to get everything at once often results in ending up with nothing.', 'He tried to invest in every stock, but in the end, he learned that to grasp all is to lose all.', 'Anh ấy cố gắng đầu tư vào mọi cổ phiếu, nhưng cuối cùng, anh ấy đã học được rằng tham thì thâm.', '{\"en\": \"The manager warned the team that expanding into too many markets at once is a case of grasp all, lose all.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý cảnh báo nhóm rằng mở rộng sang quá nhiều thị trường cùng lúc là ví dụ điển hình của tham thì thâm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-ljspeech-3ff04635.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-cori-3ff04635.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/grasp-all-lose-all-e4daca59.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"learn that grasp all, lose all\", \"meaning\": \"nhận ra bài học tham thì thâm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a warning of grasp all, lose all\", \"meaning\": \"lời cảnh báo về sự tham lam\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-cori-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru0-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru5-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru6-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru10-3ff04635.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru9-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru3-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru7-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru8-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-aru2-3ff04635.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-ljspeech-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt408-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt138-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt624-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt396-3ff04635.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt498-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt132-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt288-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt42-3ff04635.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/grasp-all-lose-all-lt90-3ff04635.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương thành ngữ Việt \'tham thì thâm\'; dùng để cảnh báo sự tham lam trong kinh doanh.', 'business', 1, 1),
('f636f5ef-8935-5346-a3d3-de91e1be1743', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'to kill two birds with one stone', '/tə kɪl tuː bɜːdz wɪð wʌn stəʊn/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Hoàn thành hai việc cùng lúc bằng một hành động.', 'to achieve two different things at the same time using only one action.', 'By cycling to work, I kill two birds with one stone: I get exercise and save money on gas.', 'Bằng cách đạp xe đi làm, tôi một mũi tên trúng hai đích: vừa tập thể dục vừa tiết kiệm tiền xăng.', '{\"en\": \"By attending the conference in Tokyo, I can kill two birds with one stone and visit our clients.\", \"vi\": \"Bằng cách tham dự hội nghị ở Tokyo, tôi có thể một công đôi việc và ghé thăm các khách hàng của chúng tôi.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-ljspeech-86ede20d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-cori-86ede20d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-07b79b9a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-cori-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru0-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru5-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru6-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru10-86ede20d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru9-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru3-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru7-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru8-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-aru2-86ede20d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-ljspeech-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt408-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt138-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt624-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt396-86ede20d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt498-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt132-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt288-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt42-86ede20d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/to-kill-two-birds-with-one-stone-lt90-86ede20d.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này tương đương với \'một mũi tên trúng hai đích\' hoặc \'một công đôi việc\'.', 'business', 1, 2),
('3f2ef70c-a2cc-5576-bf8b-ee806d504266', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'for one thing', '/fə wʌn θɪŋ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Một lý do là; trước hết là.', 'used to give a first reason or example in talk.', 'I can\'t go to the party tonight; for one thing, I have to work early tomorrow.', 'Tối nay tôi không thể đi dự tiệc được; một lý do là tôi phải làm việc sớm vào ngày mai.', '{\"en\": \"We should cancel the meeting; for one thing, the client is abroad.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng ta nên hủy cuộc họp; trước hết, khách hàng đang ở nước ngoài.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-ljspeech-b142d363.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-cori-b142d363.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/for-one-thing-2073b134.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"for one thing, for another\", \"meaning\": \"một lý do là, lý do khác là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"say for one thing\", \"meaning\": \"nói rằng trước hết\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"for one reason\", \"note_vi\": \"for one reason không mang sắc thái liệt kê như for one thing\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-cori-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru0-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru5-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru6-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru10-b142d363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru9-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru3-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru7-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru8-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-aru2-b142d363.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-ljspeech-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt408-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt138-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt624-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt396-b142d363.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt498-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt132-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt288-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt42-b142d363.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/for-one-thing-lt90-b142d363.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng mở đầu nêu lý do, thường đi kèm for another.', 'office', 1, 3),
('81bb5a33-21dc-500e-87ec-1aa76283692d', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'have butterflies in one\'s stomach', '/hæv ˈbʌtəflaɪz ɪn wʌnz ˈstʌmək/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'cảm thấy lo lắng, bồn chồn', 'to feel very nervous or anxious about an upcoming event or situation.', 'Before her big presentation, she always has butterflies in her stomach.', 'Trước buổi thuyết trình quan trọng, cô ấy luôn cảm thấy bồn chồn.', '{\"en\": \"Many employees have butterflies in their stomach before the annual performance review meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Nhiều nhân viên cảm thấy lo lắng trước cuộc họp đánh giá hiệu suất hàng năm.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-ljspeech-ef4f2f36.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-cori-ef4f2f36.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-12a7607f.webp', '[\"nervous\", \"anxious\"]', '[\"calm\", \"relaxed\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-cori-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru0-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru5-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru6-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru10-ef4f2f36.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru9-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru3-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butterflies-in-one-s-stomach-aru7-ef4f2f36.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-butt