('cc209943-14f7-54aa-b935-f290f3988263', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'two securities are better than one', '/tuː sɪˈkjʊərɪtiz ɑː ˈbetə ðən wʌn/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Cẩn thận, chuẩn bị kỹ lưỡng thì tốt hơn.', 'it is safer to have more than one way to protect or secure something.', 'She always double-checks her work, believing that two securities are better than one when it comes to important documents.', 'Cô ấy luôn kiểm tra lại công việc của mình hai lần, tin rằng cẩn thận bao nhiêu cũng không thừa khi làm tài liệu quan trọng.', '{\"en\": \"We keep digital and paper backups because two securities are better than one for data.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi lưu bản sao kỹ thuật số và giấy vì cẩn thận vẫn hơn khi bảo mật dữ liệu.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-ljspeech-fa10a35c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-cori-fa10a35c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/two-securities-are-better-than-one-2bf24e6c.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-cori-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru0-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru5-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru6-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru10-fa10a35c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru9-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-better-than-one-aru3-fa10a35c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/two-securities-are-