('39f6a1e5-33fe-5a8a-87f2-f01b81559c94', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'there\'s no smoke without fire', '/ðeəz nəʊ sməʊk wɪˈðaʊt ˈfaɪə/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Chắc chắn có sự thật đằng sau những tin đồn.', 'unpleasant rumors usually have some truth behind them when people discuss them widely.', 'Even though he denied it, people still believed the rumors, thinking there\'s no smoke without fire.', 'Mặc dù anh ấy phủ nhận, mọi người vẫn tin vào những tin đồn, nghĩ rằng không có lửa thì làm sao có khói.', '{\"en\": \"The manager investigated the financial rumor because there\'s no smoke without fire.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý đã điều tra tin đồn tài chính vì không có lửa làm sao có khói.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-ljspeech-b3c69e2e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-cori-b3c69e2e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-6f9c6115.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"financial rumor\", \"meaning\": \"tin đồn tài chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"investigate allegations\", \"meaning\": \"điều tra các cáo buộc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-cori-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru0-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru5-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru6-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru10-b3c69e2e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru9-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/there-s-no-smoke-without-fire-aru3-b3c69e2e.mp3\", \"/sto