('99a351cb-d6b3-56fe-b7c4-d66f7a72141f', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'top dog', '/tɒp dɒɡ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Người quyền lực nhất hoặc thành công nhất trong một nhóm.', 'the person who has the most authority or is the most successful in a specific organization.', 'After years of hard work, he finally became the top dog in the company.', 'Sau nhiều năm làm việc chăm chỉ, cuối cùng anh ấy đã trở thành người đứng đầu công ty.', '{\"en\": \"After the promotion, she became the top dog responsible for all international marketing strategies.\", \"vi\": \"Sau khi được thăng chức, cô ấy trở thành người quyền lực nhất chịu trách nhiệm cho mọi chiến lược tiếp thị quốc tế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-ljspeech-13e28302.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-cori-13e28302.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/top-dog-149a1506.webp', '[\"leader\", \"boss\"]', '[\"subordinate\", \"underling\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"become the top dog\", \"meaning\": \"trở thành người đứng đầu\"}, {\"phrase\": \"remain the top dog\", \"meaning\": \"giữ vững vị trí dẫn đầu\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-cori-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru0-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru5-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru6-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru10-13e28302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru9-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru3-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru7-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru8-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-aru2-13e28302.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-ljspeech-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt408-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt138-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt624-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt396-13e28302.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt498-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt132-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt288-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt42-13e28302.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/top-dog-lt90-13e28302.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh cạnh tranh hoặc thăng tiến sự nghiệp.', 'business', 1, 17),
('5721f3f1-bf53-551d-9fc9-1c81d663e544', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'health is better than wealth', '/helθ ɪz ˈbetə ðæn welθ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Sức khỏe là điều quan trọng và quý giá hơn của cải vật chất.', 'it is more valuable to be healthy than to possess a lot of money.', 'After his serious illness, he truly understood that health is better than wealth.', 'Sau cơn bệnh nặng, anh ấy thực sự hiểu rằng sức khỏe quý hơn vàng.', '{\"en\": \"The CEO realized that health is better than wealth after working too many overtime hours.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành nhận ra sức khỏe quan trọng hơn tiền bạc sau khi làm thêm giờ quá nhiều.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-ljspeech-645bd001.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-cori-645bd001.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/health-is-better-than-wealth-2341c43a.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-cori-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru0-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru5-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru6-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru10-645bd001.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru9-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru3-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru7-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru8-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-aru2-645bd001.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-ljspeech-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt408-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt138-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt624-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt396-645bd001.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt498-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt132-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt288-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt42-645bd001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/health-is-better-than-wealth-lt90-645bd001.mp3\"]}}', 'Lời khuyên về việc ưu tiên sức khỏe hơn là kiếm tiền.', 'health', 1, 18),
('ed8a1283-27bc-5074-9d5e-66034204fa2f', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'a white lie', '/ə waɪt laɪ/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Lời nói dối vô hại, không gây tổn thương.', 'a small, harmless untruth told to avoid hurting someone\'s feelings or to be polite.', 'Mark opted to tell a white lie regarding his absence from the morning meeting.', 'Mark đã chọn nói một lời nói dối vô hại về sự vắng mặt của mình trong cuộc họp buổi sáng.', '{\"en\": \"The receptionist told a white lie to the client, saying the manager was in a meeting.\", \"vi\": \"Lễ tân nói dối vô hại với khách hàng rằng giám đốc đang họp.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-ljspeech-8d56aecf.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-cori-8d56aecf.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-white-lie-a58608ce.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"tell a white lie\", \"meaning\": \"nói một lời nói dối vô hại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"just a white lie\", \"meaning\": \"chỉ là lời nói dối nhỏ, vô hại\"}, {\"phrase\": \"a harmless white lie\", \"meaning\": \"lời nói dối hoàn toàn vô hại\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"lie\", \"note_vi\": \"\'lie\' đơn thuần mang nghĩa tiêu cực; \'white lie\' là nói dối thiện chí, không gây hại\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-cori-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru0-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru5-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru6-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru10-8d56aecf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru9-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru3-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru7-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru8-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-aru2-8d56aecf.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-ljspeech-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt408-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt138-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt624-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt396-8d56aecf.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt498-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt132-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt288-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt42-8d56aecf.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-white-lie-lt90-8d56aecf.mp3\"]}}', '\'White\' ở đây tượng trưng cho sự trong sáng, vô hại; đối lập với \'black lie\' là lời nói dối có hại.', 'office', 1, 19),
('08464168-6dc8-53c6-99d9-913a8fb390d8', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'a nine-to-five job', '/ə naɪn tə faɪv dʒɒb/', 'B1', 'phrase', 'Công việc văn phòng với giờ làm việc cố định.', 'a standard job with regular working hours, typically from morning until late afternoon every day.', 'After years of freelance work, she was looking forward to the stability of a nine-to-five job.', 'Sau nhiều năm làm việc tự do, cô ấy mong chờ sự ổn định của một công việc giờ hành chính.', '{\"en\": \"He decided to quit his freelance career to find a stable nine-to-five job in finance.\", \"vi\": \"Anh ấy quyết định từ bỏ công việc tự do để tìm một công việc văn phòng ổn định trong ngành tài chính.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-ljspeech-775b4f70.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-cori-775b4f70.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-nine-to-five-job-9fc7055c.webp', '[\"office job\", \"regular job\"]', '[\"freelance work\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"work a nine-to-five job\", \"meaning\": \"làm công việc giờ hành chính\"}, {\"phrase\": \"leave a nine-to-five job\", \"meaning\": \"từ bỏ công việc giờ hành chính\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-cori-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru0-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru5-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru6-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru10-775b4f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru9-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru3-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru7-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru8-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-aru2-775b4f70.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-ljspeech-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt408-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt138-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt624-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt396-775b4f70.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt498-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt132-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt288-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt42-775b4f70.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-nine-to-five-job-lt90-775b4f70.mp3\"]}}', 'Chỉ giờ làm việc truyền thống, không nhất thiết phải đúng 9 giờ sáng đến 5 giờ chiều.', 'office', 1, 20),
('dfaaee0f-6713-5181-b5e1-8b3e47da4001', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'blue blood', '/bluː blʌd/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Dòng dõi quý tộc, xuất thân cao quý.', 'noble or royal origins and membership in a high social class by birth.', 'Despite her blue blood, she prefers a simple lifestyle and avoids public attention.', 'Mặc dù mang dòng dõi quý tộc, cô ấy thích một lối sống giản dị và tránh sự chú ý của công chúng.', '{\"en\": \"The company invited several people of blue blood to attend the charity gala tonight.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty đã mời một số người thuộc dòng dõi quý tộc đến tham dự buổi dạ tiệc từ thiện tối nay.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-ljspeech-cf403d8e.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-cori-cf403d8e.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/blue-blood-06a6f02f.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"aristocratic background\", \"meaning\": \"thân thế quý tộc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"noble origin\", \"meaning\": \"nguồn gốc cao quý\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-cori-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru0-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru5-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru6-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru10-cf403d8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru9-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru3-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru7-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru8-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-aru2-cf403d8e.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-ljspeech-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt408-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt138-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt624-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt396-cf403d8e.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt498-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt132-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt288-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt42-cf403d8e.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/blue-blood-lt90-cf403d8e.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này xuất phát từ việc giới quý tộc Tây Ban Nha xưa có làn da trắng lộ gân xanh.', 'business', 1, 21),
('b182d9b1-3b39-5065-99e2-b6a50beaaa39', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'we have gone too far to draw back', '/wiː həv ɡɒn tuː fɑː tə drɔː bæk/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Đã đi quá xa để rút lui, phải tiếp tục làm điều đã bắt đầu.', 'so much progress has been made that stopping or changing course is impossible.', 'We\'ve invested too much in this project; we have gone too far to draw back now.', 'Chúng ta đã đầu tư quá nhiều vào dự án này; giờ thì đâm lao phải theo lao thôi.', '{\"en\": \"With contracts signed and funds allocated, we have gone too far to draw back.\", \"vi\": \"Với các hợp đồng đã ký và kinh phí đã cấp, chúng ta đã đi quá xa để rút lui.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-ljspeech-32460001.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-cori-32460001.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-181a9078.webp', '[\"point of no return\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-cori-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru0-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru5-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru6-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru10-32460001.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru9-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru3-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru7-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru8-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-aru2-32460001.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-ljspeech-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt408-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt138-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt624-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt396-32460001.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt498-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt132-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt288-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt42-32460001.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-have-gone-too-far-to-draw-back-lt90-32460001.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong các quyết định kinh doanh hoặc dự án lớn không thể hủy.', 'business', 1, 22),
('e069747e-0c04-511d-bacf-aaad378cc598', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', '8ae0f091-aa09-5b89-8182-9ae0d389096a', '094b43f4-8e7b-5841-95b2-264ed61984ab', 'green with envy', '/ɡriːn wɪð ˈɛnvi/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Rất ghen tị hoặc đố kỵ.', 'wishing very much that you had something that someone else has.', 'Several colleagues were green with envy after learning about her recent promotion.', 'Nhiều đồng nghiệp đã vô cùng ghen tị sau khi biết tin cô ấy được thăng chức gần đây.', '{\"en\": \"The competitors were green with envy when our company won the major contract.\", \"vi\": \"Các đối thủ cạnh tranh đã rất ghen tị khi công ty chúng tôi giành được hợp đồng lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-ljspeech-bdac766a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-cori-bdac766a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/green-with-envy-c846a39d.webp', '[\"jealous\", \"envious\", \"covetous\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"make someone green with envy\", \"meaning\": \"làm cho ai đó vô cùng ghen tị\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-cori-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru0-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru5-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru6-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru10-bdac766a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru9-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru3-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru7-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru8-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-aru2-bdac766a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-ljspeech-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt408-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt138-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt624-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt396-bdac766a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt498-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt132-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt288-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt42-bdac766a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/green-with-envy-lt90-bdac766a.mp3\"]}}', 'Màu xanh lá (green) trong văn hóa Anh-Mỹ thường liên quan đến sự đố kỵ, ghen ghét.', 'business', 1, 23),
('c5b3cf96-e2d9-5b3e-a5b3-7de71e530b65', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'put the cat among the pigeons', '/pʊt ðə kæt əˈmʌŋ ðə ˈpɪdʒɪnz/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Gây ra sự xáo trộn, tranh cãi hoặc rắc rối lớn.', 'to do or say something that causes trouble or makes people angry.', 'His unexpected resignation really put the cat among the pigeons in the department.', 'Việc ông ấy bất ngờ từ chức thực sự gây ra một mớ rắc rối lớn trong phòng ban.', '{\"en\": \"Announcing the salary cuts during the meeting really put the cat among the pigeons.\", \"vi\": \"Việc thông báo cắt giảm lương trong cuộc họp thực sự đã gây ra một làn sóng tranh cãi lớn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-ljspeech-0b769e6d.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-cori-0b769e6d.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-3019b7f5.webp', '[\"stir up a hornet\'s nest\", \"cause a stir\", \"make waves\"]', '[\"pour oil on troubled waters\", \"calm things down\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"put the cat among the pigeons\", \"meaning\": \"gây ra sự xáo trộn lớn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"really put the cat among the pigeons\", \"meaning\": \"thực sự gây ra tranh cãi lớn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"let the cat out of the bag\", \"note_vi\": \"Nghĩa là vô tình tiết lộ bí mật.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-cori-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru0-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru5-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru6-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru10-0b769e6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru9-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru3-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru7-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru8-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-aru2-0b769e6d.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-ljspeech-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt408-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt138-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt624-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt396-0b769e6d.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt498-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt132-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt288-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt42-0b769e6d.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-the-cat-among-the-pigeons-lt90-0b769e6d.mp3\"]}}', 'Tránh nhầm với \'let the cat out of the bag\' (tiết lộ bí mật).', 'hr', 1, 0),
('60e44d41-ff7e-5bae-869d-346fffafc207', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'an early bird', '/ən ˈɜːli bɜːd/', 'A2', 'idiom', 'Người dậy sớm hoặc đến sớm.', 'a person who wakes up or arrives before most other people do.', 'Being an early bird, the chief executive always arrives at the office before nine.', 'Là một người dậy sớm, giám đốc điều hành luôn đến văn phòng trước chín giờ.', '{\"en\": \"As an early bird, she always arrives at the office an hour before her colleagues.\", \"vi\": \"Là người dậy sớm, cô ấy luôn đến văn phòng trước đồng nghiệp một tiếng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-ljspeech-1cc6b36b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-cori-1cc6b36b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/an-early-bird-9e8cfb92.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"be an early bird\", \"meaning\": \"là người dậy sớm hoặc đến sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"early bird discount\", \"meaning\": \"ưu đãi cho người đăng ký/đặt sớm\"}, {\"phrase\": \"early bird registration\", \"meaning\": \"đăng ký sớm\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-cori-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru0-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru5-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru6-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru10-1cc6b36b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru9-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru3-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru7-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru8-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-aru2-1cc6b36b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-ljspeech-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt408-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt138-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt624-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt396-1cc6b36b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt498-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt132-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt288-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt42-1cc6b36b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/an-early-bird-lt90-1cc6b36b.mp3\"]}}', '\'Early bird discount\' rất hay xuất hiện trong đề TOEIC liên quan đến đặt phòng hoặc đăng ký hội nghị.', 'office', 1, 1),
('83ae93f2-a4e7-5aab-9485-26608fbdbe0f', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'we reap what we sow', '/wiː riːp wɒt wiː səʊ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Gieo nhân nào gặt quả nấy; hành động của chúng ta sẽ quyết định kết quả.', 'people\'s actions determine the consequences they eventually experience in life.', 'If you work hard and are kind to others, good things will come back to you, because we reap what we sow.', 'Nếu bạn làm việc chăm chỉ và tử tế với người khác, những điều tốt đẹp sẽ đến với bạn, bởi vì gieo nhân nào gặt quả nấy.', '{\"en\": \"The trainer said we reap what we sow in customer service quality.\", \"vi\": \"Người huấn luyện viên nói gieo nhân nào gặt quả nấy trong chất lượng dịch vụ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-ljspeech-f8aaae82.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-cori-f8aaae82.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/we-reap-what-we-sow-abf5a854.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"remember we reap what we sow\", \"meaning\": \"nhớ gieo nhân gặt quả\"}, {\"phrase\": \"we reap what we sow principle\", \"meaning\": \"nguyên tắc gieo nhân gặt quả\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-cori-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru0-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru5-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru6-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru10-f8aaae82.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru9-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru3-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru7-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru8-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-aru2-f8aaae82.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-ljspeech-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt408-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt138-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt624-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt396-f8aaae82.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt498-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt132-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt288-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt42-f8aaae82.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/we-reap-what-we-sow-lt90-f8aaae82.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này luôn ở dạng we reap what we sow, không đổi chủ ngữ.', 'business', 1, 2),
('29b37ebd-f906-5f7f-9229-7394293fa39c', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'a cold fish', '/ə kəʊld fɪʃ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Người lạnh nhạt, không biểu lộ cảm xúc, khó gần.', 'a person who does not show their feelings and seems unfriendly to other people around them.', 'He\'s a brilliant scientist but often comes across as a cold fish because he rarely smiles.', 'Anh ấy là một nhà khoa học lỗi lạc nhưng thường bị coi là người lạnh lùng vì anh ấy hiếm khi cười.', '{\"en\": \"The new manager is a cold fish who rarely interacts with staff during lunch breaks.\", \"vi\": \"Vị quản lý mới là một người lạnh nhạt, hiếm khi tương tác với nhân viên trong giờ nghỉ trưa.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-ljspeech-1f7b3d2c.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-cori-1f7b3d2c.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-cold-fish-eba44ead.webp', '[\"aloof\", \"unemotional\"]', '[\"warm-hearted\", \"friendly\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"act like a cold fish\", \"meaning\": \"cư xử lạnh lùng\"}, {\"phrase\": \"seem like a cold fish\", \"meaning\": \"có vẻ là người khó gần\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-cori-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru0-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru5-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru6-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru10-1f7b3d2c.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru9-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru3-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru7-1f7b3d2c.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-cold-fish-aru8-1f7b3d2c.