('ad7d63f3-4294-5136-9a87-45a83dae50da', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'ten to one', '/ten tə wʌn/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Rất có khả năng, gần như chắc chắn.', 'it is very probable or likely that something will happen soon.', 'Ten to one, he\'ll be late for the meeting as usual.', 'Rất có thể là anh ấy sẽ đến muộn cuộc họp như mọi khi.', '{\"en\": \"Ten to one, our company will win the contract for this building.\", \"vi\": \"Rất có khả năng công ty chúng ta sẽ giành được hợp đồng cho tòa nhà này.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-ljspeech-58f425fb.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-cori-58f425fb.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/ten-to-one-a0fd9096.webp', '[\"very likely\", \"most probably\"]', '[\"unlikely\", \"improbably\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"ten to one that\", \"meaning\": \"rất có thể là\"}, {\"phrase\": \"it is ten to one\", \"meaning\": \"khả năng rất cao là\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-cori-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru0-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru5-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru6-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru10-58f425fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru9-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru3-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru7-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru8-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-aru2-58f425fb.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-ljspeech-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt408-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt138-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt624-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt396-58f425fb.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt498-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt132-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt288-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt42-58f425fb.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/ten-to-one-lt90-58f425fb.mp3\"]}}', 'Mô phỏng tỷ lệ cá cược 10 ăn 1 để chỉ khả năng xảy ra rất cao.', 'business', 1, 7),
('775127ae-0545-5a01-8f52-ce693d27e297', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'slow and sure', '/sləʊ ən ʃɔː/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Chậm rãi nhưng vững chắc và thành công.', 'happening in a careful and gradual way that will definitely bring success.', 'Building a strong foundation for your business requires a slow and sure approach.', 'Xây dựng một nền tảng vững chắc cho doanh nghiệp của bạn đòi hỏi một cách tiếp cận chậm mà chắc.', '{\"en\": \"The marketing team adopted a slow and sure strategy to build brand awareness over time.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ tiếp thị đã áp dụng một chiến lược chậm mà chắc để xây dựng nhận thức về thương hiệu theo thời gian.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-ljspeech-3b2390c1.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-cori-3b2390c1.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/slow-and-sure-7edcde37.webp', '[\"steady\", \"gradual\", \"methodical\"]', '[\"hasty\", \"rushed\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a slow and sure approach\", \"meaning\": \"cách tiếp cận chậm mà chắc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"slow and sure progress\", \"meaning\": \"tiến độ chậm mà chắc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-cori-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru0-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru5-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru6-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru10-3b2390c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru9-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru3-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru7-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru8-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-aru2-3b2390c1.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-ljspeech-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt408-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt138-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt624-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt396-3b2390c1.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt498-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt132-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt288-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt42-3b2390c1.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/slow-and-sure-lt90-3b2390c1.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng để khuyên ai đó không nên vội vàng trong công việc.', 'business', 1, 8),
('f11d13d3-2fe1-53f6-97b7-49cbf7b7858c', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'early bird catches the worm', '/ˈɜːli bɜːd ˈkætʃɪz ðə wɜːm/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Người nhanh nhẹn, đến sớm sẽ có lợi thế.', 'a person who acts promptly or arrives first will gain an advantage over others.', 'If you want to get the best seats at the concert, remember that the early bird catches the worm.', 'Nếu bạn muốn có được những chỗ ngồi tốt nhất ở buổi hòa nhạc, hãy nhớ rằng nhanh chân thì được việc.', '{\"en\": \"The candidate submitted his application first because the early bird catches the worm.\", \"vi\": \"Ứng viên đã nộp hồ sơ đầu tiên vì người đến sớm luôn có lợi thế.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-ljspeech-76dc62dd.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-cori-76dc62dd.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/early-bird-catches-the-worm-e5e450a8.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"take advantage of\", \"meaning\": \"tận dụng lợi thế\"}, {\"phrase\": \"gain an advantage\", \"meaning\": \"có được lợi thế\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-cori-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru0-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru5-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru6-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru10-76dc62dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru9-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru3-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru7-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru8-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-aru2-76dc62dd.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-ljspeech-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt408-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt138-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt624-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt396-76dc62dd.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt498-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt132-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt288-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt42-76dc62dd.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/early-bird-catches-the-worm-lt90-76dc62dd.mp3\"]}}', 'Cụm này dùng để nhắc nhở việc chủ động và chuẩn bị sớm trong công việc.', 'hr', 1, 9),
('e2f251ec-9442-515f-b558-2f51c015fd55', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'half a loaf is better than no bread', '/hɑːf ə ləʊf ɪz bɛtə ðæn nəʊ brɛd/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Có được một phần vẫn tốt hơn là không có gì cả.', 'used to say that getting part of what you want is preferable to receiving nothing.', 'I didn\'t get the full bonus, but **half a loaf is better than no bread**, so I\'m still happy.', 'Tôi không nhận được toàn bộ tiền thưởng, nhưng có còn hơn không, nên tôi vẫn vui.', '{\"en\": \"We only received half the requested budget, but half a loaf is better than no bread.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi chỉ nhận được một nửa ngân sách yêu cầu, nhưng có còn hơn không.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-ljspeech-ae73d59b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-cori-ae73d59b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-25912c16.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-cori-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru0-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru5-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru6-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru10-ae73d59b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru9-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru3-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru7-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru8-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-aru2-ae73d59b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-ljspeech-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt408-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt138-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt624-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt396-ae73d59b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt498-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt132-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt288-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt42-ae73d59b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/half-a-loaf-is-better-than-no-bread-lt90-ae73d59b.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ thể hiện sự chấp nhận kết quả chưa hoàn hảo vì tốt hơn là thất bại hoàn toàn.', 'business', 1, 10),
('851e4091-7fbc-563a-abab-ea1b8294accb', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'be in the black', '/biː ɪn ðə blæk/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Có lợi nhuận, không bị thua lỗ.', 'to be in a financial situation where a business is making more money than it spends.', 'After years of struggling, the company is finally in the black and showing a profit.', 'Sau nhiều năm chật vật, công ty cuối cùng đã có lãi và đang cho thấy lợi nhuận.', '{\"en\": \"The startup finally managed to be in the black after securing a major government contract.\", \"vi\": \"Công ty khởi nghiệp cuối cùng đã có lãi sau khi giành được một hợp đồng lớn của chính phủ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-ljspeech-dcdb2850.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-cori-dcdb2850.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/be-in-the-black-e4a027ea.webp', '[\"profitable\", \"making money\"]', '[\"in the red\", \"losing money\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"be in the black\", \"meaning\": \"có lãi\"}, {\"phrase\": \"stay in the black\", \"meaning\": \"duy trì lợi nhuận\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"in the red\", \"note_vi\": \"trái nghĩa, chỉ tình trạng thua lỗ, nợ nần.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-cori-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru0-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru5-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru6-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru10-dcdb2850.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru9-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru3-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru7-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru8-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-aru2-dcdb2850.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-ljspeech-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt408-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt138-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt624-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt396-dcdb2850.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt498-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt132-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt288-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt42-dcdb2850.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/be-in-the-black-lt90-dcdb2850.mp3\"]}}', 'Gốc từ việc kế toán dùng mực đen để ghi lợi nhuận.', 'finance', 1, 11),
('5d81a2cf-32d8-5a78-96a1-48d781480efa', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'have got green fingers', '/həv ɡɒt ɡriːn ˈfɪŋɡəz/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Mát tay trong việc làm vườn, trồng cây.', 'to have a natural ability to make plants grow well in a garden.', 'My grandmother can grow anything; she truly has got green fingers.', 'Bà tôi có thể trồng bất cứ thứ gì; bà thật sự rất mát tay.', '{\"en\": \"The office manager has got green fingers, so the lobby plants always look healthy and vibrant.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý văn phòng rất mát tay trong việc trồng cây, nên các chậu cây ở sảnh luôn trông khỏe mạnh và tươi tốt.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-ljspeech-0582480a.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-cori-0582480a.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/have-got-green-fingers-630ccd42.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"have green fingers\", \"meaning\": \"mát tay trồng cây\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-cori-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru0-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru5-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru6-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru10-0582480a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru9-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru3-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru7-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru8-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-aru2-0582480a.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-ljspeech-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt408-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt138-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt624-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt396-0582480a.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt498-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt132-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt288-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt42-0582480a.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/have-got-green-fingers-lt90-0582480a.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này chỉ kỹ năng chăm sóc cây cối, không liên quan đến ngón tay thật.', 'housing', 1, 12),
('8119a50c-d2bc-5686-b37c-e607fd86ed9b', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'tell me the company you keep, and i will tell you what you see', '/tel miː ðə ˈkʌmpəni jə kiːp ən aɪ wɪl tel jə wɒt jə siː/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Bạn bè mà bạn kết giao sẽ phản ánh tính cách của bạn.', 'the type of people you spend time with reveals your true personal character.', 'My grandmother always used to say, \"Tell me the company you keep, and I will tell you what you see,\" reminding me to choose my friends wisely.', 'Bà tôi vẫn thường nói, \"Hãy cho tôi biết bạn chơi với ai, tôi sẽ nói cho bạn biết bạn là người như thế nào,\" nhắc nhở tôi chọn bạn bè một cách khôn ngoan.', '{\"en\": \"When selecting corporate partners, remember tell me the company you keep, and I will tell you what you see.\", \"vi\": \"Khi chọn đối tác doanh nghiệp, hãy nhớ rằng bạn bè bạn kết giao sẽ phản ánh con người bạn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-ljspeech-3f7f3502.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-cori-3f7f3502.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-595c2461.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"business partner\", \"meaning\": \"đối tác kinh doanh\"}, {\"phrase\": \"choose carefully\", \"meaning\": \"lựa chọn cẩn thận\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-cori-3f7f3502.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-aru0-3f7f3502.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-aru5-3f7f3502.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/p