l-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-lt42-3f7f3502.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/tell-me-the-company-you-keep-and-i-will-tell-you-what-you-see-lt90-3f7f3502.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này nhấn mạnh tầm quan trọng của việc lựa chọn bạn bè và đối tác.', 'business', 1, 13),
('4c3f0680-ee1c-53be-babf-e934bacefaca', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'beauty is only skin-deep', '/ˈbjuːti ɪz ˈəʊnli ˈskɪn diːp/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Vẻ đẹp bên ngoài không quan trọng bằng phẩm chất bên trong.', 'a person\'s outer appearance does not show their true character or value inside.', 'She learned that true happiness comes from kindness, not just looks, because beauty is only skin-deep.', 'Cô ấy nhận ra rằng hạnh phúc đích thực đến từ sự tử tế, chứ không chỉ vẻ bề ngoài, vì cái đẹp chỉ là phù du.', '{\"en\": \"When hiring a manager, remember that beauty is only skin-deep; leadership skills matter more.\", \"vi\": \"Khi tuyển dụng quản lý, hãy nhớ rằng ngoại hình không quan trọng bằng năng lực lãnh đạo.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-ljspeech-b4ee3d8b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-cori-b4ee3d8b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-f8ed83ea.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"inner qualities\", \"meaning\": \"phẩm chất bên trong\"}, {\"phrase\": \"outer appearance\", \"meaning\": \"vẻ ngoài\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-cori-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru0-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru5-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru6-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru10-b4ee3d8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru9-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru3-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru7-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru8-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-aru2-b4ee3d8b.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-ljspeech-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt408-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt138-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt624-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt396-b4ee3d8b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt498-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt132-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt288-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt42-b4ee3d8b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/beauty-is-only-skin-deep-lt90-b4ee3d8b.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để khuyên không nên đánh giá đối tác hay ứng viên chỉ qua vẻ bề ngoài.', 'hr', 1, 14),
('1da39d9a-0cc6-5ff2-932f-44a6460efbde', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'a dog\'s life', '/ə dɒɡz laɪf/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Một cuộc sống khó khăn, khốn khổ và không hạnh phúc.', 'an unpleasant existence filled with severe difficulties, heavy work, and unhappiness.', 'After losing his job, he felt like he was living a dog\'s life, struggling to make ends meet.', 'Sau khi mất việc, anh ấy cảm thấy mình đang sống một kiếp sống chó, chật vật để kiếm sống.', '{\"en\": \"Working sixty hours a week without overtime pay made him feel like leading a dog\'s life.\", \"vi\": \"Làm việc 60 giờ một tuần mà không có tiền tăng ca khiến anh cảm thấy cuộc sống quá khốn khổ.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-ljspeech-de5c95e5.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-cori-de5c95e5.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-dog-s-life-84588dba.webp', '[\"hardship\", \"misery\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"lead a dog\'s life\", \"meaning\": \"sống một cuộc đời khổ cực\"}, {\"phrase\": \"live a dog\'s life\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua kiếp sống khốn khổ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-cori-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru0-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru5-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru6-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru10-de5c95e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru9-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru3-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru7-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru8-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-aru2-de5c95e5.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-ljspeech-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt408-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt138-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt624-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt396-de5c95e5.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt498-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt132-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt288-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt42-de5c95e5.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-dog-s-life-lt90-de5c95e5.mp3\"]}}', 'Bản thân là thành ngữ mô tả cuộc sống làm việc cực nhọc, vất vả.', 'office', 1, 15),
('f5ca8b62-9fd7-53d5-aab7-a13c7d737556', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'at one time', '/æt wʌn taɪm/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Trong quá khứ, đã từng có lúc.', 'used to describe something that happened or existed during a period in the past.', 'At one time, this small town was a bustling port city.', 'Đã từng có lúc, thị trấn nhỏ này là một thành phố cảng sầm uất.', '{\"en\": \"At one time, our department was the largest in the company before the recent restructuring.\", \"vi\": \"Đã từng có lúc, phòng ban của chúng tôi là lớn nhất công ty trước đợt tái cơ cấu gần đây.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-ljspeech-ffb27126.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-cori-ffb27126.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/at-one-time-8875e3cc.webp', '[\"formerly\", \"previously\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"at one time or another\", \"meaning\": \"đã từng có lúc\"}, {\"phrase\": \"at the same time\", \"meaning\": \"cùng một lúc\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-cori-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru0-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru5-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru6-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru10-ffb27126.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru9-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru3-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru7-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru8-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-aru2-ffb27126.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-ljspeech-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt408-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt138-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt624-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt396-ffb27126.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt498-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt132-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt288-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt42-ffb27126.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/at-one-time-lt90-ffb27126.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để kể về quá khứ, không dùng cho hiện tại.', 'business', 1, 16),
('2b895124-9d03-55b3-9a88-5de2f9f3da62', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'put two and two together', '/pʊt tuː ən tuː təˈɡeðə/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Rút ra kết luận hợp lý từ những thông tin có sẵn.', 'to guess the truth about a situation from what you have seen or heard.', 'When she saw the flowers and the empty box of chocolates, she put two and two together and realized he had been there.', 'Khi cô ấy thấy những bông hoa và hộp sô cô la rỗng, cô ấy đã suy luận ra và nhận ra anh ta đã ở đó.', '{\"en\": \"The client put two and two together after seeing the sudden price drop.\", \"vi\": \"Khách hàng đã tự suy ra sự thật sau khi nhìn thấy giá giảm đột ngột.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-ljspeech-f70e56b0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-cori-f70e56b0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/put-two-and-two-together-24298912.webp', '[\"deduce\", \"infer\", \"conclude\"]', NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"put two and two together and make five\", \"meaning\": \"suy đoán sai lầm từ các dữ kiện\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-cori-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru0-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru5-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru6-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru10-f70e56b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru9-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru3-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru7-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru8-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-aru2-f70e56b0.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-ljspeech-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt408-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt138-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt624-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt396-f70e56b0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt498-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt132-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt288-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt42-f70e56b0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/put-two-and-two-together-lt90-f70e56b0.mp3\"]}}', 'Nghĩa đen là cộng 2 với 2, nghĩa bóng là xâu chuỗi các sự kiện để rút ra kết luận.', 'business', 1, 17),
('cfe45fa6-aae2-5c37-9726-71f02a04bdff', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'one of those days', '/wʌn əv ðəʊz deɪz/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Một ngày mà mọi thứ đều không suôn sẻ, gặp nhiều rắc rối.', 'a day when many unpleasant or annoying things happen to someone in a short time.', 'My car broke down, and I spilled coffee on my shirt – it\'s just one of those days.', 'Xe của tôi bị hỏng, rồi tôi làm đổ cà phê lên áo – đúng là một ngày xui xẻo.', '{\"en\": \"I apologize for the delay, but it has been one of those days at the office.\", \"vi\": \"Tôi xin lỗi vì sự chậm trễ, nhưng hôm nay là một ngày đầy rắc rối tại văn phòng.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-ljspeech-243a75ef.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-cori-243a75ef.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/one-of-those-days-6a14a3e0.webp', '[\"bad day\", \"rough day\"]', '[\"productive day\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"have one of those days\", \"meaning\": \"trải qua một ngày tồi tệ\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-cori-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru0-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru5-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru6-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru10-243a75ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru9-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru3-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru7-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru8-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-aru2-243a75ef.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-ljspeech-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt408-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt138-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt624-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt396-243a75ef.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt498-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt132-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt288-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt42-243a75ef.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-of-those-days-lt90-243a75ef.mp3\"]}}', 'Dùng để giải thích lý do khi làm việc không hiệu quả.', 'daily', 1, 18),
('6b246744-6b3d-5b03-b696-5adfc113aed9', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'where there is a will, there is a way', '/weə ðeə ɪz ə wɪl ðeə ɪz ə weɪ/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Nếu có quyết tâm, sẽ tìm được cách để thành công.', 'people with strong determination can always find a solution to overcome any difficulty.', 'Even though the task was difficult, she believed that where there is a will, there is a way.', 'Mặc dù nhiệm vụ khó khăn, cô ấy tin rằng có chí thì nên.', '{\"en\": \"Our sales team proved that where there is a will, there is a way.\", \"vi\": \"Đội ngũ kinh doanh của chúng tôi đã chứng minh rằng có chí thì nên.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-ljspeech-1ad2baa8.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-cori-1ad2baa8.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-66cfb706.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-cori-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru0-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru5-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru6-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru10-1ad2baa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru9-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru3-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru7-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru8-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-aru2-1ad2baa8.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-ljspeech-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt408-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt138-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt624-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt396-1ad2baa8.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt498-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt132-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt288-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt42-1ad2baa8.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/where-there-is-a-will-there-is-a-way-lt90-1ad2baa8.mp3\"]}}', 'Tương đương câu tục ngữ \'Có chí thì nên\' trong tiếng Việt.', 'business', 1, 19),
('4cf9c6cf-5224-58d6-94d7-14226d1ab33d', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'a black look', '/ə blæk lʊk/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Cái nhìn giận dữ, trừng mắt.', 'an angry expression shown by staring fiercely at another person.', 'When I made a sarcastic comment, she gave me a black look that made me regret it instantly.', 'Khi tôi nói một câu châm biếm, cô ấy trừng mắt nhìn tôi khiến tôi hối hận ngay lập tức.', '{\"en\": \"The supervisor gave a black look when the clerk made a careless error.\", \"vi\": \"Người giám sát trừng mắt khi nhân viên mắc lỗi bất cẩn.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-ljspeech-2b4cbfa0.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-cori-2b4cbfa0.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-black-look-96f836e3.webp', NULL, NULL, '[{\"phrase\": \"give a black look\", \"meaning\": \"trừng mắt nhìn\"}, {\"phrase\": \"get a black look\", \"meaning\": \"bị trừng mắt nhìn\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"black book\", \"note_vi\": \"black book là sổ ghi tên xấu, không phải cái nhìn\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-cori-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru0-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru5-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru6-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru10-2b4cbfa0.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru9-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru3-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru7-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru8-2b4cbfa0.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-look-aru2-2b