('30c67984-3894-5da4-9f6d-f215a302ac65', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'so many men, so many minds', '/səʊ ˈmɛni ˈmɛn səʊ ˈmɛni ˈmaɪndz/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Mỗi người có một ý kiến, suy nghĩ khác nhau.', 'people have different opinions and ideas about the same thing.', 'We couldn\'t agree on the plan; it\'s a case of so many men, so many minds.', 'Chúng tôi không thể thống nhất về kế hoạch; đúng là mỗi người một ý.', '{\"en\": \"We cannot agree on the new marketing plan because so many men, so many minds.\", \"vi\": \"Chúng tôi không thể thống nhất về kế hoạch tiếp thị mới vì mỗi người một ý.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-ljspeech-d5a8f7aa.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-cori-d5a8f7aa.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/so-many-men-so-many-minds-47bee662.webp', '[\"to each his own\", \"different strokes for different folks\"]', '[\"great minds think alike\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a case of so many men, so many minds\", \"meaning\": \"trường hợp chín người mười ý\"}, {\"phrase\": \"prove that so many men, so many minds\", \"meaning\": \"chứng minh chín người mười ý\"}]', '[{\"word\": \"many men, many minds\", \"note_vi\": \"Cách viết ngắn gọn hơn nhưng cùng ý nghĩa.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-cori-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru0-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru5-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru6-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru10-d5a8f7aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru9-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru3-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru7-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru8-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-aru2-d5a8f7aa.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-ljspeech-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt408-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt138-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt624-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt396-d5a8f7aa.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt498-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt132-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt288-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt42-d5a8f7aa.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/so-many-men-so-many-minds-lt90-d5a8f7aa.mp3\"]}}', 'Thành ngữ này tương đương với câu thành ngữ tiếng Việt chín người mười ý.', 'office', 1, 21),
('d0414171-b0c8-5ae4-bbf1-33a6d631f51c', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'one and the same', '/wʌn ən ðə seɪm/', 'B2', 'idiom', 'Là một, giống hệt nhau, không khác biệt.', 'referring to a single person or thing rather than two different ones.', 'Many people believe that true love and deep friendship are one and the same.', 'Nhiều người tin rằng tình yêu đích thực và tình bạn sâu sắc là một.', '{\"en\": \"The head officer and the main shareholder turned out to be one and the same.\", \"vi\": \"Giám đốc điều hành và cổ đông chính hóa ra lại là cùng một người.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-ljspeech-1beb85b9.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-cori-1beb85b9.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/one-and-the-same-49418f35.webp', '[\"identical\", \"indistinguishable\"]', '[\"distinct\", \"different\"]', NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-cori-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru0-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru5-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru6-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru10-1beb85b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru9-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru3-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru7-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru8-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-aru2-1beb85b9.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-ljspeech-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt408-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt138-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt624-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt396-1beb85b9.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt498-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt132-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt288-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt42-1beb85b9.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/one-and-the-same-lt90-1beb85b9.mp3\"]}}', 'Nhấn mạnh sự đồng nhất hoàn toàn giữa hai đối tượng tưởng là khác nhau.', 'business', 1, 22),
('1c141d08-cefc-5852-bdfe-6bdcbe8a6200', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'a lame duck', '/ə leɪm dʌk/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'người hoặc vật yếu kém, không hiệu quả', 'a person, company, or organization that is weak, unsuccessful, and needs help.', 'The outgoing president was considered a lame duck in his final months in office.', 'Vị tổng thống mãn nhiệm bị coi là một người yếu kém trong những tháng cuối nhiệm kỳ.', '{\"en\": \"Without a major government bailout, the struggling airline will become a lame duck.\", \"vi\": \"Nếu không có gói cứu trợ lớn từ chính phủ, hãng hàng không đang gặp khó khăn sẽ trở nên bất lực.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-ljspeech-b0bf60b2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-cori-b0bf60b2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-lame-duck-f1ef4a43.webp', '[\"underperformer\", \"failure\"]', '[\"success\", \"winner\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"a lame duck president\", \"meaning\": \"tổng thống sắp mãn nhiệm (ít quyền lực)\"}, {\"phrase\": \"support a lame duck company\", \"meaning\": \"hỗ trợ một công ty yếu kém\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-cori-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru0-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru5-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru6-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru10-b0bf60b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru9-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru3-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru7-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru8-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-aru2-b0bf60b2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-ljspeech-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt408-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt138-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt624-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt396-b0bf60b2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt498-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt132-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt288-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt42-b0bf60b2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-lame-duck-lt90-b0bf60b2.mp3\"]}}', 'Trong chính trị, cụm này chỉ người đương nhiệm sắp hết nhiệm kỳ và không còn nhiều quyền lực.', 'business', 1, 23),
('11be44cf-4419-5ede-b733-cbf72439a35a', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'traveling forms a young man', '/ˈtræv.əl.ɪŋ fɔːmz ə jʌŋ mæn/', 'C2', 'idiom', 'Đi nhiều nơi giúp người trẻ trưởng thành, học hỏi được nhiều điều mới.', 'going to different places helps a person gain experience and develop maturity.', 'My parents always encouraged me to explore the world, believing that **traveling forms a young man**.', 'Bố mẹ tôi luôn khuyến khích tôi khám phá thế giới, tin rằng đi nhiều nơi sẽ giúp người trẻ trưởng thành.', '{\"en\": \"Our manager often encourages new recruits to work abroad, believing that traveling forms a young man.\", \"vi\": \"Quản lý của chúng tôi thường khuyến khích nhân viên mới đi làm việc ở nước ngoài, tin rằng đi nhiều nơi giúp người trẻ trưởng thành.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-ljspeech-faae9d2b.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-cori-faae9d2b.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/traveling-forms-a-young-man-e3db087e.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-cori-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru0-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru5-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru6-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru10-faae9d2b.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru9-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru3-faae9d2b.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/traveling-forms-a-young-man-aru7-faae9d