('ecde177b-33c5-52e7-8516-04c7c04db304', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'take the bull by the horns', '/teɪk ðə bʊl baɪ ðə hɔːnz/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Đối mặt trực tiếp và quyết đoán với một vấn đề khó khăn.', 'to deal with a difficult situation directly and with great courage or determination.', 'Instead of procrastinating, she decided to take the bull by the horns and finish her challenging assignment.', 'Thay vì chần chừ, cô ấy quyết định đối mặt trực tiếp và hoàn thành nhiệm vụ khó khăn của mình.', '{\"en\": \"The team leader decided to take the bull by the horns and address the budget deficit.\", \"vi\": \"Trưởng nhóm quyết định đối mặt trực tiếp và giải quyết vấn đề thâm hụt ngân sách.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-ljspeech-48651f58.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-cori-48651f58.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-9c83db02.webp', '[\"confront\", \"tackle\"]', '[\"avoid\", \"procrastinate\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"face a problem\", \"meaning\": \"đối mặt vấn đề\"}, {\"phrase\": \"take action\", \"meaning\": \"hành động\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-cori-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru0-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru5-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru6-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru10-48651f58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru9-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru3-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru7-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru8-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-aru2-48651f58.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-ljspeech-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt408-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt138-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt624-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt396-48651f58.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt498-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt132-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt288-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt42-48651f58.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/take-the-bull-by-the-horns-lt90-48651f58.mp3\"]}}', 'Hình ảnh ẩn dụ về việc nắm lấy sừng bò để khống chế nó.', 'business', 1, 25),
('d379f6f6-5ca0-5c0e-b760-ba3faed02811', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'a black list', '/ə blæk lɪst/', 'B1', 'idiom', 'Danh sách những người hoặc vật bị cấm, không được chấp thuận.', 'a record of people or things that are not allowed or are considered to be bad.', 'After the scandal, his name was put on a black list, making it hard for him to find work in the industry.', 'Sau vụ bê bối, tên anh ấy bị đưa vào danh sách đen, khiến anh khó tìm việc trong ngành.', '{\"en\": \"The security manager added the suspicious visitor to a black list to prevent future unauthorized entry.\", \"vi\": \"Người quản lý an ninh đã thêm vị khách khả nghi vào danh sách đen để ngăn chặn việc xâm nhập trái phép trong tương lai.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-ljspeech-92ec8ee2.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-cori-92ec8ee2.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/a-black-list-d09b6c1d.webp', '[\"banned list\", \"restricted list\"]', '[\"whitelist\"]', '[{\"phrase\": \"on a black list\", \"meaning\": \"nằm trong danh sách đen\"}, {\"phrase\": \"put on a black list\", \"meaning\": \"đưa vào danh sách đen\"}]', NULL, NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-cori-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru0-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru5-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru6-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru10-92ec8ee2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru9-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru3-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru7-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru8-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-aru2-92ec8ee2.mp3\"]}, \"us\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-ljspeech-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt408-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt138-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt624-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt396-92ec8ee2.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt498-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt132-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt288-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt42-92ec8ee2.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/a-black-list-lt90-92ec8ee2.mp3\"]}}', 'Thường dùng trong ngữ cảnh từ chối dịch vụ hoặc cấm truy cập.', 'office', 1, 26),
('92f57039-05c1-53c9-83ef-d58ad34de567', '8fced3bb-45a1-57af-8779-671e054c5c68', 'a34751d7-f1e0-5df0-a527-884fc6b1d2a2', '47174869-9710-5cfe-8204-c0600d6e6aff', 'nothing venture, nothing win', '/ˈnʌθɪŋ ˈvɛntʃə ˈnʌθɪŋ ˈwɪn/', 'C1', 'idiom', 'Không mạo hiểm thì không thể đạt được thành công lớn.', 'you cannot achieve anything important or successful unless you take risks.', 'If you want to achieve great things, remember: nothing venture, nothing win.', 'Nếu bạn muốn đạt được những điều lớn lao, hãy nhớ: không mạo hiểm thì không thành công.', '{\"en\": \"Investing in the startup is risky, but the director believes that nothing venture, nothing win.\", \"vi\": \"Đầu tư vào công ty khởi nghiệp là rủi ro, nhưng giám đốc tin rằng không vào hang cọp sao bắt được cọp con.\"}', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-ljspeech-3191cf39.mp3', 'https://byetoeic.com/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-cori-3191cf39.mp3', 'https://cdn.byetoeic.com/vocabulary-images/words/nothing-venture-nothing-win-0ca7c9b5.webp', '[\"nothing ventured, nothing gained\", \"no pain, no gain\"]', NULL, NULL, '[{\"word\": \"nothing ventured, nothing gained\", \"note_vi\": \"Đây là biến thể phổ biến hơn của thành ngữ này.\"}]', NULL, '{\"uk\": {\"nu\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-cori-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru0-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru5-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru6-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru10-3191cf39.mp3\"], \"nam\": [\"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru9-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/storage/v1/object/public/pronunciation/v2/nothing-venture-nothing-win-aru3-3191cf39.mp3\", \"/stor